  text = {
    ["80:446b"] = "ELM: {PLAYER}!\nThere you are!\fI needed to ask\nyou a favor.\fI'm conducting new\nPOKéMON research\fright now. I was\nwondering if you\fcould help me with\nit, {PLAYER}.{DONE}",
    ["80:44fc"] = "Thanks, {PLAYER}!\fYou're a great\nhelp!{DONE}",
    ["80:451c"] = "But… Please, I\nneed your help!{DONE}",
    ["80:453c"] = "When I announce my\nfindings, I'm sure\fwe'll delve a bit\ndeeper into the\fmany mysteries of\nPOKéMON.\fYou can count on\nit!{DONE}",
    ["80:45b0"] = "Oh, hey! I got an\ne-mail!\f………………\nHm… Uh-huh…\fOkay…{DONE}",
    ["80:45e1"] = "Hey, listen.\fI have an acquain-\ntance called MR.\vPOKéMON.\fAnyway, I just got\nan e-mail from him\fsaying that this\ntime it's real.\fIt is intriguing,\nbut we're busy\fwith our POKéMON\nresearch…\fWait!\fI know!\f{PLAYER}, can you\ngo in our place?{DONE}",
    ["80:46c1"] = "I want you to\nraise one of the\fPOKéMON contained\nin these BALLS.\fYou'll be that\nPOKéMON's first\vpartner, {PLAYER}!\fGo on. Pick one!{DONE}",
    ["80:4737"] = "If a wild POKéMON\nappears, let your\vPOKéMON battle it!{DONE}",
    ["80:4769"] = "ELM: Wait! Where\nare you going?{DONE}",
    ["80:478a"] = "ELM: You'll take\nCYNDAQUIL, the\vfire POKéMON?{DONE}",
    ["80:47b5"] = "ELM: Do you want\nTOTODILE, the\vwater POKéMON?{DONE}",
    ["80:47e1"] = "ELM: So, you like\nCHIKORITA, the\vgrass POKéMON?{DONE}",
    ["80:480f"] = "ELM: Think it over\ncarefully.\fYour partner is\nimportant.{DONE}",
    ["80:4849"] = "ELM: I think\nthat's a great\vPOKéMON too!{DONE}",
    ["80:486f"] = "{PLAYER} received\n{STRBUF}!{DONE}",
    ["80:4882"] = "MR.POKéMON lives a\nlittle bit beyond\fCHERRYGROVE, the\nnext city over.\fIt's almost a\ndirect route\fthere, so you\ncan't miss it.\fBut just in case,\nhere's my phone\fnumber. Call me if\nanything comes up!{DONE}",
    ["80:4943"] = "If your POKéMON is\nhurt, you should\fheal it with this\nmachine.{DONE}",
    ["80:4980"] = "{PLAYER}, I'm\ncounting on you!{DONE}",
    ["80:4998"] = "{PLAYER} got ELM's\nphone number.{DONE}",
    ["80:49b2"] = "MR.POKéMON goes\neverywhere and\vfinds rarities.\fToo bad they're\njust rare and\vnot very useful…{DONE}",
    ["80:4a0d"] = "It contains a\nPOKéMON caught by\vPROF.ELM.{DONE}",
    ["80:4a35"] = "I wonder what this\ndoes?{DONE}",
    ["80:4a4f"] = "Would you like to\nheal your POKéMON?{DONE}",
    ["80:4a72"] = "ELM: {PLAYER}, this\nis terrible…\fOh, yes, what was\nMR.POKéMON's big\vdiscovery?{DONE}",
    ["80:4ab7"] = "{PLAYER} handed\nthe MYSTERY EGG to\vPROF.ELM.{DONE}",
    ["80:4ade"] = "ELM: This?{DONE}",
    ["80:4aea"] = "But… Is it a\nPOKéMON EGG?\fIf it is, it is a\ngreat discovery!{DONE}",
    ["80:4b25"] = "ELM: What?!?\fPROF.OAK gave you\na POKéDEX?\f{PLAYER}, is that\ntrue? Th-that's\vincredible!\fThe POKéDEX shows\nhow POKéMON evolve\vand learn moves.\fHe is superb at\nseeing the poten-\vtial of people as\vtrainers.\fWow, {PLAYER}. You\nmay have what it\ftakes to become\nthe CHAMPION.\fYou seem to be\ngetting on great\vwith POKéMON too.\fYou should take\nthe POKéMON GYM\vchallenge.\fThe closest GYM\nwould be the one\vin VIOLET CITY.{DONE}",
    ["80:4ca4"] = "…{PLAYER}. The\nroad to the\fchampionship will\nbe a long one.\fBefore you leave,\nmake sure that you\vtalk to your mom.{DONE}",
    ["80:4d11"] = "ELM: Don't give\nup! I'll call if\fI learn anything\nabout that EGG!{DONE}",
    ["80:4d52"] = "ELM: {PLAYER}?\nDidn't you meet my\vassistant?\fHe should have met\nyou with the EGG\fat VIOLET CITY's\nPOKéMON CENTER.\fYou must have just\nmissed him. Try to\vcatch him there.{DONE}",
    ["80:4df0"] = "ELM: Hey, has that\nEGG changed any?{DONE}",
    ["80:4e15"] = "{PLAYER}? I thought\nthe EGG hatched.\fWhere is the\nPOKéMON?{DONE}",
    ["80:4e47"] = "ELM: {PLAYER}, you\nlook great!{DONE}",
    ["80:4e60"] = "What?\nThat POKéMON!?!{DONE}",
    ["80:4e74"] = "The EGG hatched!\nSo, POKéMON are\vborn from EGGS…\fNo, perhaps not\nall POKéMON are.\fWow, there's still\na lot of research\vto be done.{DONE}",
    ["80:4ef1"] = "Thanks, {PLAYER}!\nYou're helping\funravel POKéMON\nmysteries for us!\fI want you to have\nthis as a token of\vour appreciation.{DONE}",
    ["80:4f62"] = "That's an\nEVERSTONE.\fSome species of\nPOKéMON evolve\fwhen they grow to\ncertain levels.\fA POKéMON holding\nthe EVERSTONE\vwon't evolve.\fGive it to a POKé-\nMON you don't want\vto evolve yet.{DONE}",
    ["80:5010"] = "ELM: {PLAYER}, I'll\ncall you if any-\vthing comes up.{DONE}",
    ["80:503e"] = "…sigh… That\nstolen POKéMON.\fI wonder how it's\ndoing.\fThey say a POKéMON\nraised by a bad\fperson turns bad\nitself.{DONE}",
    ["80:50a9"] = "ELM: Hi, {PLAYER}!\nThanks to you, my\fresearch is going\ngreat!\fTake this as a\ntoken of my\vappreciation.{DONE}",
    ["80:510a"] = "The MASTER BALL is\nthe best!\fIt's the ultimate\nBALL! It'll catch\fany POKéMON with-\nout fail.\fIt's given only to\nrecognized POKéMON\vresearchers.\fI think you can\nmake much better\fuse of it than I\ncan, {PLAYER}!{DONE}",
    ["80:51cc"] = "ELM: {PLAYER}!\nThere you are!\fI called because I\nhave something for\vyou.\fSee? It's an\nS.S.TICKET.\fNow you can catch\nPOKéMON in KANTO.{DONE}",
    ["80:5248"] = "The ship departs\nfrom OLIVINE CITY.\fBut you knew that\nalready, {PLAYER}.\fAfter all, you've\ntraveled all over\vwith your POKéMON.\fBefore you go,\nfeel free to\vchallenge the\fGYM LEADERS of\nJOHTO again!\fThis time they\nwon't hold back.\fGive my regards to\nPROF.OAK in KANTO!{DONE}",
    ["80:5376"] = "{PLAYER}, I want\nyou to have this\vfor your errand.{DONE}",
    ["80:53a3"] = "There are only two\nof us, so we're\valways busy.{DONE}",
    ["80:53d3"] = "There was a loud\nnoise outside…\fWhen we went to\nlook, someone\vstole a POKéMON.\fIt's unbelievable\nthat anyone would\vdo that!\f…sigh… That\nstolen POKéMON.\fI wonder how it's\ndoing.\fThey say a POKéMON\nraised by a bad\fperson turns bad\nitself.{DONE}",
    ["80:54b6"] = "{PLAYER}!\fUse these on your\nPOKéDEX quest!{DONE}",
    ["80:54d8"] = "To add to your\nPOKéDEX, you have\vto catch POKéMON.\fThrow POKé BALLS\nat wild POKéMON\vto get them.{DONE}",
    ["80:552e"] = "I heard a POKéMON\nwas stolen here…\fI was just getting\nsome information\vfrom PROF.ELM.\fApparently, it was\na young male with\vlong, red hair…\fWhat?\fYou battled a\ntrainer like that?\fDid you happen to\nget his name?{DONE}",
    ["80:55fe"] = "OK! So {RIVAL}\nwas his name.\fThanks for helping\nmy investigation!{DONE}",
    ["80:563b"] = "The window's open.\fA pleasant breeze\nis blowing in.{DONE}",
    ["80:566f"] = "He broke in\nthrough here!{DONE}",
    ["80:568a"] = "{PLAYER} opened a\nbook.\fTravel Tip 1:\fPress START to\nopen the MENU.{DONE}",
    ["80:56c8"] = "{PLAYER} opened a\nbook.\fTravel Tip 2:\fRecord your trip\nwith SAVE!{DONE}",
    ["80:5704"] = "{PLAYER} opened a\nbook.\fTravel Tip 3:\fOpen your PACK and\npress SELECT to\vmove items.{DONE}",
    ["80:5753"] = "{PLAYER} opened a\nbook.\fTravel Tip 4:\fCheck your POKéMON\nmoves. Press the\fA Button to switch\nmoves.{DONE}",
    ["80:57ae"] = "The wrapper from\nthe snack PROF.ELM\vate is in there…{DONE}",
    ["80:57e4"] = "OBSERVATIONS ON\nPOKéMON EVOLUTION\f…It says on the\nscreen…{DONE}",
    ["80:6a6e"] = "The COLOSSEUM\nupstairs is for\vlink battles.\fBattle records are\nposted on the\fwall, so I can't\nafford to lose.{DONE}",
    ["80:6bc9"] = "A higher level\nPOKéMON doesn't\valways win.\fAfter all, it may\nhave a type dis-\vadvantage.\fI don't think\nthere is a single\fPOKéMON that is\nthe toughest.{DONE}",
    ["80:6d64"] = "Oh my, your pack\nlooks so heavy!\fOh! Do you happen\nto have something\vnamed EON MAIL?\fMy daughter is\nafter one.\fYou can part with\none, can't you?{DONE}",
    ["80:6df5"] = "Give away an EON\nMAIL?{DONE}",
    ["80:6e0d"] = "Oh, that's great!\nThank you, honey!\fHere, this is for\nyou in return!{DONE}",
    ["80:6e52"] = "My daughter will\nbe delighted!{DONE}",
    ["80:6e72"] = "Oh? You don't have\none? Too bad.{DONE}",
    ["80:6e93"] = "Oh… Well, another\ntime, then.{DONE}",
    ["80:6eb2"] = "{PLAYER} gave away\nthe EON MAIL.{DONE}",
    ["80:715f"] = "BATTLE TOWER\nwelcomes you!\fI could show you\nto a BATTLE ROOM.{DONE}",
    ["80:719e"] = "Want to go into a\nBATTLE ROOM?{DONE}",
    ["80:71be"] = "Right this way to\nyour BATTLE ROOM.{DONE}",
    ["80:743a"] = "BATTLE TOWER is a\nfacility made for\vPOKéMON battles.\fCountless POKéMON\ntrainers gather\ffrom all over to\nhold battles in\fspecially designed\nBATTLE ROOMS.\fThere are many\nBATTLE ROOMS in\vthe BATTLE TOWER.\fEach ROOM holds\nseven trainers.\fBeat them all, and\nwin a prize.\fTo interrupt a\nsession, you must\fSAVE. If not, you\nwon't be able to\fresume your ROOM\nchallenge.\f{DONE}",
    ["80:77f0"] = "We hope to serve\nyou again.{DONE}",
    ["80:7824"] = "Would you like to\nhear about the\vBATTLE TOWER?{DONE}",
    ["80:7923"] = "BATTLE TOWER rules\nare written here.\fRead the rules?{DONE}",
    ["80:7959"] = "Three POKéMON may\nenter battles.\fAll three must be\ndifferent.\fThe items they\nhold must also be\vdifferent.\fCertain POKéMON\nmay also have\flevel restrictions\nplaced on them.{DONE}",
    ["80:79ff"] = "Excuse me!\nYou didn't SAVE\fbefore exiting\nthe BATTLE ROOM.\fI'm awfully sorry,\nbut your challenge\fwill be declared\ninvalid.{DONE}",
    ["80:7b06"] = "Before entering\nthe BATTLE ROOM,\fyour progress will\nbe saved.{DONE}",
    ["80:7c1e"] = "We've been waiting\nfor you. This way\fto a BATTLE ROOM,\nplease.{DONE}",
    ["80:7e4b"] = "Destroyed by the\nfirst opponent in\fno time at all…\nI'm no good…{DONE}",
    ["80:7e8b"] = "There are lots of\nBATTLE ROOMS, but\fI'm going to win\nthem all!{DONE}",
    ["80:7eca"] = "It's a grueling\ntask, not being\fable to use items\nin battle.\fMaking your\nPOKéMON hold items\fis the key to\nwinning battles.{DONE}",
    ["80:7f42"] = "I'm trying to see\nhow far I can go\fusing just bug\nPOKéMON.\fDon't let there be\nany fire POKéMON…{DONE}",
    ["81:439b"] = "Wait up!\nWhat's the hurry?{DONE}",
    ["81:43b6"] = "{PLAYER}, right?\nSome guy wearing\fglasses was look-\ning for you.\fSee for yourself.\nHe's waiting for\fyou at the POKéMON\nCENTER.{DONE}",
    ["81:44bb"] = "Have you gone to\nthe POKéMON GYM?\fYou can test your\nPOKéMON and your-\vself there.\fIt's a rite of\npassage for all\vtrainers!{DONE}",
    ["81:4530"] = "You have some good\nPOKéMON there.\fIt must be from\nthe training you\fgave them around\nVIOLET CITY.\fThe training at\nthe GYM must have\fbeen especially\nhelpful.\fAs a souvenir of\nVIOLET CITY, take\vthis.\fIt increases the\npower of GRASS-\vtype moves.{DONE}",
    ["81:4620"] = "Your experiences\nin VIOLET CITY\fshould be useful\nfor your journey.{DONE}",
    ["81:4664"] = "How would you like\nto have this\ftasty, nutritious\nSLOWPOKETAIL?\fFor you right now,\njust ¥1,000,000!\fYou'll want this!{DONE}",
    ["81:46da"] = "Tch! I thought\nkids these days\vwere loaded…{DONE}",
    ["81:4707"] = "You don't want it?\nThen scram. Shoo!{DONE}",
    ["81:472c"] = "Whoa!\fYou made me lose\nthat fish!{DONE}",
    ["81:474f"] = "Sploosh!{DONE}",
    ["81:4759"] = "Calm, collected…\nThe essence of\ffishing and POKé-\nMON is the same.{DONE}",
    ["81:479a"] = "I'm really good at\nboth fishing and\vPOKéMON.\fI'm not about to\nlose to any kid!{DONE}",
    ["81:47e5"] = "Tch! I tried to\nrush things…{DONE}",
    ["81:4803"] = "Fishing is a life-\nlong passion.\fPOKéMON are life-\nlong friends!{DONE}",
    ["81:4842"] = "One, two, three…\nMuahahaha, what a\fgreat haul!\nI'm done! Go ahead\fand catch as many\nas you can, kid!{DONE}",
    ["81:49da"] = "My POKéMON?\nFreshly caught!{DONE}",
    ["81:49f4"] = "SPLASH?{DONE}",
    ["81:49fd"] = "Freshly caught\nPOKéMON are no\fmatch for properly\nraised ones.{DONE}",
    ["81:4a39"] = "I haven't seen you\naround before.\fSo you think you\nare pretty tough?{DONE}",
    ["81:4a7e"] = "You're strong!{DONE}",
    ["81:4a8d"] = "I'm going to try\nto be the best\vwith my favorites.\fI'm not using the\nsame tough POKéMON\vas everyone else.{DONE}",
    ["81:4af3"] = "I found some good\nPOKéMON in the\vgrass!\fI think they'll do\nit for me!{DONE}",
    ["81:4b36"] = "Darn. I thought I\ncould win.{DONE}",
    ["81:4b54"] = "The grass is full\nof clingy things.{DONE}",
    ["81:4b79"] = "That glance…\nIt's intriguing.{DONE}",
    ["81:4b97"] = "Hmmm. This is\ndisappointing.{DONE}",
    ["81:4bb5"] = "If you don't want\nto battle, just\vavoid eye contact.{DONE}",
    ["81:4bea"] = "Uh-huh. Yeah, and\nyou know…\fPardon? Battle?\nI'm on the phone.\fOh, all right. But\nmake it fast.{DONE}",
    ["81:4c49"] = "Oh! I've got to\nrelieve my anger!{DONE}",
    ["81:4c6b"] = "I was having a\nnice chat too.{DONE}",
    ["81:4c8a"] = "That BADGE! It's\nfrom VIOLET CITY!\fYou beat FALKNER?{DONE}",
    ["81:4cbf"] = "I know what my\nweaknesses are.{DONE}",
    ["81:4cdf"] = "I should train\nagain at the GYM\vin VIOLET CITY.{DONE}",
    ["81:4d3e"] = "WROOOOAR!\nPEOPLE RUN WHEN I\fROAR! BUT YOU\nCAME LOOKING!\fTHAT PLEASES ME!\nNOW TAKE THIS!{DONE}",
    ["81:4d97"] = "WROOOAR!\nIT'S ROAR!\fEVEN POKéMON RUN\nFROM A GOOD ROAR!{DONE}",
    ["81:4dcc"] = "FRIEDA: Yahoo!\nIt's Friday!\fI'm FRIEDA of\nFriday!\fNice to meet you!{DONE}",
    ["81:4e0f"] = "Here's a POISON\nBARB for you!{DONE}",
    ["81:4e2d"] = "FRIEDA: Give it to\na POKéMON that has\vPOISON-type moves.\fOh!\fIt's wicked!\fYou'll be shocked\nhow good it makes\vpoison moves!{DONE}",
    ["81:4ea5"] = "FRIEDA: Hiya! What\nday do you like?\fI love Friday. No\ndoubt about it!\fDon't you think\nit's great too?{DONE}",
    ["81:4f0a"] = "FRIEDA: Isn't it\nFriday today?\fIt's so boring\nwhen it's not!{DONE}",
    ["81:4f45"] = "ROUTE 32\fVIOLET CITY -\nAZALEA TOWN{DONE}",
    ["81:4f69"] = "RUINS OF ALPH\nEAST ENTRANCE{DONE}",
    ["81:4f86"] = "UNION CAVE\nAHEAD{DONE}",
    ["81:53dc"] = "Hold it right\nthere!{DONE}",
    ["81:53f2"] = "We can't have a\nbrat like you on\vthe loose.\fIt's harmful to\nTEAM ROCKET's\vpride, you see.\fHowever strong you\nmay be, you can't\ftake both of us at\nthe same time.\fSorry, baby. Now\nget ready to be\vthrashed.{DONE}",
    ["81:54bb"] = "Hey! Don't be so\nselfish. Spread\vthe fun around.{DONE}",
    ["81:54ec"] = "What? You had an\naccomplice?\fWhere is your\nsense of honor?\fAs the interim\nboss in place of\fGIOVANNI, I'll\nshow you how wrong\fit is to meddle\nwith TEAM ROCKET!{DONE}",
    ["81:558b"] = "Tch, you really\nare strong.\fIt's too bad.\fIf you were to\njoin TEAM ROCKET,\fyou could become\nan EXECUTIVE.{DONE}",
    ["81:55f5"] = "…This hideout is\ndone for…\fBut that's fine.\nThe broadcast ex-\vperiment was a\vtotal success.\fIt doesn't matter\nwhat happens to\vthis hideout now.\fWe have much big-\nger plans.\fYou'll come to\nappreciate TEAM\fROCKET's true\npower soon enough.\fEnjoy yourself\nwhile you can…\fFufufufu…{DONE}",
    ["81:5707"] = "LANCE: That did\nit. We defeated\fall the ROCKETS\nhere.\fBut I'm concerned\nabout the young\fguy I battled in\nthe process…{DONE}",
    ["81:577d"] = "Sorry, {PLAYER}.\nI saw how well you\fwere doing, so I\njust hung back.\fNow all there is\nleft to do is to\fturn off that odd\nradio signal.{DONE}",
    ["81:57fe"] = "It's this machine\nthat's causing all\vthe problems.\fI don't see a\nswitch on it…\fWe have no choice.\nWe have to make\fall the ELECTRODE\nfaint.\fThat should stop\nthis machine from\ftransmitting that\nstrange signal.\fIt's no fault of\nthe POKéMON, so it\fmakes me feel\nguilty.\f{PLAYER}, let's\nsplit the job.{DONE}",
    ["81:5919"] = "LANCE: Leave this\nside to me.{DONE}",
    ["81:5938"] = "LANCE: That odd\nsignal has finally\vstopped.\fThe LAKE should be\nback to normal.\fYou're the hero!\nLet me thank you\fon behalf of all\nthe POKéMON.\fOh, yes. You\nshould take this.\fI found it here,\nbut I don't have\vany need for it.{DONE}",
    ["81:5a27"] = "That's WHIRLPOOL.\nTeach it to a\fPOKéMON to get\nacross wild water.\fBut keep this in\nmind.\fYou can use that\nout of battle only\fwith the BADGE\nfrom MAHOGANY GYM.{DONE}",
    ["81:5ac3"] = "{PLAYER}…\fThe journey to be-\ncoming the POKéMON\fMASTER is long and\ndifficult.\fKnowing that, will\nyou keep going?\f…\fI see. No, you're\nright.\fIf you would give\nup that easily,\fyou would have\nnever chased that\fdream in the first\nplace.\fI look forward to\nseeing you again!{DONE}",
    ["81:5bc6"] = "LANCE: Are you all\nright?\fYour POKéMON are\nhurt and tired.\fHere, give them\nsome of my medi-\vcine.{DONE}",
    ["81:5c26"] = "LANCE: {PLAYER},\nlet's give it our\vbest for POKéMON.{DONE}",
    ["81:5c51"] = "The door won't\nopen?\fWell, duh.\nIt has to have a\fpassword that only\nTEAM ROCKET knows.{DONE}",
    ["81:5ca8"] = "What? I lost?{DONE}",
    ["81:5cb7"] = "Heh, I'm just a\nGRUNT.\fI don't know the\npassword. Too bad\vfor you.{DONE}",
    ["81:5cf9"] = "Oh, a kid? I don't\nreally like this,\fbut eliminate you\nI must.{DONE}",
    ["81:5d38"] = "I knew I'd lose…{DONE}",
    ["81:5d49"] = "I got wiped out on\nthe last mission\vby a kid too.\fWhen we were ab-\nducting POKéMON,\fthis kid with long\nred hair and mean-\flooking eyes just\ncreamed me…{DONE}",
    ["81:5ddf"] = "You rotten little\npest!{DONE}",
    ["81:5df8"] = "Grrrr…{DONE}",
    ["81:5e00"] = "Heh, only the boss\nknows the password\vfor that door.\fWhere's the boss?\nWho knows? Go look\vfor yourself.{DONE}",
    ["81:5e68"] = "The door's closed…\fIt needs a pass-\nword to open.{DONE}",
    ["81:5e9a"] = "The door's closed…\f{PLAYER} entered\nthe password.\fThe door opened!{DONE}",
    ["81:5ed6"] = "It's the radio\ntransmitter that's\fsending the\nsinister signal.\fIt's working at\nfull capacity.{DONE}",
    ["81:5f32"] = "The radio trans-\nmitter has finally\fstopped its evil\nbroadcast.{DONE}",
    ["81:637b"] = "Y-you! You came to\nrescue me?{DONE}",
    ["81:639a"] = "Is that what you\nwere expecting?\fWrong!\nI'm an imposter!\fI pretended to be\nthe real thing to\fprepare for our\ntakeover.\fDo you want to\nknow where we hid\vthe real DIRECTOR?\fSure, I'll tell\nyou. But only if\vyou can beat me!{DONE}",
    ["81:6476"] = "OK, OK. I'll tell\nyou where he is.{DONE}",
    ["81:6499"] = "The boss stashed\nthe DIRECTOR in\fthe UNDERGROUND\nWAREHOUSE.\fIt's at the far\nend of the UNDER-\vGROUND.\fBut I doubt you'll\nget that far.{DONE}",
    ["81:651f"] = "Remember me from\nthe HIDEOUT in\vMAHOGANY TOWN?\fMy boss scolded me\nbut I'm stronger.\fI lost then, but I\nwon't this time.{DONE}",
    ["81:6596"] = "This can't be\nhappening!\fI fought hard, but\nI still lost…\fI'm so sorry\nGIOVANNI…{DONE}",
    ["81:65e6"] = "{PLAYER}, isn't it?\fA brat like you\nwon't appreciate\fthe magnificence\nof TEAM ROCKET.\fThat's too bad.\nI really admire\vyour power.{DONE}",
    ["81:665f"] = "Oh? You managed to\nget this far?\fYou must be quite\nthe trainer.\fWe intend to take\nover this RADIO\fSTATION and an-\nnounce our come-\vback.\fThat should bring\nour boss GIOVANNI\fback from his solo\ntraining.\fWe are going to\nregain our former\vglory.\fI won't allow you\nto interfere with\vour plans.{DONE}",
    ["81:6781"] = "No! Forgive me,\nGIOVANNI!{DONE}",
    ["81:679c"] = "How could this be?\fTEAM ROCKET was\ndestined to rise\vagain...\fFor GIOVANNI, for\nour legacy. We\vcannot fall now!\fYou may have won\nthis battle,\fbut the war?\nIt's far from over.\vYou'll see.\fOur ambition, our\ndream will not\vfade.\fThe world will \nfear TEAM ROCKET\vonce again.\fThis is only\na setback!{DONE}",
    ["81:68c1"] = "???:\nSuch conviction.\fReminds me of a\ntime when I, too,\vwas so sure.{DONE}",
    ["81:6907"] = "You speak of\nlegacy,\fof taking\nover...\fBut recall,\nARCHER.\fWhy did I choose\nto disband it?{DONE}",
    ["81:6963"] = "GIOVANNI:\nIt wasn't mere\vdefeat or whim,\fIt was an\nawakening.\fSee the state of\nthis group now.\fDesperate acts,\nhiding.\fA far cry from\nwhere we once\vstood.{DONE}",
    ["81:69fe"] = "Power isn't just\nabout domination.\fIt's understanding\nand respect.\fIs this the legacy\nyou imagined?\fReduced to\nskulking in the\vshadows?{DONE}",
    ["81:6a85"] = "Rethink this path.\fDo you truly see a\nfuture for this\vTEAM ROCKET?{DONE}",
    ["81:6ac9"] = "ARCHER:\nI...\fI did this for\nyou. For the glory\vof TEAM ROCKET.\fAll my efforts,\nall these\vsacrifices.\fAnd you just...\fWas it all in\nvain?\fDid I\nmisunderstand\vour purpose?{DONE}",
    ["81:6b74"] = "You left.\fYou vanished\nwithout a word.\fWe were lost.\nI tried to carry\vyour legacy.{DONE}",
    ["81:6bc8"] = "You were the\nleader,\fthe visionary.\fAnd I...\fI'm just...{DONE}",
    ["81:6c01"] = "Was I a mere\npuppet?\fChasing a dream\nyou never shared?{DONE}",
    ["81:6c39"] = "But... but I can't\njust let go. Not\vafter everything.\fDo you expect me\nto just walk away,\fto abandon our\ncause?{DONE}",
    ["81:6ca9"] = "I... I need time.\nI need to get out\vof here.{DONE}",
    ["81:6cd7"] = "But know this,\nGIOVANNI. Even if\vthe path was\vwrong...\fMy intentions were\ntrue!{DONE}",
    ["81:6d28"] = "DIRECTOR: {PLAYER},\nthank you!\fYour courageous\nactions have saved\fPOKéMON nation-\nwide.\fI know it's not\nmuch, but please\vtake this.{DONE}",
    ["81:6da2"] = "There used to be a\ntower right here\vin GOLDENROD CITY.\fBut it was old and\ncreaky.\fSo we replaced it\nwith our RADIO\vTOWER.\fWe dug up that\nbell during\vconstruction.\fI heard that all\nsorts of POKéMON\flived in GOLDENROD\nin the past.\fPerhaps…\fThat bell has some\nconnection to the\fTIN TOWER in\nECRUTEAK CITY…\fAh!\fThat reminds me…\fI overheard TEAM\nROCKET whispering.\fApparently, some-\nthing is going on\vat the TIN TOWER.\fI have no idea\nwhat is happening,\fbut you might look\ninto it.\fOK, I better go to\nmy OFFICE.{DONE}",
    ["81:6f9a"] = "DIRECTOR: Hello,\n{PLAYER}!\fYou know, I love\nPOKéMON.\fI built this RADIO\nTOWER so I could\fexpress my love\nof POKéMON.\fIt would be nice\nif people enjoyed\vour programs.{DONE}",
    ["81:7034"] = "BEN: Do you listen\nto our music?{DONE}",
    ["81:7056"] = "5F DIRECTOR'S\n   OFFICE{DONE}",
    ["81:706f"] = "5F STUDIO 1{DONE}",
    ["81:71e4"] = "EARL, I am!\fWonderful are\nPOKéMON, yes!\fTeach you I will\nto be a better\vtrainer!\fWhat you want to\nknow? Want to be\va winner is you?{DONE}",
    ["81:7266"] = "Good! Teach you,\nI will!\fIn battle, POKéMON\ntop on list jump\vout first!\fChange order in\nlist, make battle\veasy, maybe!\fMore from me you\nwant to hear?{DONE}",
    ["81:72fa"] = "So, want to know\nhow to raise\vPOKéMON well?{DONE}",
    ["81:7324"] = "Fine! Teach you,\nI will!\fIf POKéMON come\nout in battle even\fbriefly, some EXP.\nPoints it gets.\fAt top of list put\nweak POKéMON.\fSwitch in battle\nquick!\fThis way, weak\nPOKéMON strong\vbecome!{DONE}",
    ["81:73da"] = "Oh! Smart student\nyou are! Nothing\vmore do I teach!\fIf you want more\ntalk to pupils!{DONE}",
    ["81:7430"] = "POKéMON previously\nthought to only\vevolve through\ftrade can evolve\nthrough leveling.\fMACHOKE and\nGRAVELER evolve\vat LVL 38, while\fKADABRA and\nHAUNTER evolve\vat LVL 42.\fSome items, like\nthe METAL COAT,\fhave also been\nfound to evolve\vcertain POKéMON\fsimilarly to\nevolution stones.\fA BRICK PIECE\ngiven to a\vTYROGUE has led\fto a new POKéMON\ndiscovery.{DONE}",
    ["81:7584"] = "The newly discov-\nered DARK-type\vdeals physical\vdamage.\fThe GHOST-type\ndeals special\vdamage.\fThe move SPIKE\nCANNON, once\vthought to be a\fNORMAL-type move,\nis actually a\vSTEEL-type move.{DONE}",
    ["81:763f"] = "As trainers ex-\npand their skills,\fMany moves are now\nmore accurate than\vpreviously known,\fand some that were\nonce thought to be\vunderpowered have\fseen increases\nto their power.\fMost notably, the\nBUG-type is now\vfar more viable in\vbattle.\fThe FIGHTING-type\nhas also improved\vdramatically over\fthe last three\nyears.{DONE}",
    ["81:777b"] = "As POKéMON\ncontinue to grow,\vas do their stats.\fWhile still rec-\nognizable, some\vPOKéMON once\fthought to be\nnonviable have\vseen small stat\fincreases of\n5-20 base points.\fARIADOS in par-\nticular has become\vmuch faster, with\fa new base SPEED\nstat of 80.\fMany POKéMON can\nlearn moves they\vcouldn't before.\fNow, nearly all\nPOKéMON learn\vmultiple moves of\fits own type via\nlevel-up.\fMany also seem\nto be learning\vmoves sooner\fthan they once\ndid.\fBe aware that your\nopponents now use\vteams with better\vtype coverage,\fso expect a much\nmore challenging\vjourney ahead.{DONE}",
    ["81:799f"] = "The blackboard\ndescribes POKéMON\fstatus changes in\nbattle.{DONE}",
    ["81:79eb"] = "If poisoned, a\nPOKéMON steadily\vloses HP.\fPoison lingers\nafter the battle,\fand HP is lost as\nyou walk.\fTo cure it, use an\nANTIDOTE.{DONE}",
    ["81:7a6d"] = "Paralysis reduces\nspeed and may\vprevent movement.\fIt remains after\nbattle, so use\va PARLYZ HEAL.{DONE}",
    ["81:7acf"] = "If asleep, your\nPOKéMON can't make\va move.\fA sleeping POKéMON\ndoesn't wake up\vafter battle.\fWake it up with\nan AWAKENING.{DONE}",
    ["81:7b42"] = "A burn steadily\nconsumes HP.\fIt also reduces\nattack power.\fA burn lingers\nafter battle.\fUse a BURN HEAL as\nthe cure.{DONE}",
    ["81:7bb8"] = "If your POKéMON is\nfrozen, it can't\vdo a thing.\fIt remains frozen\nafter battle.\fThaw it out with\nan ICE HEAL.{DONE}",
    ["81:7c23"] = "It's this kid's\nnotebook…\fCatch POKéMON\nusing POKé BALLS.\fUp to six can be\nin your party.\fKeep reading?{DONE}",
    ["81:7c84"] = "Before throwing a\nPOKé BALL, weaken\vthe target first.\fA poisoned or\nburned POKéMON is\veasier to catch.\fKeep reading?{DONE}",
    ["81:7cf4"] = "Some moves may\ncause confusion.\fConfusion may make\na POKéMON attack\vitself.\fLeaving battle\nclears up any\vconfusion.\fKeep reading?{DONE}",
    ["81:7d74"] = "People who catch\nand use POKéMON\fin battle are\nPOKéMON trainers.\fThey are expected\nto visit POKéMON\fGYMS and defeat\nother trainers.\fThe next page\nis… Blank!\fBoy: E-he-he…\fI haven't written\nanymore…{DONE}",
    ["81:7ef9"] = "Yo! MARKUS!{DONE}",
    ["81:7f06"] = "Sorry, my mistake.{DONE}",
    ["81:7f1a"] = "I'm investigating\nMT.MORTAR, but my\vpal's gone AWOL.\fHave you seen a\ntrainer who has a\fSLOWPOKE that can\nuse STRENGTH?{DONE}",
    ["82:42d8"] = "Today's {STRBUF}.\nThat means the\fBug-Catching Con-\ntest is on today.\fThe rules are sim-\nple.\fUsing one of your\nPOKéMON, catch a\fbug POKéMON to be\njudged.\fWould you like to\ngive it a try?{DONE}",
    ["82:438a"] = "Here are the PARK\nBALLS for the\vContest.{DONE}",
    ["82:43b4"] = "{PLAYER} received\n20 PARK BALLS.{DONE}",
    ["82:43cf"] = "The person who\ngets the strong-\vest bug POKéMON\vis the winner.\fYou have 20\nminutes.\fIf you run out of\nPARK BALLS, you're\vdone.\fYou can keep the\nlast POKéMON you\vcatch as your own.\fGo out and catch\nthe strongest bug\fPOKéMON you can\nfind!{DONE}",
    ["82:44b3"] = "Uh-oh…\fYou have more than\none POKéMON.\fYou'll have to use\n{STRBUF}, the\ffirst POKéMON in\nyour party.\fIs that OK with\nyou?{DONE}",
    ["82:4524"] = "Fine, we'll hold\nyour other POKéMON\vwhile you compete.{DONE}",
    ["82:4558"] = "{PLAYER}'s POKéMON\nwere left with the\vCONTEST HELPER.{DONE}",
    ["82:4584"] = "Please choose the\nPOKéMON to be used\fin the Contest,\nthen come see me.{DONE}",
    ["82:45c9"] = "OK. We hope you'll\ntake part in the\vfuture.{DONE}",
    ["82:45f5"] = "Uh-oh…\nThe first POKéMON\fin your party\ncan't battle.\fPlease switch it\nwith the POKéMON\fyou want to use,\nthen come see me.{DONE}",
    ["82:4669"] = "Uh-oh…\nBoth your party\fand your PC BOX\nare full.\fYou have no room\nto put the bug\vPOKéMON you catch.\fPlease make room\nin your party or\fyour PC BOX, then\ncome see me.{DONE}",
    ["82:470c"] = "Uh-oh…\nYou have an EGG as\fthe first POKéMON\nin your party.\fPlease switch it\nwith the POKéMON\fyou want to use,\nthen come see me.{DONE}",
    ["82:4787"] = "You still have {STRBUF}\nminute(s) left.\fDo you want to\nfinish now?{DONE}",
    ["82:47c8"] = "OK. Please wait\nhere for the\fannouncement of\nthe winners.{DONE}",
    ["82:4803"] = "OK. Please go back\noutside and finish\vup.{DONE}",
    ["82:482e"] = "Today's Contest is\nover. We hope you\fwill participate\nin the future.{DONE}",
    ["82:4873"] = "Some POKéMON can\nonly be seen in\vthe PARK.{DONE}",
    ["82:489c"] = "DON: Wow, you beat\nme. You're pretty\vgood.{DONE}",
    ["82:48c7"] = "DON: Luck plays a\nbig part in this.\fYou never know\nwhat POKéMON will\vappear.{DONE}",
    ["82:4912"] = "ED: I envy you.\nI just couldn't\vdo it this time.{DONE}",
    ["82:4943"] = "ED: Maybe you win\nwith big POKéMON?{DONE}",
    ["82:4965"] = "NICK: Well done!\nI'm going to raise\vmy POKéMON better.{DONE}",
    ["82:4999"] = "NICK: Maybe you\nget a higher score\ffor a POKéMON of\nan unusual color.{DONE}",
    ["82:49dd"] = "WILLIAM: You're\nthe winner? What\vdid you catch?{DONE}",
    ["82:4a0d"] = "WILLIAM: Well, I'm\nsatisfied because\fI caught a POKéMON\nthat I wanted.{DONE}",
    ["82:4a51"] = "BENNY: Congrats!\nYou have earned my\vrespect!{DONE}",
    ["82:4a7f"] = "BENNY: I caught a\nSCYTHER before,\vbut I didn't win.{DONE}",
    ["82:4ab3"] = "BARRY: That POKé-\nMON you caught…\vit's awesome!{DONE}",
    ["82:4ae0"] = "BARRY: It's easier\nto win if you get\fa high-level bug\nPOKéMON.\fBut I think they\nalso consider some\vother points.{DONE}",
    ["82:4b4e"] = "CINDY: You won?\nThat's great!\fDo you feel like\nlooking for bug\vPOKéMON with me?{DONE}",
    ["82:4b9b"] = "CINDY: I really\nlove bug POKéMON!{DONE}",
    ["82:4bbb"] = "JOSH: I… I can't\nbelieve I lost at\vbug-catching…{DONE}",
    ["82:4bec"] = "JOSH: I heard that\nsomebody won with\va CATERPIE!{DONE}",
    ["82:4c1e"] = "SAMUEL: Next time,\nI'm going to win.{DONE}",
    ["82:4c43"] = "SAMUEL: Darn.\nI thought I would\vscore higher…{DONE}",
    ["82:4c72"] = "KIPP: Could you\ngive me some tips?\fI want to study\nyour style.{DONE}",
    ["82:4cb2"] = "KIPP: I study a\nlot, but that's\fnot good enough to\nwin.{DONE}",
    ["82:4d4f"] = "The Bug-Catching\nContest is held on\fTuesday, Thursday\nand Saturday.\fNot only do you\nearn a prize just\ffor participating,\nyou also get to\fkeep the bug\nPOKéMON you may\fhave at the end of\nthe contest.{DONE}",
    ["82:4e13"] = "Uh-oh… Your PACK\nis full.\fWe'll hold on to\nyour prize, but\vonly for today.\fPlease make room,\nthen come see me.{DONE}",
    ["82:4e82"] = "{PLAYER}?\fHere's the prize\nwe were holding\vfor you.{DONE}",
    ["82:543a"] = "Hold it!\fI saw you, so I\ntailed you.\fI don't need you\nunderfoot while I\ftake care of TEAM\nROCKET.\f…Wait a second.\nYou beat me be-\vfore, didn't you?\fThat was just a\nfluke.\fI've been training\nmy team and now\fI will repay my\ndebts!{DONE}",
    ["82:551d"] = "…Why…\nWhy do I lose?\fI've assembled the\ntoughest POKéMON.\fI didn't ease up\non the gas.\fSo why do I lose?{DONE}",
    ["82:5582"] = "…I don't under-\nstand…\fIs what that LANCE\nguy said true?\fThat I don't treat\nPOKéMON properly?\fLove…\fTrust…\fAre they really\nwhat I lack?\fAre they keeping\nme from winning?\fI… I just don't\nunderstand.\fBut it's not going\nto end here.\fNot now. Not\nbecause of this.\fI won't give up my\ndream of becoming\fthe world's best\nPOKéMON trainer!{DONE}",
    ["82:56c2"] = "Humph. This is my\nreal power, wimp.\fI'll make TEAM\nROCKET history.\fAnd I'm going to\ngrind that LANCE\vunder my heels.{DONE}",
    ["82:5736"] = "I was challenged\nto a battle down-\vstairs.\fIt's rough down\nthere. You'd\vbetter be careful.{DONE}",
    ["82:5790"] = "There are some\nshops downstairs…\fBut there are\nalso trainers.\fI'm scared to go\ndown there.{DONE}",
    ["82:57eb"] = "Open one shutter,\nanother closes.\fBet you can't get\nwhere you want!{DONE}",
    ["82:582f"] = "Drat! I was sunk\nby indecision!{DONE}",
    ["82:5850"] = "I'm confused too…\nThe switch on the\fend is the one to\npress first, but…{DONE}",
    ["82:5898"] = "Kwahaha!\fConfounded by the\nshutters, are we?\fI'll let you in on\na secret if you\vcan beat me!{DONE}",
    ["82:58f5"] = "Uwww…\nI blew it.{DONE}",
    ["82:5907"] = "All right. A hint!\fChange the order\nof switching.\fThat'll change the\nways the shutters\vopen and close.{DONE}",
    ["82:596e"] = "Fork over your\ngoodies!{DONE}",
    ["82:5987"] = "Mercy!{DONE}",
    ["82:598f"] = "Steal and sell!\nThat's basic in\vcrime, kid!{DONE}",
    ["82:59bb"] = "They ditched this\nproject before\vthey finished.\fI'm searching for\nleftover loot.{DONE}",
    ["82:5a0c"] = "Over the top!{DONE}",
    ["82:5a1b"] = "UNDERGROUND WARE-\nHOUSE?\fWhat do you want\nto go there for?\fThere's nothing\ndown there.{DONE}",
    ["82:5a72"] = "I don't care if\nyou're lost.\fYou show up here,\nyou're nothing but\va victim!{DONE}",
    ["82:5abc"] = "Urk! Yeah, think\nyou're cool, huh?{DONE}",
    ["82:5adf"] = "You must have ice\nin your veins to\vdis TEAM ROCKET.{DONE}",
    ["82:5b14"] = "It's labeled\nSWITCH 1.{DONE}",
    ["82:5b2b"] = "Are you lost? No,\nyou can't be.\fYou don't have\nthat scared look.\fI'll give you\nsomething to be\vscared about!{DONE}",
    ["82:5b96"] = "How could you?{DONE}",
    ["82:5ba6"] = "Go wherever you'd\nlike! Get lost!\vSee if I care!{DONE}",
    ["82:5bd7"] = "It's OFF.\nTurn it ON?{DONE}",
    ["82:5bed"] = "It's ON.\nTurn it OFF?{DONE}",
    ["82:5c03"] = "It's labeled\nSWITCH 2.{DONE}",
    ["82:5c1a"] = "It's labeled\nSWITCH 3.{DONE}",
    ["82:5c31"] = "It's labeled\nEMERGENCY.{DONE}",
    ["82:60d9"] = "Hey! I'm looking\nfor MANKEY!{DONE}",
    ["82:60f6"] = "Beaten by a\npassing stranger!{DONE}",
    ["82:6170"] = "I'm going to train\neven harder.\fAfter all, I'm\ntrying to become\va GYM LEADER.{DONE}",
    ["82:61bd"] = "I'm the best in my\nclass at POKéMON.{DONE}",
    ["82:61df"] = "No! There are bet-\nter trainers…{DONE}",
    ["82:6201"] = "I'm trying hard so\nI can be the star\vin my class.{DONE}",
    ["82:6233"] = "I'm confident in\nmy ability to\vraise POKéMON.\fWant to see?{DONE}",
    ["82:626b"] = "Did I screw up my\ntraining?{DONE}",
    ["82:6288"] = "Maybe I should\ntake one to a DAY-\fCARE. Or maybe use\nsome items…{DONE}",
    ["82:62ca"] = "Shopping under the\nsky!\fIt feels so nice\nup on a rooftop.{DONE}",
    ["82:6305"] = "Are you a trainer?\fLet's have a\npractice battle.{DONE}",
    ["82:6336"] = "Oh, no! I just\ncan't win…{DONE}",
    ["82:6350"] = "You're too strong\nto be a practice\vpartner.{DONE}",
    ["82:637c"] = "Who goes there?\nWhat are you up\vto?{DONE}",
    ["82:63a1"] = "You're a tough\nlittle kid.{DONE}",
    ["82:63bc"] = "Yep, I see nothing\nwrong today. You\fbe good and stay\nout of trouble.{DONE}",
    ["82:6402"] = "I'm on patrol for\nsuspicious indi-\vviduals.{DONE}",
    ["82:642e"] = "I just got my\nPOKéMON back from\vDAY-CARE.\fLet's see how much\nstronger it got!{DONE}",
    ["82:6479"] = "Why does it end\nthis way?{DONE}",
    ["82:6494"] = "My POKéMON came\nback from DAY-CARE\vwith new moves.\fThat confounded me\nto no end!{DONE}",
    ["82:64e3"] = "IRENE: Kyaaah!\nSomeone found us!{DONE}",
    ["82:6505"] = "IRENE: Ohhh!\nToo strong!{DONE}",
    ["82:651f"] = "IRENE: My sister\nKATE will get you\vfor this!{DONE}",
    ["82:654d"] = "IRENE: Isn't this\nbeach great?\fIt's our secret\nlittle getaway!{DONE}",
    ["82:658b"] = "JENN: You can't\nbeat IRENE and go\vunpunished!{DONE}",
    ["82:65b9"] = "JENN: So sorry,\nIRENE! Sis!{DONE}",
    ["82:65d6"] = "JENN: Don't get\ncocky! My sister\vKATE is tough!{DONE}",
    ["82:6606"] = "JENN: Sunlight\nmakes your body\vstronger.{DONE}",
    ["82:6630"] = "KATE: You sure\nwere mean to my\vlittle sisters!{DONE}",
    ["82:6660"] = "KATE: No! I can't\nbelieve I lost.{DONE}",
    ["82:6682"] = "KATE: You're too\nstrong. I didn't\vstand a chance.\fHere. You deserve\nthis.{DONE}",
    ["82:66cb"] = "KATE: I'm sorry we\njumped you.\fWe never expected\nanyone to find us\fhere. You sure\nstartled us.{DONE}",
    ["82:6748"] = "ROUTE 34\fGOLDENROD CITY -\nAZALEA TOWN\fILEX FOREST\nSOMEWHERE BETWEEN{DONE}",
    ["82:678d"] = "TRAINER TIPS\fBERRY trees grow\nnew BERRIES\vevery day.\fMake a note of\nwhich trees bear\vwhich BERRIES.{DONE}",
    ["82:67f2"] = "DAY-CARE\fLET US RAISE YOUR\nPOKéMON FOR YOU!{DONE}",
    ["82:6d5e"] = "Oh, man… My boss\nis going to be\vsteaming…\fThe FARFETCH'D\nthat CUTS trees\ffor charcoal took\noff on me.\fI can't go looking\nfor it here in the\vILEX FOREST.\fIt's too big, dark\nand scary for me…{DONE}",
    ["82:6e1b"] = "Wow! Thanks a\nwhole bunch!\fMy boss's POKéMON\nwon't obey me be-\vcause I don't have\va BADGE.{DONE}",
    ["82:6e71"] = "It's the missing\nPOKéMON!{DONE}",
    ["82:6e88"] = "FARFETCH'D: Kwaa!{DONE}",
    ["82:6e9b"] = "Ah! My FARFETCH'D!\fYou found it for\nus, kid?\fWithout it, we\nwouldn't be able\fto CUT trees for\ncharcoal.\fThanks, kid!\fNow, how can I\nthank you…\fI know! Here, take\nthis.{DONE}",
    ["82:6f43"] = "That's the CUT HM.\nTeach that to a\fPOKéMON to clear\nsmall trees.\fOf course, you\nhave to have the\fGYM BADGE from\nAZALEA to use it.{DONE}",
    ["82:6fc2"] = "Do you want to\napprentice as a\fcharcoal maker\nwith me?\fYou'll be first-\nrate in ten years!{DONE}",
    ["82:701d"] = "What am I doing?\fI'm shaking trees\nusing HEADBUTT.\fIt's fun. Here,\nyou try it too!{DONE}",
    ["82:706f"] = "Rattle trees with\nHEADBUTT. Some-\vtimes, sleeping\vPOKéMON fall out.{DONE}",
    ["82:70b1"] = "Did something\nhappen to the\vforest's guardian?{DONE}",
    ["82:70e0"] = "ILEX FOREST is\nso overgrown with\ftrees that you\ncan't see the sky.\fPlease watch out\nfor items that may\vhave been dropped.{DONE}",
    ["82:715a"] = "ILEX FOREST\nSHRINE…\fIt's in honor of\nthe forest's\vprotector…{DONE}",
    ["82:7196"] = "ILEX FOREST\nSHRINE…\fIt's in honor of\nthe forest's\vprotector…\fOh? What is this?\fIt's a hole.\nIt looks like the\fGS BALL would fit\ninside it.\fWant to put the GS\nBALL here?{DONE}",
    ["82:723d"] = "{PLAYER} put in the\nGS BALL.{DONE}",
    ["82:7254"] = "Whew, wasn't that\nsomething!\f{PLAYER}, that was\nfantastic. Thanks!\fThe legends about\nthat SHRINE were\vreal after all.\fI feel inspired by\nwhat I just saw.\fIt motivates me to\nmake better BALLS!\fI'm going!{DONE}",
    ["82:7317"] = "Don't sneak up on\nme like that!\fYou frightened a\nPOKéMON away!{DONE}",
    ["82:7353"] = "I hadn't seen that\nPOKéMON before…{DONE}",
    ["82:7373"] = "A POKéMON I've\nnever seen before\ffell out of the\ntree when I used\vHEADBUTT.\fI ought to use\nHEADBUTT in other\vplaces too.{DONE}",
    ["82:7735"] = "It's a weird tree.\nUse SQUIRTBOTTLE?{DONE}",
    ["82:775a"] = "{PLAYER} used the\nSQUIRTBOTTLE.{DONE}",
    ["82:7774"] = "The weird tree\ndoesn't like the\vSQUIRTBOTTLE!\fThe weird tree\nattacked!{DONE}",
    ["82:77bb"] = "I'm the FLOWER\nSHOP's FLORIA!\fListen, listen!\fWhen I sprinkled\nwater on that\fwiggly tree, it\njumped right up!\fIt just has to be\na POKéMON.\fI bet it would be\nshocked out of its\fdisguise if you\nsoaked it!\fI know! I'll tell\nmy sis and borrow\vher water bottle!{DONE}",
    ["82:78b7"] = "When I told my sis\nabout the jiggly\ftree, she said\nit's dangerous.\fIf I beat WHITNEY,\nI wonder if she'll\flend me her water\nbottle…{DONE}",
    ["82:7939"] = "Wa-hey!\fI was going to\nsnap that tree\fwith my straight-\narm punch.\fBut I couldn't!\nI'm a failure!{DONE}",
    ["82:799a"] = "Did you clear that\nwretched tree?\fI'm impressed!\nI want you to\vhave this.{DONE}",
    ["82:79f6"] = "That happens to be\nROCK SMASH.\fYou can shatter\nrocks with just a\fsingle well-aimed\nsmack.\fIf any rocks are\nin your way, just\vsmash 'em up!{DONE}",
    ["82:7af0"] = "Be careful at\nnight on this\vroute!\fI saw a POKéMON\nthat looked like\fGROWLITHE, but it\nhad a scary aura\vto it.{DONE}",
    ["82:7b5c"] = "That odd tree dis-\nappeared without a\vtrace.\fOh! That tree was\nreally a POKéMON?{DONE}",
    ["82:7bab"] = "I'm going to read\nyour thoughts!{DONE}",
    ["82:7bcc"] = "I misread you!{DONE}",
    ["82:7bdc"] = "I'd be strong if\nonly I could tell\fwhat my opponent\nwas thinking.{DONE}",
    ["82:7c1e"] = "Thanks to my stud-\nies, I'm ready for\vany POKéMON!{DONE}",
    ["82:7c4e"] = "Oops! Computation\nerror?{DONE}",
    ["82:7c68"] = "Darn. I study five\nhours a day too.\fThere's more to\nlearning than just\vreading books.{DONE}",
    ["82:7cbe"] = "ARTHUR: Who are\nyou?\fI'm ARTHUR of\nThursday.{DONE}",
    ["82:7ceb"] = "Here. You can have\nthis.{DONE}",
    ["82:7d05"] = "ARTHUR: A POKéMON\nthat uses rock-\ftype moves should\nhold on to that.\fIt pumps up rock-\ntype attacks.{DONE}",
    ["82:7d68"] = "ARTHUR: I'm ARTHUR\nof Thursday. I'm\fthe second son out\nof seven children.{DONE}",
    ["82:7db1"] = "ARTHUR: Today's\nnot Thursday. How\vdisappointing.{DONE}",
    ["82:7de2"] = "ROUTE 36{DONE}",
    ["82:7dec"] = "RUINS OF ALPH\nNORTH ENTRANCE{DONE}",
    ["82:7e0a"] = "TRAINER TIPS\fPOKéMON stats\nvary--even within\vthe same species.\fTheir stats may be\nsimilar at first.\fHowever, differ-\nences will become\fpronounced as the\nPOKéMON grow.{DONE}",
    ["82:7eac"] = "TRAINER TIPS\fUse DIG to return\nto the entrance of\vany place.\fIt is convenient\nfor exploring\fcaves and other\nlandmarks.{DONE}",
    ["83:425f"] = "Hiya!\fI am important\ndoctor!\fI study here rare\nPOKéMON fossils!\fYou! Have you a\nfossil for me?{DONE}",
    ["83:42bc"] = "But this one\ncould take a\vlong time.\fAre you sure\nyou don't want\vany other fossils\vrevived first?{DONE}",
    ["83:431e"] = "No! Is too bad!\fYou come again!{DONE}",
    ["83:433f"] = "No! Is too bad!\fYour party is\nalready full!{DONE}",
    ["83:436c"] = "Wow this one is\nquite complex...\fI take a little\ntime!\fYou go for walk a\nlittle while!{DONE}",
    ["83:43c4"] = "Where were you?\fYour fossil is\nback to life!{DONE}",
    ["83:43f2"] = "Oh! That is\na fossil!\fIt is fossil of\n{STRBUF}, a\fPOKéMON that is\nalready extinct!\fMy Resurrection\nMachine will make\vthat POKéMON live\vagain!{DONE}",
    ["83:4478"] = "So! You hurry and\ngive me that!\f{PLAYER} handed\nover the fossil.{DONE}",
    ["83:44b3"] = "{PLAYER} received\n{STRBUF}!{DONE}",
    ["83:44c6"] = "Done!\fI modified your\nPOKéDEX.\fI added an\noptional POKéDEX\fto store UNOWN\ndata.\fIt records them in\nthe sequence that\vthey were caught.{DONE}",
    ["83:4548"] = "{PLAYER}'s POKéDEX\nwas upgraded.{DONE}",
    ["83:455f"] = "The UNOWN you\ncatch will all be\vrecorded.\fCheck to see how\nmany kinds exist.{DONE}",
    ["83:45ad"] = "You caught all the\nUNOWN variations?\fThat's a great\nachievement!\fI've set up the\nprinter here for\vhandling UNOWN.\fFeel free to use\nit anytime.{DONE}",
    ["83:463b"] = "The RUINS are\nabout 1500 years\vold.\fBut it's not known\nwhy they were\vbuilt--or by whom.{DONE}",
    ["83:4693"] = "I wonder how many\nkinds of POKéMON\vare in the RUINS?{DONE}",
    ["83:46c6"] = "POKéMON appeared\nin the RUINS?\fThat's incredible\nnews!\fWe'll need to\ninvestigate this.{DONE}",
    ["83:4719"] = "Our investigation,\nwith your help, is\fgiving us insight\ninto the RUINS.\fThe RUINS appear\nto have been built\fas a habitat for\nPOKéMON.{DONE}",
    ["83:479d"] = "There are odd pat-\nterns drawn on the\fwalls of the\nRUINS.\fThey must be the\nkeys for unravel-\ving the mystery\vof the RUINS.{DONE}",
    ["83:4819"] = "The strange POKé-\nMON you saw in the\vRUINS?\fThey appear to be\nvery much like the\fdrawings on the\nwalls there.\fHmm…\fThat must mean\nthere are many\vkinds of them…{DONE}",
    ["83:49b7"] = "Why did those\nancient patterns\fappear on the wall\nnow?\fThe mystery\ndeepens…{DONE}",
    ["83:4a5c"] = "I wonder what\nthis machine does.{DONE}",
    ["83:4a7e"] = "UNOWN may be\nprinted out.{DONE}",
    ["83:4ad7"] = "There are many\nacademic books.\fAncient Ruins…\nMysteries of the\vAncients…{DONE}",
    ["83:4d22"] = "LANCE: It takes\ntwo passwords to\fget into the\nboss's quarters.\fThose passwords\nare known only to\va few ROCKETS.\fThat ROCKET there\nvery graciously\vtold me so.\f{PLAYER}, let's go\nget the passwords.{DONE}",
    ["83:4dde"] = "Urrggh… The guy\nin the cape is\vincredibly tough…{DONE}",
    ["83:4e10"] = "…\fDidn't I tell you\nthat I was going\fto destroy TEAM\nROCKET?\f…Tell me, who was\nthe guy in the\fcape who used\ndragon POKéMON?\fMy POKéMON were no\nmatch at all.\fIt's what he said\nthat bothers me…\fHe told me that\nI don't love and\ftrust my POKéMON\nenough.\fIt's not my fault\nmy team is so\vuseless.\fI'm furious that I\nlost to a bleeding\vheart like him.\fBut it makes me\nquestion myself.\fIs there something\nI'm doing wrong?\fCould it be that\nlove made his\vteam so powerful?{DONE}",
    ["83:4fd1"] = "What? Who are you?\nThis is the office\fof our leader,\nGIOVANNI.\fSince disbanding\nTEAM ROCKET three\fyears ago, he has\nbeen in hiding.\fBut we're certain\nhe will be back\fsome day to assume\ncommand again.\fI won't let you\ninterfere with\vour plans!{DONE}",
    ["83:50c2"] = "I… I couldn't do a\nthing…\fGIOVANNI, please\nforgive me…{DONE}",
    ["83:50f9"] = "No, I can't let\nthis affect me.\fI have to inform\nthe others…{DONE}",
    ["83:5136"] = "MURKROW: The\npassword is…\fHAIL GIOVANNI.{DONE}",
    ["83:5160"] = "Do I know the\npassword?\fMaybe.\fBut no weakling's\ngoing to get it!{DONE}",
    ["83:51a2"] = "All right. Stop.\nI'll tell you.{DONE}",
    ["83:51c2"] = "The password to\nthe boss's room is\fSLOWPOKETAIL.\fBut it's useless\nunless you have\vtwo passwords.{DONE}",
    ["83:5222"] = "Hyuck-hyuck-hyuck!\fI remember you\nfrom the well!\fYou're challenging\nme again?\fHah! You're nuts,\nbut you have guts!\fI'll warn you,\nI got better!\fIf you can beat\nme, I'll tell you\fa password to the\nboss's room!{DONE}",
    ["83:52ef"] = "Hyuck-hyuck-hyuck!\nYou're good!{DONE}",
    ["83:530f"] = "Hyuck-hyuck-hyuck!\fThe password to\nthe boss's room…\fUh…, I think it is\nRATICATE TAIL.{DONE}",
    ["83:5365"] = "I used to work for\nSILPH, but now I\frun research for\nTEAM ROCKET.\fA meddlesome child\nlike you needs to\vbe punished.{DONE}",
    ["83:53da"] = "A mere tactical\nerror cost me…{DONE}",
    ["83:53fa"] = "A radio signal\nthat drives POKé-\vMON mad…\fMy experiment is a\ncomplete success.\fMy promotion is\nassured. This loss\fmeans absolutely\nnothing.{DONE}",
    ["83:5484"] = "I don't care that\nPOKéMON are hurt\vby our experiment.{DONE}",
    ["83:54b7"] = "Thinking is my\nstrong suit, not\vbattling.{DONE}",
    ["83:54e2"] = "If we turn up the\npower of our radio\fsignal for broad-\ncast nationwide…\fThe very thought\nexcites me!{DONE}",
    ["83:5548"] = "The door's closed…\fIt needs two\npasswords to open.{DONE}",
    ["83:557b"] = "The door's closed…\f{PLAYER} entered\nthe two passwords.\fThe door opened!{DONE}",
    ["83:5a17"] = "Kurt: I'll get\nstarted right now!{DONE}",
    ["83:5a39"] = "Hm? Who are you?\f{PLAYER}, eh? You\nwant me to make\vsome BALLS?\fSorry, but that'll\nhave to wait.\fDo you know TEAM\nROCKET? Ah, don't\fworry. I'll tell\nyou anyhow.\fTEAM ROCKET's an\nevil gang that\fuses POKéMON for\ntheir dirty work.\fThey're supposed\nto have disbanded\vthree years ago.\fAnyway, they're at\nthe WELL, cutting\foff SLOWPOKETAILS\nfor sale!\fSo I'm going to\ngo give them a\vlesson in pain!\fHang on, SLOWPOKE!\nOld KURT is on his\vway!{DONE}",
    ["83:5bdb"] = "KURT: Hi, {PLAYER}!\fYou handled your-\nself like a real\vhero at the WELL.\fI like your style!\fI would be honored\nto make BALLS for\fa trainer like\nyou.\fThis is all I have\nnow, but take it.{DONE}",
    ["83:5c8f"] = "KURT: I make BALLS\nfrom APRICORNS.\fCollect them from\ntrees and bring\v'em to me.\fI'll make BALLS\nout of them.{DONE}",
    ["83:5cfc"] = "KURT: You have an\nAPRICORN for me?\fFine! I'll turn it\ninto a BALL.{DONE}",
    ["83:5d3f"] = "KURT: Oh…\nThat's a letdown.{DONE}",
    ["83:5d5b"] = "KURT: I'm working!\nDon't bother me!{DONE}",
    ["83:5d7e"] = "KURT: Ah, {PLAYER}!\nI just finished\vyour BALL. Here!{DONE}",
    ["83:5dad"] = "KURT: That turned\nout great.\fTry catching\nPOKéMON with it.{DONE}",
    ["83:5de6"] = "KURT: Now that my\ngranddaughter is\fhelping me, I can\nwork much faster.{DONE}",
    ["83:5e2e"] = "Wh-what is that?\fI've never seen\none before.\fIt looks a lot\nlike a POKé BALL,\fbut it appears to\nbe something else.\fLet me check it\nfor you.{DONE}",
    ["83:5eb7"] = "I'm checking it\nnow.{DONE}",
    ["83:5ecc"] = "Ah-ha! I see!\nSo…{DONE}",
    ["83:5edf"] = "{PLAYER}!\fThis BALL started\nto shake while I\vwas checking it.\fThere must be\nsomething to this!{DONE}",
    ["83:5f38"] = "The SLOWPOKE are\ngone… Were they\ftaken away by bad\npeople?{DONE}",
    ["83:5f74"] = "Grandpa's gone…\nI'm so lonely…{DONE}",
    ["83:5f92"] = "The SLOWPOKE my\ndad gave me came\fback! Its TAIL is\ngrowing back too!{DONE}",
    ["83:5fd8"] = "Dad works at SILPH\nwhere he studies\vPOKé BALLS.\fI have to stay\nhome with Grandpa\vand SLOWPOKE.{DONE}",
    ["83:6035"] = "I get to help\nGrandpa now!\fWe'll make good\nBALLS for you, so\vplease wait!{DONE}",
    ["83:607f"] = "It's fun to make\nBALLS!{DONE}",
    ["83:6097"] = "Grandpa's checking\na BALL right now.\fSo I'm waiting\ntill he's done.{DONE}",
    ["83:60d9"] = "SLOWPOKE: …\nYawn?{DONE}",
    ["83:60ec"] = "…A young PROF.\nOAK?{DONE}",
    ["83:6101"] = "It's a statue of\nthe forest's pro-\vtector.{DONE}",
    ["83:612b"] = "This one\ncould take a\vlong time.\fAre you sure\nyou don't want\vme to make\vany more balls\vfirst?{DONE}",
    ["83:64dd"] = "Hm… Good to see\nyou here.\fNo need to explain\nwhy you came.\fCLAIR sent you\nhere, didn't she?\fThat girl is a\nhandful…\fI am sorry, but I\nmust test you.\fNot to worry, you\nare to answer only\va few questions.\fReady?{DONE}",
    ["83:65af"] = "What are POKéMON\nto you?{DONE}",
    ["83:65c6"] = "What helps you to\nwin battles?{DONE}",
    ["83:65e6"] = "What kind of\ntrainer do you\vwish to battle?{DONE}",
    ["83:6613"] = "What is most\nimportant for\vraising POKéMON?{DONE}",
    ["83:663d"] = "Strong POKéMON.\nWeak POKéMON.\fWhich is more\nimportant?{DONE}",
    ["83:666f"] = "Hm… I see…\fYou care deeply\nfor POKéMON.\fVery commendable.\fThat conviction is\nwhat is important!\f{PLAYER}, don't\nlose that belief.\fIt will see you\nthrough at the\vPOKéMON LEAGUE.{DONE}",
    ["83:6713"] = "CLAIR!\fThis child is\nimpeccable, in\vskill and spirit!\fAdmit defeat and\nconfer the RISING-\vBADGE!\f…Or must I inform\nLANCE of this?{DONE}",
    ["83:6796"] = "CLAIR…\fReflect upon what\nit is that you\flack and this\nchild has.{DONE}",
    ["83:67d8"] = "Come again, if you\nso desire.{DONE}",
    ["83:67f7"] = "Hm… Good to see\nyou here.\fYour arrival is\nmost fortunate.\fI have something\nfor you.\fTake this DRATINI\nas proof that I\fhave recognized\nyour worth.{DONE}",
    ["83:688a"] = "{PLAYER} received\nDRATINI!{DONE}",
    ["83:689f"] = "Hm? Your POKéMON\nparty is full.{DONE}",
    ["83:68bd"] = "Dragon POKéMON are\nsymbolic of our\vclan.\fYou have shown\nthat you can be\fentrusted with\none.{DONE}",
    ["83:6917"] = "CLAIR appears to\nhave learned an\finvaluable lesson\nfrom you.\fI thank you as her\ngrandfather.{DONE}",
    ["83:6975"] = "A boy close to\nyour age is in\vtraining here.\fHe is much like\nCLAIR when she was\fyounger. It is a\nlittle worrisome…{DONE}",
    ["83:69e9"] = "Hah? I didn't\nquite catch that…{DONE}",
    ["83:6a09"] = "What was it you\nsaid?{DONE}",
    ["83:6a20"] = "Oh, I understand…{DONE}",
    ["83:6a33"] = "It's been quite\nsome time since a\ftrainer has gained\nour MASTER's rare\vapproval.\fIn fact, not since\nMaster LANCE.{DONE}",
    ["83:6aa4"] = "You know young\nMaster LANCE?\fHe looks so much\nlike our MASTER\vdid in his youth.\fIt's in their\nblood.{DONE}",
    ["83:6b09"] = "So how did it go?\fI guess there's no\npoint in asking.\fYou did fail?\f………………………………\f…What? You passed?{DONE}",
    ["83:6b67"] = "That can't be!{DONE}",
    ["83:6b76"] = "You're lying!\fEven I haven't\nbeen approved!{DONE}",
    ["83:6ba1"] = "I-I understand…{DONE}",
    ["83:6bb2"] = "Here, this is the\nRISINGBADGE…\fHurry up! Take it!{DONE}",
    ["83:6be5"] = "{PLAYER} received\nRISINGBADGE.{DONE}",
    ["83:6bfe"] = "RISINGBADGE will\nenable your\fPOKéMON to use the\nmove for climbing\vwaterfalls.\fAlso, all POKéMON\nwill recognize you\fas a trainer and\nobey your every\fcommand without\nquestion.{DONE}",
    ["83:6ca7"] = "………………………………{DONE}",
    ["83:6d22"] = "Nothin' but\nGYARADOS…\fI know it's them.{DONE}",
    ["83:6e96"] = "This lake is full\nof GYARADOS but\vnothing else…\fSo the MAGIKARP\nare being forced\vto evolve…{DONE}",
    ["83:6ef3"] = "Did you come here\nbecause of the\vrumors?\fYou're {PLAYER}?\nI'm LANCE, a\vtrainer like you.{DONE}",
    ["83:6f44"] = "This man here\ninformed me of\vsome rumors.\fSo we came to\ninvestigate…{DONE}",
    ["83:6f8a"] = "I saw the way you\nbattled earlier,\v{PLAYER}.\fI can tell that\nyou're a trainer\fwith considerable\nskill.\fIf you don't mind,\ncould you help us\vinvestigate?{DONE}",
    ["83:701b"] = "LANCE: Excellent!\fIt seems that the\nLAKE's MAGIKARP\fare being forced\nto evolve.\fA mysterious radio\nbroadcast coming\ffrom MAHOGANY is\nthe cause.\fWe'll be waiting\nfor you, {PLAYER}.{DONE}",
    ["83:70c7"] = "Oh… Well, if you\nchange your mind,\vplease help us.{DONE}",
    ["83:70fb"] = "LANCE: Hm? Are you\ngoing to help us?{DONE}",
    ["83:7121"] = "GYARADOS: Gyashaa!{DONE}",
    ["83:7135"] = "{PLAYER} obtained a\nRED SCALE.{DONE}",
    ["83:714e"] = "The GYARADOS are\nangry!\fIt's a bad omen!{DONE}",
    ["83:7177"] = "Hahah! The MAGI-\nKARP are biting!{DONE}",
    ["83:719a"] = "I heard this lake\nwas made by ram-\vpaging GYARADOS.\fI wonder if there\nis any connection\fto their mass out-\nbreak now?{DONE}",
    ["83:7211"] = "Did my eyes de-\nceive me? I saw a\fred GYARADOS in\nthe LAKE…\fBut I thought\nGYARADOS were\vusually blue?{DONE}",
    ["83:7278"] = "Let me battle with\nthe POKéMON I just\vcaught!{DONE}",
    ["83:72a4"] = "I might be an ex-\npert angler, but\fI stink as a POKé-\nMON trainer…{DONE}",
    ["83:72e5"] = "I won't lose as an\nangler! I catch\vPOKéMON all day.{DONE}",
    ["83:7316"] = "No matter what I\ndo, all I catch\fare the same POKé-\nMON…{DONE}",
    ["83:734d"] = "My line's all\ntangled up…{DONE}",
    ["83:7367"] = "Why can't I catch\nany good POKéMON?{DONE}",
    ["83:7388"] = "If a trainer spots\nanother trainer,\fhe has to make a\nchallenge.\fThat is our\ndestiny.{DONE}",
    ["83:73de"] = "Whew…\nGood battle.{DONE}",
    ["83:73f2"] = "POKéMON and their\ntrainer become\fpowerful through\nconstant battling.{DONE}",
    ["83:7435"] = "What happened to\nthe red GYARADOS?\fIt's gone?\fOh, darn. I came\nhere for nothing?\fI know--let's\nbattle!{DONE}",
    ["83:749b"] = "Good going!{DONE}",
    ["83:74a8"] = "Come to think of\nit, I've seen a\vpink BUTTERFREE.{DONE}",
    ["83:74da"] = "WESLEY: Well, how\ndo you do?\fSeeing as how it's\nWednesday today,\fI'm WESLEY of\nWednesday.{DONE}",
    ["83:7533"] = "Pleased to meet\nyou. Please take a\vsouvenir.{DONE}",
    ["83:7561"] = "WESLEY: BLACKBELT\nbeefs up the power\vof fighting moves.{DONE}",
    ["83:759a"] = "WESLEY: Since you\nfound me, you must\fhave met my broth-\ners and sisters.\fOr did you just\nget lucky?{DONE}",
    ["83:75ff"] = "WESLEY: Today's\nnot Wednesday.\vThat's too bad.{DONE}",
    ["83:762d"] = "LAKE OF RAGE,\nalso known as\vGYARADOS LAKE.{DONE}",
    ["83:7659"] = "FISHING GURU'S\nHOUSE{DONE}",
    ["83:79a0"] = "Aack! You made me\nlose a POLIWAG!\fWhat are you going\nto do about it?{DONE}",
    ["83:79e6"] = "Just forget about\nit.{DONE}",
    ["83:79fd"] = "That POLIWAG that\ngot away…\vIt was huge.\fI swear it must've\nbeen 16 feet long!{DONE}",
    ["83:7a4c"] = "I fish until I\ncan't anymore.\fI also battle\nuntil I drop.\fThat's my\nrelationship\vwith my POKéMON.{DONE}",
    ["83:7aaa"] = "Hmmmm… \nThis isn't right.{DONE}",
    ["83:7ac4"] = "That's 100 wins\nto 101 losses.\fI won't battle\nagain for a while.{DONE}",
    ["83:7b04"] = "Do you know about\nthe legendary bird\vPOKéMON?{DONE}",
    ["83:7b30"] = "Whew! You're hot\nstuff.{DONE}",
    ["83:7b48"] = "ARTICUNO, ZAPDOS\nand MOLTRES are\fthe three legend-\nary bird POKéMON.\fI heard there are\nother legendary\vbirds, though.{DONE}",
    ["83:7bbc"] = "Why can't I ever\nbeat you?\fOh yeah, here you\ngo. It's that gift\fI couldn't give\nyou last time.{DONE}",
    ["83:7c19"] = "I'm gonna win,\nfor sure!{DONE}",
    ["83:7c32"] = "Arrgh… That's a\nshocking loss…{DONE}",
    ["83:7c51"] = "It's important to\nhave conviction\von your side.{DONE}",
    ["83:7c81"] = "I'll do anything\nto get my hands on\vrare POKéMON!{DONE}",
    ["83:7cb0"] = "Oooh, your POKéMON\nare so appealing.{DONE}",
    ["83:7cd3"] = "If a POKéMON has\ndifferent colors\ffrom usual, it's\nmore valuable.\fWhat? You mean\nthat's not true?{DONE}",
    ["83:7d31"] = "I can tell you're\na good trainer by\vlooking at you.\fI'm good at POKé-\nMON, and I can see\vthat you are too.{DONE}",
    ["83:7d98"] = "Tch! It's a total\nloss on my part.{DONE}",
    ["83:7dbb"] = "Wow. You have a\nlot of BADGES.\fNo wonder you're\nso tough.\fI wonder if\nECRUTEAK GYM's\fMORTY is still in\ntraining?\fHe really hammered\nme.{DONE}",
    ["83:7e42"] = "You look strong.\fGood trainers seek\ntough opponents\vinstinctively.{DONE}",
    ["83:7e86"] = "Nope! This won't\ndo at all.{DONE}",
    ["83:7ea2"] = "We all get better\nby experiencing\vmany battles.\fI battled a lot to\nbecome what I am\vtoday--an elite.{DONE}",
    ["83:7f08"] = "ROUTE 44\nICE PATH AHEAD{DONE}",
    ["83:7f21"] = "ROUTE 44\fMAHOGANY TOWN -\nBLACKTHORN CITY{DONE}",
    ["84:4192"] = "They built the new\nRADIO TOWER to\freplace the old,\ncreaky one.{DONE}",
    ["84:41d2"] = "I know there's a\nnew BIKE SHOP, but\fI can't find it\nanywhere.{DONE}",
    ["84:420f"] = "Is that man in\nblack dressed up\flike a TEAM ROCKET\nmember? How silly!{DONE}",
    ["84:4256"] = "Was that man in\nblack really part\fof TEAM ROCKET? I\ncan't believe it!{DONE}",
    ["84:429c"] = "The RADIO TOWER in\nGOLDENROD CITY is\va landmark.\fThey're running a\npromotional cam- \vpaign right now.\fThey'll modify\nyour POKéGEAR,\fso it can also\nserve as a radio.{DONE}",
    ["84:433d"] = "Oh, your POKéGEAR\nworks as a radio!{DONE}",
    ["84:435f"] = "E-he-he-he…\fI got in trouble\nfor playing in the\fbasement of the\nDEPT.STORE.{DONE}",
    ["84:43ac"] = "The man at that\nhouse rates your\vPOKéMON names.\fHe can even rename\nyour POKéMON.{DONE}",
    ["84:43f8"] = "Whew! This is one\nbig town. I don't\fknow where any-\nthing is.{DONE}",
    ["84:4436"] = "So this is the\nRADIO TOWER…{DONE}",
    ["84:4453"] = "What do you want,\nyou pest? Scram!{DONE}",
    ["84:4477"] = "Stay out of the\nway! Beat it!{DONE}",
    ["84:4496"] = "Take over the\nRADIO TOWER…\fWhat? It's none of\nyour business!{DONE}",
    ["84:44d3"] = "POKéMON? They're\nnothing more than\ftools for making\nmoney!{DONE}",
    ["84:450b"] = "Our dream will\nsoon come true…\fIt was such a long\nstruggle…{DONE}",
    ["84:4548"] = "Hey, brat! You\ndon't belong here!\vGet lost!{DONE}",
    ["84:4574"] = "Come taste the\ntrue terror of\vTEAM ROCKET!{DONE}",
    ["84:45a0"] = "GOLDENROD CITY\nSTATION{DONE}",
    ["84:45b8"] = "GOLDENROD CITY\nRADIO TOWER{DONE}",
    ["84:45d4"] = "Full Selection of\nPOKéMON Goods!\fGOLDENROD CITY\nDEPT.STORE{DONE}",
    ["84:460d"] = "GOLDENROD CITY\nPOKéMON GYM\vLEADER: WHITNEY\fThe Incredibly\nPretty Girl!{DONE}",
    ["84:4652"] = "GOLDENROD CITY\fThe Festive City\nof Opulent Charm{DONE}",
    ["84:4684"] = "The World is a\nCycle Path!\vBIKE SHOP{DONE}",
    ["84:46aa"] = "Your Playground!\fGOLDENROD CITY\nGAME CORNER{DONE}",
    ["84:46d7"] = "NAME RATER\fGet Your POKéMON\nNicknames Rated{DONE}",
    ["84:4701"] = "UNDERGROUND\nENTRANCE{DONE}",
    ["84:4717"] = "UNDERGROUND\nENTRANCE{DONE}",
    ["84:474b"] = "Blooming Beautiful\nFLOWER SHOP{DONE}",
    ["84:476b"] = "I can teach your\nPOKéMON amazing\fmoves if you'd\nlike.\fShould I teach a\nnew move?{DONE}",
    ["84:47b9"] = "It will cost you\n1000 coins. Okay?{DONE}",
    ["84:47dd"] = "Aww… But they're\namazing…{DONE}",
    ["84:47f7"] = "Wahahah! You won't\nregret it!\fWhich move should\nI teach?{DONE}",
    ["84:4830"] = "Hm, too bad. I'll\nhave to get some\vcash from home…{DONE}",
    ["84:4863"] = "If you understand\nwhat's so amazing\fabout this move,\nyou've made it as\va trainer.{DONE}",
    ["84:48b4"] = "Wahahah!\nFarewell, kid!{DONE}",
    ["84:48cd"] = "B-but…{DONE}",
    ["84:48d5"] = "…You don't have\nenough coins here…{DONE}",
    ["84:48f8"] = "",
    ["84:4c3d"] = "EUSINE: Awesome!\nToo awesome, even!\fI've never seen a\nbattle that great.\fThat was truly\ninspiring to see.\fSUICUNE was tough,\nbut you were even\fmore incredible,\n{PLAYER}.\fI heard SUICUNE's\nmystic power\fsummons a rainbow-\ncolored POKéMON.\fMaybe, just maybe,\nwhat went on today\fwill cause that\nPOKéMON to appear.\fI'm going to study\nthe legends more.\fThanks for showing\nme that fantastic\vbattle.\fLater, {PLAYER}!{DONE}",
    ["84:4dc0"] = "According to\nlegend…\fWhen the souls of\nPOKéMON and humans\fcommune, from the\nheavens descends a\fPOKéMON of rainbow\ncolors…\fCould it mean the\nlegendary POKéMON\fare testing us\nhumans?{DONE}",
    ["84:4e6d"] = "When the BRASS\nTOWER burned down,\fthree nameless\nPOKéMON were said\fto have perished.\nIt was tragic.\fHowever…\fA rainbow-colored\nPOKéMON…\fIn other words…\fHO-OH descended\nfrom the sky and\fgave new life to\nthe three POKéMON.\fThey are…\fSUICUNE, ENTEI and\nRAIKOU.\fThat is what they\nsay.{DONE}",
    ["84:4f7e"] = "The two TOWERS are\nsaid to have been\fbuilt to foster\nfriendship and\fhope between POKé-\nMON and people.\fThat was 700 years\nago, but the ideal\fstill remains\nimportant today.{DONE}",
    ["84:5028"] = "HO-OH appears to\nhave descended\fupon this, the TIN\nTOWER!{DONE}",
    ["84:5063"] = "This will protect\nyou. Take it.{DONE}",
    ["84:5084"] = "Now, go.{DONE}",
    ["84:508e"] = "I believe you are\nbeing tested.\fFree your mind\nfrom uncertainty,\vand advance.{DONE}",
    ["84:50dd"] = "I knew it.\fI knew you'd get\nto see the POKéMON\fof rainbow colors,\n{PLAYER}.\fIt happened just\nas I envisioned.\fMy research isn't\nbad, I might say.\fI'm going to keep\nstudying POKéMON\fto become a famous\nPOKéMANIAC!{DONE}",
    ["84:519f"] = "The legendary\nPOKéMON are said\fto embody three\npowers…\fThe lightning that\nstruck the TOWER.\fThe fire that\nburned the TOWER.\fAnd the rain that\nput out the fire…{DONE}",
    ["84:523d"] = "When the legendary\nPOKéMON appeared…\fThey struck terror\nin those who saw\vtheir rise.\fAnd…\fSome even took to\nfutile attacks.\fThe legendary\nPOKéMON, knowing\ftheir own power,\nfled, ignoring the\vfrightened people.{DONE}",
    ["84:530a"] = "Of the legendary\nPOKéMON, SUICUNE\fis said to be the\nclosest to HO-OH.\fI hear there may\nalso be a link to\fPOKéMON known as\nUNOWN.\fThe POKéMON UNOWN\nmust be sharing a\fcooperative bond\nwith SUICUNE.{DONE}",
    ["84:55ad"] = "Welcome!{DONE}",
    ["84:55b7"] = "Hello. I'm sorry,\nbut we're not\voffering any tours\vtoday.{DONE}",
    ["84:55f0"] = "Hi, are you here\nfor the LUCKY NUM-\vBER SHOW?\fWant me to check\nthe ID numbers of\vyour POKéMON?\fIf you get lucky,\nyou win a prize.{DONE}",
    ["84:5670"] = "This week's ID\nnumber is {STRBUF}.{DONE}",
    ["84:5690"] = "Let's see if you\nhave a match.{DONE}",
    ["84:56af"] = "……\n……{DONE}",
    ["84:56b4"] = "Please come back\nnext week for the\vnext LUCKY NUMBER.{DONE}",
    ["84:56eb"] = "Wow! You have a\nperfect match of\vall five numbers!\fWe have a grand\nprize winner!\fYou have won a\nMASTER BALL!{DONE}",
    ["84:5759"] = "Hey! You've\nmatched the last\vthree numbers!\fYou've won second\nprize, an EXP.\vSHARE!{DONE}",
    ["84:57ac"] = "Ooh, you've\nmatched the last\vtwo numbers.\fYou've won third\nprize, a PP UP.{DONE}",
    ["84:57f6"] = "Nope, none of your\nID numbers match.{DONE}",
    ["84:581c"] = "You've got no room\nfor your prize.\fMake room and come\nback right away.{DONE}",
    ["84:5863"] = "We have a special\nquiz campaign on\vright now.\fAnswer five ques-\ntions correctly to\vwin a RADIO CARD.\fSlide it into your\nPOKéGEAR to play\fthe radio anytime,\nanywhere.\fWould you like to\ntake the quiz?{DONE}",
    ["84:5928"] = "Question 1:\fIs there a POKéMON\nthat appears only\vin the morning?{DONE}",
    ["84:5967"] = "Correct!\nQuestion 2:\fIs this statement\ncorrect?\fYou can't buy a\nBERRY at a MART.{DONE}",
    ["84:59b8"] = "Bull's-eye!\nQuestion 3:\fDoes HM01 contain\nthe move FLASH?{DONE}",
    ["84:59f2"] = "So far so good!\nQuestion 4:\fIs FALKNER the\nVIOLET GYM LEADER\fwho uses bird\nPOKéMON?{DONE}",
    ["84:5a44"] = "Wow! Right again!\nHere's the final\vquestion:\fDo GOLDENROD GAME\nCORNER's slots\fhave CHARMANDER\non their reels?{DONE}",
    ["84:5ab1"] = "Bingo! You got it!\nCongratulations!\fHere's your prize,\na RADIO CARD!{DONE}",
    ["84:5af6"] = "{PLAYER}'s POKéGEAR\ncan now double as\va radio!{DONE}",
    ["84:5b1b"] = "Please tune in to\nour radio shows.{DONE}",
    ["84:5b3f"] = "Oh, dear.\nSorry, but you\fgot it wrong.\nPlease try again!{DONE}",
    ["84:5b79"] = "Oh. I see. Please\nsee me if you\vchange your mind.{DONE}",
    ["84:5bac"] = "BEN is a fabulous\nDJ.\fHis sweet voice\nmakes me melt!{DONE}",
    ["84:5be2"] = "I love MARY, from\nPOKéMON TALK.\fI only know what\nshe sounds like,\vthough.{DONE}",
    ["84:5c2a"] = "We've finally\ntaken over the\vRADIO TOWER!\fNow everyone will\nget to experience\fthe true terror of\nTEAM ROCKET!\fWe'll show you\nhow scary we are!{DONE}",
    ["84:5cb8"] = "Too strong! I'm\nsorry boss…{DONE}",
    ["84:5cd4"] = "You're too strong.\fOur plan could be\nruined. I must\vwarn the others…{DONE}",
    ["84:5d19"] = "1F RECEPTION\n2F SALES\f3F PERSONNEL\n4F PRODUCTION\f5F DIRECTOR'S\n   OFFICE{DONE}",
    ["84:5d63"] = "LUCKY CHANNEL!\fWin with POKéMON\nID numbers!\fTrade your POKéMON\nto collect differ-\vent ID numbers!{DONE}",
    ["84:6053"] = "Be prepared for\nanything!\fLet me see if your\nPOKéMON have been\vraised properly!{DONE}",
    ["84:60a1"] = "Oh, I lost that!{DONE}",
    ["84:60b3"] = "I'll head back to\nBLACKTHORN's ICE\fPATH and train\nsome more.{DONE}",
    ["84:60ef"] = "Yo! You're spunky!\nBut you know what?\fWhen it comes to\nsheer spunkiness,\vI'm the man!{DONE}",
    ["84:6144"] = "My POKéMON weren't\nspunky enough!{DONE}",
    ["84:6163"] = "Boy, do I love\nHP UP! Mmmm, yum!\fI keep drinking my\nPOKéMON's!\fI can't help it!{DONE}",
    ["84:61af"] = "My POKéMON are\npower packed!{DONE}",
    ["84:61ca"] = "Wahahah! I'm the\nbig loser!{DONE}",
    ["84:61e6"] = "I'm not much good\nat thinking, see?\fSo, I just plow\nahead with power!{DONE}",
    ["84:622c"] = "Why do I climb\nmountains?\fBecause they're\nthere.\fWhy do I train\nPOKéMON?\fBecause they're\nthere!{DONE}",
    ["84:6288"] = "Losses…\nThey're there too!{DONE}",
    ["84:62a3"] = "The best thing to\never happen to me\fwas discovering\nPOKéMON.{DONE}",
    ["84:62de"] = "I just can't find\na way to win!\fKeep it up!\fOh, and take this\n--it's the gift\fyou couldn't take\nwhen we last met.{DONE}",
    ["84:634e"] = "I was training\nhere alone.\fBehold the fruits\nof my labor!{DONE}",
    ["84:6389"] = "Waaaargh!{DONE}",
    ["84:6394"] = "This calls for\nextreme measures.\fI must take to the\nhills and train in\vsolitude.{DONE}",
    ["84:63e6"] = "I'm going to train\na bit more before\vI break for lunch.{DONE}",
    ["84:641e"] = "We had plenty of\nrest at lunch, so\fnow we're all\nready to go again!\fWe're going to\ntrain again!{DONE}",
    ["84:647d"] = "What are your\nthoughts on rais-\ving POKéMON?{DONE}",
    ["84:64a8"] = "You've won my\nrespect.{DONE}",
    ["84:64bf"] = "I see you're rais-\ning your POKéMON\vwith care.\fThe bond you build\nwill save you in\vtough situations.{DONE}",
    ["84:6521"] = "What is your\nbattle strategy?\fIt is foolish to\nuse strong moves\vindiscriminately.{DONE}",
    ["84:6574"] = "Fine. I lost.{DONE}",
    ["84:6583"] = "I'm not in favor\nof overly power-\vful moves.\fI want to win, but\nI also don't want\vto harm POKéMON.{DONE}",
    ["84:6631"] = "I'm really, really\ntough!{DONE}",
    ["84:664b"] = "I was tough at the\nBATTLE TOWER…{DONE}",
    ["84:666d"] = "Have you been to\nthe BATTLE TOWER?\fI never, ever lose\nthere, but…{DONE}",
    ["84:66b0"] = "ROUTE 45\nMOUNTAIN RD. AHEAD{DONE}",
    ["84:698b"] = "Look! Check out my\nbag!\fI printed out my\nfavorites from my\fPOKéDEX and stuck\nthem on my bag.{DONE}",
    ["84:69e6"] = "This is MAIL I got\nfrom my daughter.\vIt cheers me up.{DONE}",
    ["84:6a1d"] = "Pay attention,\nplease!\f…Oops, I have to\nquit thinking like\fa teacher all the\ntime.\fYou must be a\nPOKéMON trainer.\fSince you're work-\ning so hard, I\fwant you to have\nthis.{DONE}",
    ["84:6ac5"] = "Let a POKéMON hold\nthat QUICK CLAW.\fSometimes it will\nstrike first\vduring battle.{DONE}",
    ["84:6b15"] = "I'm playing with\nstickers I printed\vfrom my POKéDEX.{DONE}",
    ["84:6b47"] = "I get the other\nguy's POKéDEX\vsticker if I win.{DONE}",
    ["84:6b74"] = "I take walks in\nthe PARK, but I\fnever go into the\ngrass.\fTrainers always\nwant to battle…{DONE}",
    ["84:6bce"] = "PERSIAN: Fufushaa!{DONE}",
    ["84:6be2"] = "I'm printing out\nmy POKéDEX.\fYou can also print\nout stuff like\fMAIL and your PC\nBOXES.{DONE}",
    ["84:6c36"] = "The world of\nPOKéMON is deep.\fThere are still\nlots of things we\vdon't know.\fBut I know more\nthan you do!{DONE}",
    ["84:6c9c"] = "Wha-wha-what?{DONE}",
    ["84:6cab"] = "There is a lot\nto learn.\fFor example…\fThere are 50 kinds\nof TMs.\fTraded POKéMON\nlevel up faster.{DONE}",
    ["84:6d0a"] = "My POKéMON are\nsimply darling.\fLet me tell you\nhow proud my\vdarlings make me.{DONE}",
    ["84:6d56"] = "I can beat you in\npride, but…{DONE}",
    ["84:6d75"] = "I must say, your\nPOKéMON are quite\vcute, too.{DONE}",
    ["84:6da1"] = "We adore our POKé-\nMON, even if they\vdislike us.\fThat's what being\na FAN is about.{DONE}",
    ["84:6df1"] = "M-my POKéMON!{DONE}",
    ["84:6dfd"] = "I lost the battle,\nbut my POKéMON win\fthe prize for\nbeing most lovely.{DONE}",
    ["84:6e42"] = "My friend keeps a\nMARILL!\fI find them very\nendearing.\fOh, I wish for a\nMARILL of my own…{DONE}",
    ["84:6e9c"] = "Hello? Why are you\nstaring at me?\fOh, a battle?{DONE}",
    ["84:6ecd"] = "…Hmmm…{DONE}",
    ["84:6ed5"] = "I thought you were\nstaring at me\vbecause I'm cute!{DONE}",
    ["84:6f08"] = "RELAXATION SQUARE\nNATIONAL PARK{DONE}",
    ["84:6f29"] = "What is this\nnotice?\fPlease battle only\nin the grass.\fNATIONAL PARK\nWARDEN'S OFFICE{DONE}",
    ["84:6f7e"] = "TRAINER TIPS\fPrint out MAIL by\nopening it then\vpressing START.{DONE}",
    ["84:7575"] = "Hey!\nIntruder alert!{DONE}",
    ["84:758b"] = "Dang… I failed…{DONE}",
    ["84:759c"] = "It's my turn!\nThere's no escape!{DONE}",
    ["84:75bc"] = "Surveillance cams\nare in the POKéMON\vstatues.\fWe'll keep appear-\ning until you trip\va secret switch.{DONE}",
    ["84:761e"] = "This was once a\nninja hideout.\fThere are traps to\nconfound intruders\vlike you.{DONE}",
    ["84:766e"] = "I get it…{DONE}",
    ["84:7679"] = "All right. I'll\ndivulge a secret\vabout our hideout.\fThat thing on the\nfloor up ahead is\va warp panel.\fIf you step on it,\nyou'll be warped\fback to the en-\ntrance.{DONE}",
    ["84:771a"] = "Heheh. Feeling\nlucky, punk?{DONE}",
    ["84:7737"] = "Kaboom!{DONE}",
    ["84:7740"] = "I don't even know\nwhere the traps\vare planted.\fYou'll just have\nto collect your\vcourage and walk.{DONE}",
    ["84:77a1"] = "It's a PERSIAN\nstatue…\fIts eyes are oddly\nshiny.{DONE}",
    ["84:77d2"] = "A secret switch!\nBetter press it.{DONE}",
    ["84:77f5"] = "The switch is\nturned off.{DONE}",
    ["84:7a36"] = "BROCK: Wow, it's\nnot often that we\fget a challenger\nfrom JOHTO.\fI'm BROCK, the\nPEWTER GYM LEADER.\fI'm an expert on\nROCK-type POKéMON.\fMy POKéMON are im-\npervious to most\fphysical attacks.\nYou'll have a hard\ftime inflicting\nany damage.\fCome on!{DONE}",
    ["84:7b21"] = "BROCK: Your POKé-\nMON's powerful at-\vtacks overcame my\vrock-hard defense…\fYou're stronger\nthan I expected…\fGo ahead--take\nthis BADGE.{DONE}",
    ["84:7ba3"] = "{PLAYER} received\nBOULDERBADGE.{DONE}",
    ["84:7bbd"] = "BROCK: {PLAYER},\nthanks. I enjoyed\fbattling you, even\nthough I am a bit\vupset.\fThat BOULDERBADGE\nwill make your\fPOKéMON even more\npowerful.{DONE}",
    ["84:7c40"] = "BROCK: The world\nis huge. There are\fstill many strong\ntrainers like you.\fJust wait and see.\nI'm going to be-\vcome a lot strong-\ver too.{DONE}",
    ["84:7cc8"] = "BROCK: Hey there,\n{PLAYER}!\fI heard you are\nnow the KANTO\vCHAMPION.\fThat's incredible!\fYou must be even\nstronger now.\fWant to have a\nrematch with me?{DONE}",
    ["84:7d57"] = "BROCK: Your POKé-\nPOKéMON once again\vovercame my rock-\vhard defense…{DONE}",
    ["84:7d97"] = "The trainers of\nthis GYM use rock-\vtype POKéMON.\fThe ROCK-type has\nhigh DEFENSE.\fBattles could end\nup going a long\ftime. Are you\nready for this?{DONE}",
    ["84:7e26"] = "I have to win\nthese battles…{DONE}",
    ["84:7e44"] = "Hey, you! Trainer\nfrom JOHTO! BROCK\fis tough. He'll\npunish you if you\fdon't take him\nseriously.{DONE}",
    ["84:7ea3"] = "Yo! CHAMP in\nmaking! You're\freally rocking.\nAre you battling\fthe GYM LEADERS of\nKANTO?\fThey're strong and\ndedicated people,\fjust like JOHTO's\nGYM LEADERS.{DONE}",
    ["84:7f3c"] = "Yo! CHAMP in\nmaking! That GYM\fdidn't give you\nmuch trouble.\fThe way you took\ncharge was really\finspiring. I mean\nthat seriously.{DONE}",
    ["85:4168"] = "…Tell me some-\nthing.\fIs it true that\nTEAM ROCKET has\vreturned?\fWhat? You beat\nthem? Hah! Quit\vlying.\fYou're not joking?\nThen let's see how\vgood you are.{DONE}",
    ["85:4201"] = "… Humph! Useless\nPOKéMON!\fListen, you. You\nonly won because\fmy POKéMON were\nweak.{DONE}",
    ["85:424e"] = "I hate the weak.\fPOKéMON, trainers.\nIt doesn't matter\vwho or what.\fI'm going to be\nstrong and wipe\vout the weak.\fThat goes for TEAM\nROCKET too.\fThey act big and\ntough in a group.\fBut get them\nalone, and they're\vweak.\fI hate them all.\fYou stay out of my\nway. A weakling\flike you is only a\ndistraction.{DONE}",
    ["85:4376"] = "…Humph! I knew\nyou were lying.{DONE}",
    ["85:4396"] = "It's unsafe to go\nin there, so I'm\vstanding guard.\fAren't I a good\nSamaritan?{DONE}",
    ["85:43e2"] = "Do you know about\nSLOWPOKETAIL? I\vheard it's tasty!\fAren't you glad I\ntold you that?{DONE}",
    ["85:4436"] = "The SLOWPOKE have\ndisappeared from\vtown…\fI heard their\nTAILS are being\vsold somewhere.{DONE}",
    ["85:448e"] = "The SLOWPOKE have\nreturned.\fKnowing them, they\ncould've just been\fgoofing off some-\nwhere.{DONE}",
    ["85:44e9"] = "Did you come to\nget KURT to make\vsome BALLS?\fA lot of people do\njust that.{DONE}",
    ["85:4535"] = "Cut through AZALEA\nand you'll be in\vILEX FOREST.\fBut these skinny\ntrees make it\fimpossible to get\nthrough.\fThe CHARCOAL MAN's\nPOKéMON can CUT\vdown trees.{DONE}",
    ["85:45cb"] = "SLOWPOKE: …\f…… …… ……{DONE}",
    ["85:45de"] = "…… ……Yawn?{DONE}",
    ["85:45fa"] = "ILEX FOREST is\nrestless!\fWhat is going on?{DONE}",
    ["85:4626"] = "{PLAYER}, here's\nyour GS BALL back!{DONE}",
    ["85:4643"] = "Could you go see\nwhy ILEX FOREST is\vso restless?{DONE}",
    ["85:4675"] = "AZALEA TOWN\nWhere People and\fPOKéMON Live in\nHappy Harmony{DONE}",
    ["85:46ae"] = "KURT'S HOUSE{DONE}",
    ["85:46bc"] = "AZALEA TOWN\nPOKéMON GYM\vLEADER: BUGSY\fThe Walking\nBug POKéMON\vEncyclopedia{DONE}",
    ["85:4702"] = "SLOWPOKE WELL\fAlso known as the\nRAINMAKER WELL.\fLocals believe\nthat a SLOWPOKE's\vyawn summons rain.\fRecords show that\na SLOWPOKE's yawn\fended a drought\n400 years ago.{DONE}",
    ["85:47a8"] = "CHARCOAL KILN{DONE}",
    ["85:47b7"] = "ILEX FOREST\fEnter through the\ngate.{DONE}",
    ["85:4b07"] = "You're a rookie\ntrainer, aren't\vyou? I can tell!\fThat's OK! Every-\none is a rookie\vat some point!\fIf you'd like, I\ncan teach you a\vfew things.{DONE}",
    ["85:4b93"] = "OK, then!\nFollow me!{DONE}",
    ["85:4ba9"] = "This is a POKéMON\nCENTER. They heal\fyour POKéMON in no\ntime at all.\fYou'll be relying\non them a lot, so\fyou better learn\nabout them.{DONE}",
    ["85:4c28"] = "This is a POKéMON\nMART.\fThey sell BALLS\nfor catching wild\fPOKéMON and other\nuseful items.{DONE}",
    ["85:4c7d"] = "ROUTE 30 is out\nthis way.\fTrainers will be\nbattling their\fprized POKéMON\nthere.{DONE}",
    ["85:4ccb"] = "This is the sea,\nas you can see.\fSome POKéMON are\nfound only in\vwater.{DONE}",
    ["85:4d10"] = "Here…\fIt's my house!\nThanks for your\vcompany.\fLet me give you a\nsmall gift.{DONE}",
    ["85:4d5c"] = "{PLAYER}'s POKéGEAR\nnow has a MAP!{DONE}",
    ["85:4d75"] = "POKéGEAR becomes\nmore useful as you\vadd CARDS.\fI wish you luck on\nyour journey!{DONE}",
    ["85:4dc3"] = "Oh… It's something\nI enjoy doing…\fFine. Come see me\nwhenever you like.{DONE}",
    ["85:4e0a"] = "…… …… ……\fYou got a POKéMON\nat the LAB.\fWhat a waste.\nA wimp like you.\f…… …… ……\fDon't you get what\nI'm saying?\fWell, I too, have\na good POKéMON.\fI'll show you\nwhat I mean!{DONE}",
    ["85:4ea7"] = "Humph. Are you\nhappy you won?{DONE}",
    ["85:4ec6"] = "…… …… ……\fMy name's ???.\fI'm going to be\nthe world's great-\vest POKéMON\vtrainer.{DONE}",
    ["85:4f0e"] = "Humph. That was a\nwaste of time.{DONE}",
    ["85:4f30"] = "…… …… ……\fMy name's ???.\fI'm going to be\nthe world's great-\vest POKéMON\vtrainer.{DONE}",
    ["85:4f78"] = "Did you talk to\nthe old man by the\vPOKéMON CENTER?\fHe'll put a MAP of\nJOHTO on your\vPOKéGEAR.{DONE}",
    ["85:4fd0"] = "When you're with\nPOKéMON, going\vanywhere is fun.{DONE}",
    ["85:4ffe"] = "MR.POKéMON's house\nis still farther\vup ahead.{DONE}",
    ["85:5029"] = "I battled the\ntrainers on the\vroad.\fMy POKéMON lost.\nThey're a mess! I\fmust take them to\na POKéMON CENTER.{DONE}",
    ["85:508e"] = "A POKéMON I caught\nhad an item.\fI think it's\nMYSTIC WATER.\fI don't need it,\nso do you want it?{DONE}",
    ["85:50e9"] = "Back to fishing\nfor me, then.{DONE}",
    ["85:5108"] = "CHERRYGROVE CITY\fThe City of Cute,\nFragrant Flowers{DONE}",
    ["85:513d"] = "GUIDE GENT'S HOUSE{DONE}",
    ["85:52bb"] = "SABRINA: I knew\nyou were coming…\fThree years ago I\nhad a vision of\vyour arrival.\fYou're after my\nBADGE.\fI don't enjoy bat-\ntling, but it's my\fduty as a LEADER\nto confer BADGES\fon anyone who has\nproven him- or\vherself worthy.\fSince you wish it,\nI will show you my\vpsychic powers!{DONE}",
    ["85:53d0"] = "SABRINA: Your\npower…\fIt far exceeds\nwhat I foresaw…\fMaybe it isn't\npossible to fully\fpredict what the\nfuture holds…\fOK, you win. You\nearned yourself\vMARSHBADGE.{DONE}",
    ["85:5471"] = "{PLAYER} received\nMARSHBADGE.{DONE}",
    ["85:5489"] = "SABRINA: MARSH-\nBADGE draws out\fyour subliminal\npowers…\fAlthough I failed\nto accurately pre-\vdict your power,\vthis much I know\vto be true.\fYou will become a\ncelebrated and\vbeloved CHAMPION!{DONE}",
    ["85:5548"] = "SABRINA: Your love\nfor your POKéMON\foverwhelmed my\npsychic power…\fThe power of love,\nI think, is also a\fkind of psychic\npower…{DONE}",
    ["85:55c5"] = "SABRINA: Ah, the\nKANTO CHAMPION.\fI sensed your\nreturn.\fYour power has\ngrown immensely.\fEven now, I feel\nyour aura.\fWant to have a\nrematch with me?{DONE}",
    ["85:5659"] = "SABRINA: Your love\nfor your POKéMON\fagain overwhelmed\nmy psychic power…{DONE}",
    ["85:569f"] = "The power of all\nthose you defeated\vcomes to me!{DONE}",
    ["85:56d1"] = "Strong…\nFar too strong…{DONE}",
    ["85:56ea"] = "What is the source\nof your power?{DONE}",
    ["85:570d"] = "Psychic power is\nthe power of your\vsoul.{DONE}",
    ["85:5737"] = "Your soul has more\npower than mine!{DONE}",
    ["85:575c"] = "You made your soul\nstronger, not just\vyour abilities.{DONE}",
    ["85:5793"] = "Fufufufu…\nI see it clearly.\fI can see into\nyour soul!{DONE}",
    ["85:57ca"] = "Though I read you,\nI still lost…{DONE}",
    ["85:57ec"] = "Darn! I forgot\nthat I predicted I\vwould lose to you.{DONE}",
    ["85:5822"] = "The FIGHTING DOJO\nnext door was once\vthis city's GYM.{DONE}",
    ["85:5858"] = "I was no match…{DONE}",
    ["85:5869"] = "KARATE KING, the\nmaster of the\fFIGHTING DOJO, was\njust destroyed by\vSABRINA.{DONE}",
    ["85:58b7"] = "Yo, CHAMP in\nmaking!\fA trainer as\nskilled as you\fdoesn't need to be\ntold how to deal\fwith PSYCHIC-type\nPOKéMON, right?\fI expect great\nthings from you!\fGood luck!{DONE}",
    ["85:5956"] = "That was another\nfantastic battle!{DONE}",
    ["85:5b6d"] = "You crossed the\nsea to get here?\fThat must have\nbeen hard.\fIt would be much\neasier if your\fPOKéMON knew how\nto FLY…{DONE}",
    ["85:5bdf"] = "But you can't use\nFLY without this\vcity's GYM BADGE.\fIf you beat the\nGYM LEADER here,\vcome see me.\fI'll have a nice\ngift for you.{DONE}",
    ["85:5c5f"] = "That's CIANWOOD's\nGYM BADGE!\fThen you should\ntake this HM.{DONE}",
    ["85:5c99"] = "Teach FLY to your\nPOKéMON.\fYou will be able\nto FLY instantly\fto anywhere you \nhave visited.{DONE}",
    ["85:5cf3"] = "My husband lost to\nyou, so he needs\vto train harder.\fThat's good, since\nhe was getting a\vlittle chubby.{DONE}",
    ["85:5d5b"] = "If you use FLY,\nyou can get back\fto OLIVINE in-\nstantly.{DONE}",
    ["85:5d95"] = "Boulders to the\nnorth of town can\vbe crushed.\fThey may be hiding\nsomething.\fYour POKéMON could\nuse ROCK SMASH to\vbreak them.{DONE}",
    ["85:5e10"] = "CHUCK, the GYM\nLEADER, spars with\fhis fighting POKé-\nMON.{DONE}",
    ["85:5eaf"] = "EUSINE: Yo,\n{PLAYER}.\fWasn't that\nSUICUNE just now?\fI only caught a\nquick glimpse, but\fI thought I saw\nSUICUNE running on\vthe waves.\fSUICUNE is beau-\ntiful and grand.\fAnd it races\nthrough towns and\froads at simply\nawesome speeds.\fIt's wonderful…\fI want to see\nSUICUNE up close…\fI've decided.\fI'll battle you as\na trainer to earn\vSUICUNE's respect!\fCome on, {PLAYER}.\nLet's battle now!{DONE}",
    ["85:601d"] = "I hate to admit\nit, but you win.{DONE}",
    ["85:603f"] = "You're amazing,\n{PLAYER}!\fNo wonder POKéMON\ngravitate to you.\fI get it now.\fI'm going to keep\nsearching for\vSUICUNE.\fI'm sure we'll see\neach other again.\fSee you around!{DONE}",
    ["85:60dc"] = "CIANWOOD CITY\fA Port Surrounded\nby Rough Seas{DONE}",
    ["85:610b"] = "CIANWOOD CITY\nPOKéMON GYM\fLEADER: CHUCK\fHis Roaring Fists\nDo the Talking{DONE}",
    ["85:6152"] = "500 Years of\nTradition\fCIANWOOD CITY\nPHARMACY\fWe Await Your\nMedicinal Queries{DONE}",
    ["85:61a1"] = "CIANWOOD CITY\nPHOTO STUDIO\fTake a Snapshot as\na Keepsake!{DONE}",
    ["85:61dc"] = "THE POKé SEER\nAHEAD{DONE}",
    ["85:640e"] = "Hello, hello! You\nmust be {PLAYER}.\fPROF.ELM said that\nyou would visit.{DONE}",
    ["85:6450"] = "This is what I\nwant PROF.ELM to\vexamine.{DONE}",
    ["85:647a"] = "{PLAYER} received\nMYSTERY EGG.{DONE}",
    ["85:6493"] = "I know a couple\nwho run a POKéMON\vDAY-CARE service.\fThey gave me that\nEGG.\fI was intrigued,\nso I sent mail to\vPROF.ELM.\fFor POKéMON evolu-\ntion, PROF.ELM is\vthe authority.{DONE}",
    ["85:653a"] = "I also have a\nspecial item for\vyou.{DONE}",
    ["85:655f"] = "Even PROF.OAK here\nrecognizes that.{DONE}",
    ["85:6584"] = "If my assumption\nis correct, PROF.\vELM will know it.{DONE}",
    ["85:65ba"] = "You are returning\nto PROF.ELM?\fHere. Your POKéMON\nshould have some\vrest.{DONE}",
    ["85:6601"] = "I'm depending on\nyou!{DONE}",
    ["85:6617"] = "Life is delight-\nful! Always, new\fdiscoveries to be\nmade!{DONE}",
    ["85:6652"] = "OAK: Aha! So\nyou're {PLAYER}!\fI'm OAK! A POKéMON\nresearcher.\fI was just visit-\ning my old friend\vMR.POKéMON.\fI heard you were\nrunning an errand\ffor PROF.ELM, so I\nwaited here.\fOh! What's this?\nA rare POKéMON!\fLet's see…\fHm, I see!\fI understand why\nPROF.ELM gave you\fa POKéMON for this\nerrand.\fTo researchers\nlike PROF.ELM and\fI, POKéMON are our\nfriends.\fHe saw that you\nwould treat your\fPOKéMON with love\nand care.\f…Ah!\fYou seem to be\ndependable.\fHow would you like\nto help me out?\fSee? This is the\nlatest version of\vthe POKéDEX.\fIt automatically\nrecords data on\fPOKéMON you've\nseen or caught.\fIt's a hi-tech\nencyclopedia!\fIt shows their\nhabitats, how they\vevolve, and their\vmoves.{DONE}",
    ["85:68d8"] = "{PLAYER} received\nPOKéDEX!{DONE}",
    ["85:68ea"] = "Go meet many kinds\nof POKéMON and\fcomplete that\nPOKéDEX!\fBut I've stayed\ntoo long.\fI have to get to\nGOLDENROD for my\vusual radio show.\f{PLAYER}, I'm\ncounting on you!{DONE}",
    ["85:6982"] = "Hm? That SCALE!\nWhat's that?\vA red GYARADOS?\fThat's rare! \nI, I want it…\f{PLAYER}, would you\ncare to trade it?\fI can offer this\nEXP.SHARE I got\vfrom PROF.OAK.{DONE}",
    ["85:6a19"] = "That's disappoint-\ning. That happens\vto be very rare.{DONE}",
    ["85:6a4f"] = "It's packed with\nforeign magazines.\fCan't even read\ntheir titles…{DONE}",
    ["85:6a90"] = "It's a big com-\nputer. Hmm. It's\vbroken.{DONE}",
    ["85:6ab8"] = "A whole pile of\nstrange coins!\fMaybe they're from\nanother country…{DONE}",
    ["85:6bad"] = "OAK: Ah, {PLAYER}!\nIt's good of you\fto come all this\nway to KANTO.\fWhat do you think\nof the trainers\fout here?\nPretty tough, huh?{DONE}",
    ["85:6c28"] = "How is your POKé-\nDEX coming?\fLet's see…{DONE}",
    ["85:6c4e"] = "If you're in the\narea, I hope you\vcome visit again.{DONE}",
    ["85:6c82"] = "OAK: Wow! That's\nexcellent!\fYou collected the\nBADGES of GYMS in\vKANTO,\fand become\nCHAMPION of both\vthe KANTO and\vJOHTO LEAGUES.\fWell done!\fI was right in my\nassessment of you.\fTell you what,\n{PLAYER}. I'll make\farrangements so\nthat you can go to\vMT.SILVER.\fMT.SILVER is a big\nmountain that is\fhome to many wild\nPOKéMON.\fIt's too dangerous\nfor your average\ftrainer, so it's\noff limits. But\fwe can make an\nexception in your\vcase, {PLAYER}.\fGo up to INDIGO\nPLATEAU. You can\freach MT.SILVER\nfrom there.{DONE}",
    ["85:6e61"] = "OAK: Wow! That's\nexcellent!\fYou collected the\nBADGES of GYMS in\vKANTO,\fbut I still don't\nthink you are\vready.\fYou must return\nto the ELITE\vFOUR...\fand battle in\nthe KANTO LEAGUE!\fOnly then will\nyou truly have\vwhat it takes.{DONE}",
    ["85:6f40"] = "OAK: Hmm? You're\nnot collecting\vKANTO GYM BADGES?\fThe GYM LEADERS in\nKANTO are as tough\fas any you battled\nin JOHTO.\fI recommend that\nyou challenge\vthem.{DONE}",
    ["85:6fda"] = "OAK: Ah, you're\ncollecting KANTO\vGYM BADGES.\fI imagine that\nit's hard, but the\fexperience is sure\nto help you.\fCome see me when\nyou get them all.\fI'll have a gift\nfor you.\fKeep trying hard,\n{PLAYER}!{DONE}",
    ["85:7099"] = "The PROF's POKéMON\nTALK radio program\fisn't aired here\nin KANTO.\fIt's a shame--I'd\nlike to hear it.{DONE}",
    ["85:70f7"] = "Thanks to your\nwork on the POKé-\vDEX, the PROF's\fresearch is coming\nalong great.{DONE}",
    ["85:7145"] = "Don't tell anyone,\nbut PROF.OAK'S\fPOKéMON TALK isn't\na live broadcast.{DONE}",
    ["85:7188"] = "Press START to\nopen the MENU.{DONE}",
    ["85:71a7"] = "The SAVE option is\non the MENU.\fUse it in a timely\nmanner.{DONE}",
    ["85:71e3"] = "There's nothing in\nhere…{DONE}",
    ["85:71fc"] = "There's an e-mail\nmessage on the PC.\f…\fPROF.OAK, how is\nyour research\vcoming along?\fI'm still plugging\naway.\fI heard rumors\nthat {PLAYER} is\fgetting quite a\nreputation.\fI'm delighted to\nhear that.\fELM in NEW BARK\nTOWN 8-){DONE}",
    ["85:75cb"] = "I love POKéMON!\fThat's why I\nstarted--and why\fI'll keep on col-\nlecting POKéMON!{DONE}",
    ["85:7615"] = "How could you do\nthis to me?{DONE}",
    ["85:7633"] = "What else do I\nlike besides\vPOKéMON?\fMARY on the radio.\nI bet she's cute!{DONE}",
    ["85:767a"] = "Hey! Do you have\nany rare POKéMON?{DONE}",
    ["85:769b"] = "Oh, my poor POKé-\nMON! Darlings!{DONE}",
    ["85:76ba"] = "I'd be happy just\nto own a single\vrare POKéMON.{DONE}",
    ["85:76e7"] = "Would you get\nthis?\fSome {RIVAL} guy\nmade fun of my\vPOKéMON!\fDarn it! My POKé-\nMON's great!{DONE}",
    ["85:7737"] = "My NIDOKING did\npretty right on!{DONE}",
    ["85:7759"] = "It's okay for\npeople to like\fdifferent types\nof POKéMON.\fPOKéMON isn't just\nabout having the\vmost powerful one.{DONE}",
    ["85:77c2"] = "I'm in a slump.\fMaybe it's the\ngear I'm using.\fLet's battle for a\nchange of pace!{DONE}",
    ["85:7811"] = "I lost, but I feel\nbetter anyway.{DONE}",
    ["85:7834"] = "KURT's LURE BALL\nis the best for\fcatching hooked\nPOKéMON.\fIt's much more\neffective than a\vULTRA BALL.{DONE}",
    ["85:7896"] = "I can do so much\nwith my POKéMON--\vit's super-fun!{DONE}",
    ["85:78c6"] = "Losing isn't fun\nat all…{DONE}",
    ["85:78df"] = "What is going on\nat LAKE OF RAGE?\fWe were planning\nto camp there.{DONE}",
    ["85:7922"] = "Are you going to\nLAKE OF RAGE too?\fLet's play for a \nlittle while!{DONE}",
    ["85:7965"] = "I played too much!{DONE}",
    ["85:7979"] = "I'm having a pic-\nnic with POKéMON.\fWon't you join us?{DONE}",
    ["85:79ac"] = "Isn't my CLEFABLE\njust the most\vadorable thing?{DONE}",
    ["85:79dc"] = "ROUTE 43\fLAKE OF RAGE -\nMAHOGANY TOWN{DONE}",
    ["85:7a03"] = "ROUTE 43\fLAKE OF RAGE -\nMAHOGANY TOWN{DONE}",
    ["85:7a2a"] = "TRAINER TIPS\fAll POKéMON have\npros and cons\fdepending on their\ntypes.\fIf their types\ndiffer, a higher-\flevel POKéMON may\nlose in battle.\fLearn which types\nare strong and\fweak against your\nPOKéMON's type.{DONE}",
    ["85:7c2b"] = "Excuse me, kid!\nCan you do a guy\va favor?\fCan you take this\nPOKéMON with MAIL\vto my friend?\fHe's on ROUTE 31.{DONE}",
    ["85:7c96"] = "You will? Perfect!\nThanks, kid!\fMy pal's a chubby\nguy who snoozes\vall the time.\fYou'll recognize\nhim right away!{DONE}",
    ["85:7d06"] = "{PLAYER} received a\nPOKéMON with MAIL.{DONE}",
    ["85:7d24"] = "You can read it,\nbut don't lose it!\vROUTE 31!\fOh, yeah. There\nwas a weird tree\vblocking the road.\fI wonder if it's\nbeen cleared?{DONE}",
    ["85:7da4"] = "You can't carry\nanother POKéMON…{DONE}",
    ["85:7dc2"] = "Oh… Never mind,\nthen…{DONE}",
    ["85:7dd9"] = "Thanks, kid! You\nmade the delivery\vfor me!\fHere's something\nfor your trouble!{DONE}",
    ["85:7e27"] = "My pal was snooz-\ning, right? Heh,\vwhat'd I say?{DONE}",
    ["85:7e58"] = "A strange tree is\nblocking the road.\fIt wriggles around\nif you talk to it.\fI heard it became\nwild when someone\fwatered it with a\nSQUIRTBOTTLE.{DONE}",
    ["85:7ee8"] = "I like the POKéMON\nLullaby they play\von the radio.{DONE}",
    ["85:7f19"] = "I wonder how many\nkinds of POKéMON\fthere are in the\nworld.\fThree years ago,\nPROF.OAK said that\fthere were 150\ndifferent kinds.{DONE}",
    ["86:4166"] = "POKéMON hide in\nthe grass. Who\fknows when they'll\npop out…{DONE}",
    ["86:419e"] = "I've seen you a\ncouple times. How\fmany POKéMON have\nyou caught?\fWould you like me\nto show you how to\vcatch POKéMON?{DONE}",
    ["86:420c"] = "If you weaken them\nfirst, POKéMON are\veasier to catch.\fIf you want to\nlearn more, go\vto the ACADEMY\vin VIOLET CITY!\fThe students there\nknow a lot about\vPOKéMON.{DONE}",
    ["86:42a8"] = "Oh. Fine, then.\fCheck every route\nto find different\vtypes of POKéMON.\fYour POKéDEX shows\nwhere you can find\vthem too!\fIf you want to\nlearn more, go\fto the ACADEMY\nin VIOLET CITY!\fThe students\nknow a lot about\vPOKéMON.{DONE}",
    ["86:437a"] = "Huh? You want me\nto show you how to\vcatch POKéMON?{DONE}",
    ["86:43ab"] = "Yo. How are your\nPOKéMON?\fIf they're weak\nand not ready for\fbattle, keep out\nof the grass.{DONE}",
    ["86:4403"] = "See those ledges?\nIt's scary to jump\voff them.\fBut you can go to\nNEW BARK without\fwalking through\nthe grass.{DONE}",
    ["86:4470"] = "I wanted to take a\nbreak, so I saved\fto record my\nprogress.{DONE}",
    ["86:44ad"] = "I'm waiting for\nPOKéMON that\fappear only later\nin the day.{DONE}",
    ["86:44e5"] = "I'm waiting for\nPOKéMON that\fappear only at\nnight.{DONE}",
    ["86:4515"] = "I'm waiting for\nPOKéMON that\fappear only in the\nmorning.{DONE}",
    ["86:454b"] = "TUSCANY: I do be-\nlieve that this is\fthe first time\nwe've met?\fPlease allow me to\nintroduce myself.\fI am TUSCANY of\nTuesday.{DONE}",
    ["86:45c8"] = "By way of intro-\nduction, please\faccept this gift,\na PINK BOW.{DONE}",
    ["86:4608"] = "TUSCANY: Wouldn't\nyou agree that it\vis most adorable?\fIt strengthens\nNORMAL-type moves.\fI am certain it\nwill be of use.{DONE}",
    ["86:4680"] = "TUSCANY: Have you\nmet MONICA, my\volder sister?\fOr my younger\nbrother, WESLEY?\fI am the second of\nseven children.{DONE}",
    ["86:46f2"] = "TUSCANY: Today is\nnot Tuesday. That\vis unfortunate…{DONE}",
    ["86:4727"] = "ROUTE 29\fCHERRYGROVE CITY -\nNEW BARK TOWN{DONE}",
    ["86:4752"] = "ROUTE 29\fCHERRYGROVE CITY -\nNEW BARK TOWN{DONE}",
    ["86:4932"] = "Wait!{DONE}",
    ["86:4939"] = "CLAIR: I'm sorry\nabout this.\fHere, take this as\nmy apology.{DONE}",
    ["86:4975"] = "{PLAYER} received\nTM24 DRAGONBREATH.{DONE}",
    ["86:4994"] = "That contains\nDRAGONBREATH.\fNo, it doesn't\nhave anything to\vdo with my breath.\fIf you don't want\nit, you don't have\vto take it.{DONE}",
    ["86:4a12"] = "Oh? You don't have\nany room for this.\fI'm going back to\nthe GYM, so make\froom, then come\nsee me there.{DONE}",
    ["86:4a78"] = "CLAIR: What's the\nmatter? Aren't you\fgoing on to the\nPOKéMON LEAGUE?\fAfter you become\nCHAMPION, you can\frematch any GYM\nLEADER you want.\fGo to the\nPOKéMON LEAGUE.\fDo you know how to\nget there?\fFrom here, go to\nNEW BARK TOWN.\fThen SURF east to\nPOKéMON LEAGUE.\fThe route there is\nvery tough.\fDon't you dare\nlose at the POKé-\vMON LEAGUE!\fIf you do, I'll\nfeel even worse\fabout having lost\nto you!\fGive it everything\nyou've got.{DONE}",
    ["86:4c10"] = "DRAGON SHRINE\fA shrine honoring\nthe dragon POKéMON\fsaid to have lived\nin DRAGON'S DEN.{DONE}",
    ["86:4c65"] = "…\nWhat? {PLAYER}?\f…No, I won't\nbattle you now…\fMy POKéMON aren't\nready to beat you.\fI can't push them\ntoo hard now.\fI have to be dis-\nciplined to become\fthe greatest POKé-\nMON trainer…{DONE}",
    ["86:4d0f"] = "…\fWhew…\fLearn to stay out\nof my way…{DONE}",
    ["86:4d35"] = "You! How dare you\nenter uninvited!{DONE}",
    ["86:4d59"] = "S-strong!{DONE}",
    ["86:4d64"] = "The SHRINE ahead\nis home to the\fMASTER of our\ndragon-user clan.\fYou're not allowed\nto just go in!{DONE}",
    ["86:4dc6"] = "You shouldn't be\nin here!{DONE}",
    ["86:4de0"] = "Oh yikes, I lost!{DONE}",
    ["86:4df3"] = "Soon I'm going to\nget permission\ffrom our MASTER to\nuse dragons.\fWhen I do, I'm\ngoing to become an\fadmirable dragon\ntrainer and gain\four MASTER's\napproval.{DONE}",
    ["86:4e8d"] = "It's a stranger we\ndon't know.{DONE}",
    ["86:4eab"] = "Ouchies.{DONE}",
    ["86:4eb5"] = "It was like having\nto battle LANCE.{DONE}",
    ["86:4eda"] = "Who are you?{DONE}",
    ["86:4ee8"] = "Meanie.{DONE}",
    ["86:4ef1"] = "We'll tell on you.\fMASTER will be\nangry with you.{DONE}",
    ["86:4f23"] = "{PLAYER} found\n{STRBUF}!{DONE}",
    ["86:4f33"] = "But {PLAYER} can't\ncarry any more\vitems.{DONE}",
    ["86:50c4"] = "You have lovely\nPOKéMON. May I see\vthem in battle?{DONE}",
    ["86:50f5"] = "Oh, you are very\nstrong.{DONE}",
    ["86:510f"] = "I enjoyed that\nbout. I would like\vto see you again.{DONE}",
    ["86:5144"] = "I always dance\nwith my POKéMON.\fOf course, I also\ntrain them.{DONE}",
    ["86:5180"] = "Oh, so close!\nI almost had you.{DONE}",
    ["86:51a1"] = "Rhythm is impor-\ntant for both\fdancing and POKé-\nMON.{DONE}",
    ["86:51d5"] = "Isn't my barrette\npretty?\fOh. A POKéMON\nbattle?{DONE}",
    ["86:5202"] = "I don't have any\nPOKéMON left…{DONE}",
    ["86:521e"] = "I put a different\nflower in my bar-\vrette every month.{DONE}",
    ["86:5256"] = "Oh, you're a cute\ntrainer. Would you\vlike to battle?{DONE}",
    ["86:528b"] = "You're stronger\nthan you look.{DONE}",
    ["86:52aa"] = "I trained a lot,\nso I thought I was\fa capable trainer.\nI guess I'm not.{DONE}",
    ["86:52f2"] = "Do you like my\ndancing? I'm good\vat POKéMON too.{DONE}",
    ["86:5320"] = "Ooh, you're good\nat POKéMON too.{DONE}",
    ["86:533e"] = "I can keep dancing\nbecause there are\fpeople who enjoy\nwhat I do.\fMy POKéMON keep my\nspirits up too.{DONE}",
    ["86:53a0"] = "Not only are the\nKIMONO GIRLS great\fdancers, they're\nalso skilled at\vPOKéMON.\fI always challenge\nthem, but I've\fnever even left a\nscratch…{DONE}",
    ["86:5427"] = "Lad! If you can\ndefeat all the\fKIMONO GIRLS, I'll\ngive you a gift.{DONE}",
    ["86:546a"] = "Lassie, if you can\ndefeat all the\fKIMONO GIRLS, I'll\ngive you a gift.{DONE}",
    ["86:54b0"] = "The way you bat-\ntled, it was like\vwatching a dance.\fIt was a rare\ntreat to see!\fI want you to have\nthis. Don't worry\v--take it!{DONE}",
    ["86:5531"] = "That's SURF.\fIt's a move that\nlets POKéMON swim\vacross water.{DONE}",
    ["86:556b"] = "I wish my POKéMON\nwere as elegant as\vthe KIMONO GIRLS…{DONE}",
    ["86:55a0"] = "RHYDON: Gugooh\ngugogooh!{DONE}",
    ["86:55ba"] = "That man's always\nwith his RHYDON.\fSays he wants a\nPOKéMON that can\vSURF and dance.\fIs he trying to\nmake a synchro-\vnized swimming\vPOKéMON?{DONE}",
    ["86:5640"] = "The KIMONO GIRLS\nare so beautiful…\fBut they have to\ngo through rigor-\vous training.\fAnd they have to\nlearn to follow\fcustoms before ap-\npearing in public.\fBut if you love\nsomething, any-\vthing is possible.{DONE}",
    ["86:570f"] = "It's a fancy panel\nthat's decorated\vwith flowers.{DONE}",
    ["86:59d8"] = "I've been getting\nPOKéMON data off\fmy radio. I think\nI'm good.{DONE}",
    ["86:5a13"] = "I give!{DONE}",
    ["86:5a1c"] = "Music on the radio\nchanges the moods\vof wild POKéMON.{DONE}",
    ["86:5a50"] = "I'm gonna show my\ngirlfriend I'm hot\vstuff!{DONE}",
    ["86:5a7b"] = "I wish you would\nhave lost for me…{DONE}",
    ["86:5a9f"] = "I was humiliated\nin front of my\vgirlfriend…{DONE}",
    ["86:5acc"] = "My boyfriend's\nweak, so I can't\vrely on him.{DONE}",
    ["86:5af8"] = "Oh, my! You're so\nstrong!{DONE}",
    ["86:5b12"] = "I can count on my\nPOKéMON more than\vmy boyfriend.{DONE}",
    ["86:5b42"] = "Are you going to\nthe GYM? Me too!{DONE}",
    ["86:5b65"] = "Oh. I couldn't\nwin…{DONE}",
    ["86:5b79"] = "The GYM BADGES are\npretty. I collect\vthem.{DONE}",
    ["86:5ba5"] = "What kinds of\nBALLS do you use?{DONE}",
    ["86:5bc6"] = "Yikes! Not fast\nenough!{DONE}",
    ["86:5bdf"] = "Some POKéMON flee\nright away.\fTry catching them\nwith KURT's FAST\vBALL.\fWhenever I find a\nWHT APRICORN, I\vtake it to KURT.\fHe turns it into a\ncustom BALL.{DONE}",
    ["86:5c76"] = "Behold my graceful\nBALL dexterity!{DONE}",
    ["86:5c9a"] = "Whew! That was a\njolt!{DONE}",
    ["86:5cb2"] = "I was going to\ndazzle you with my\vprize POKéMON.\fBut your prowess\nelectrified me!{DONE}",
    ["86:5d02"] = "I'll go anywhere\nif bug POKéMON\vappear there.{DONE}",
    ["86:5d2d"] = "Huh? I shouldn't\nhave lost that…{DONE}",
    ["86:5d4e"] = "My VENONAT won me\nthe Bug-Catching\fContest at the\nNATIONAL PARK.{DONE}",
    ["86:5d90"] = "Wow… Look at all\nthose YANMA!\fI'm so blown away,\nI can't move.{DONE}",
    ["86:5dce"] = "I'm practicing my\nfire breathing.{DONE}",
    ["86:5df0"] = "Ow! I scorched the\ntip of my nose!{DONE}",
    ["86:5e14"] = "The POKéMON March\non the radio lures\vwild POKéMON.{DONE}",
    ["86:5e42"] = "Danger lurks in\nthe night!{DONE}",
    ["86:5e5e"] = "Whoops!{DONE}",
    ["86:5e67"] = "You know, night-\ntime is fun in its\vown ways.\fBut don't overdo\nit, OK?{DONE}",
    ["86:5eae"] = "Your POKéMON look\npretty tough.\fYou could go any-\nwhere safely.{DONE}",
    ["86:5eec"] = "ROUTE 35{DONE}",
    ["86:6105"] = "Oops! I so sorry!\nYou not hurt,\vokay?\fI very busy.\nNo time for talk-\ving with you. Not\vgood for me if\vseen by somebody.{DONE}",
    ["86:617e"] = "Oh no! You seen\nme already! I make\vbig mistake!{DONE}",
    ["86:61af"] = "Hey, you! Forget\nyou see me, okay?\fYou see, hear,\nknow nothing,\fokay?\nBye, kid! Nothing!\fBye-bye a go-go!{DONE}",
    ["86:621a"] = "Sorry, I'll be out\nfor a while.\vMISTY, GYM LEADER{DONE}",
    ["86:624c"] = "Since MISTY's out,\nwe'll be away too.\vGYM TRAINERS{DONE}",
    ["86:627e"] = "MISTY: I was ex-\npecting you, you\vpest!\fYou may have a\nlot of JOHTO GYM\fBADGES, but you'd\nbetter not take me\vtoo lightly.\fMy WATER-type\nPOKéMON are tough!{DONE}",
    ["86:6316"] = "MISTY: You really\nare good…\fI'll admit that\nyou are skilled…\fHere you go. It's\nCASCADEBADGE.{DONE}",
    ["86:6372"] = "{PLAYER} received\nCASCADEBADGE.{DONE}",
    ["86:638c"] = "MISTY: Are there\nmany strong train-\vers in JOHTO? Like\vyou, I mean.\fI'm going to\ntravel one day, so\fI can battle some\nskilled trainers.{DONE}",
    ["86:6414"] = "MISTY: Wow, you're\nthe KANTO CHAMPION\vnow!\fThat's amazing!\nYou've come a long\vway, {PLAYER}.\fBut I'm not\nbacking down.\fWant to have a\nrematch with me?{DONE}",
    ["86:64a1"] = "MISTY: You really\nare good…{DONE}",
    ["86:64be"] = "Sorry about being\naway. Let's get on\vwith it!{DONE}",
    ["86:64ec"] = "I give up! You're\nthe winner!{DONE}",
    ["86:650a"] = "I'll be swimming\nquietly.{DONE}",
    ["86:6524"] = "Don't let my ele-\ngant swimming un-\vnerve you.{DONE}",
    ["86:6553"] = "Ooh, you calmly\ndisposed of me…{DONE}",
    ["86:6574"] = "Don't be too smug\nabout beating me.\fMISTY will destroy\nyou if you get\vcomplacent.{DONE}",
    ["86:65c6"] = "Glub…\fI'm first! Come\nand get me!{DONE}",
    ["86:65e8"] = "This can't be…{DONE}",
    ["86:65f7"] = "MISTY has gotten\nmuch better in the\vpast few years.\fDon't let your\nguard down, or\vyou'll be crushed!{DONE}",
    ["86:665b"] = "Yo! CHAMP in\nmaking!\fSince MISTY was\naway, I went out\ffor some fun too.\nHe-he-he.{DONE}",
    ["86:66ae"] = "Hoo, you showed me\nhow tough you are.\fAs always, that\nwas one heck of a\vgreat battle!{DONE}",
    ["86:68ed"] = "MISTY: Aww! Why\ndid you have to\fshow up and bug us\nnow?\fDo you know what\nthey call people\vlike you?\fPests! You heard\nme right, pest!\f…\f…Oh? Those BADGES\nyou have… Are they\vJOHTO GYM BADGES?\fIf you have eight,\nyou must be good.\fOK, then. Come to\nCERULEAN GYM.\fI'll be happy to\ntake you on.\fI'm MISTY, the\nGYM LEADER in\vCERULEAN.{DONE}",
    ["86:6a34"] = "Beat the six of us\ntrainers to win a\vfabulous prize!\fThink you've got\nwhat it takes?{DONE}",
    ["86:6a89"] = "Whoo! Good stuff.{DONE}",
    ["86:6a9c"] = "I did my best.\nI have no regrets.{DONE}",
    ["86:6abf"] = "I'm second.\nNow it's serious!{DONE}",
    ["86:6adc"] = "How could I lose?{DONE}",
    ["86:6aef"] = "I did my best.\nI have no regrets.{DONE}",
    ["86:6b12"] = "Here's No. 3!\nI won't be easy.{DONE}",
    ["86:6b30"] = "Ow! Stomped flat!{DONE}",
    ["86:6b43"] = "I did my best.\nI have no regrets.{DONE}",
    ["86:6b66"] = "I'm No. 4!\nGetting tired?{DONE}",
    ["86:6b80"] = "I lost too…{DONE}",
    ["86:6b8d"] = "I did my best.\nI have no regrets.{DONE}",
    ["86:6bb0"] = "OK! I'm No. 5.\nI'll stomp you!{DONE}",
    ["86:6bce"] = "Whoa! Too much.{DONE}",
    ["86:6bdf"] = "I did my best.\nI have no regrets.{DONE}",
    ["86:6c02"] = "I'm the last in\nline, but I tell\vyou, I'm tough!{DONE}",
    ["86:6c32"] = "You're kidding.{DONE}",
    ["86:6c42"] = "I did my best.\nI have no regrets.{DONE}",
    ["86:6c65"] = "Mufufufu…\fI have nothing to\ndo with the six-\vpack trainers.\fI waited here to\nbeat you when you\fwere tired out by\nall the battles.{DONE}",
    ["86:6ce8"] = "Aren't you tired\nat all?{DONE}",
    ["86:6d01"] = "I'm sorry… I won't\ncheat anymore…{DONE}",
    ["86:6d22"] = "You took on one\nmore battle than\fyou expected, but\nyou won anyway.\fAs promised, you\nwin a prize.{DONE}",
    ["86:6d84"] = "But after seeing\nhow you battle, I\fwant to see how\nI'll fare.\fHow about it? Let\nme take you on.{DONE}",
    ["86:6de4"] = "I've never had a\nbattle this good!{DONE}",
    ["86:6e07"] = "That was a great\nbattle!\fYou and your POKé-\nMON are truly out-\vstanding!{DONE}",
    ["86:6e4e"] = "SEA COTTAGE\nBILL'S HOUSE{DONE}",
    ["86:7054"] = "A thief broke into\nthe POWER PLANT…\fWhat is the world\ncoming to?{DONE}",
    ["86:7096"] = "I just got word\nfrom CERULEAN.\fIt appears that a\nshady character\fhas been loitering\naround.{DONE}",
    ["86:70f3"] = "Could I ask for\nyour cooperation?{DONE}",
    ["86:7116"] = "We'll have to beef\nup our security\vpresence.{DONE}",
    ["86:7143"] = "Someone made off\nwith a part that's\fessential for the\ngenerator.\fWithout it, the\nnew generator's\vuseless!{DONE}",
    ["86:71ac"] = "The generator's up\nand running. It's\fmaking electricity\nto spare.{DONE}",
    ["86:71ed"] = "This POWER PLANT\nhad been abandoned\vin the past.\fWe got it back up\nand running to\fprovide power to\nthe MAGNET TRAIN.{DONE}",
    ["86:7263"] = "The generator's\nrunning again!{DONE}",
    ["86:7282"] = "The POWER PLANT's\nMANAGER is up\vahead.\fBut since someone\nwrecked the gener-\vator, he's been\vboth sad and\vfurious…{DONE}",
    ["86:72f3"] = "Since the gener-\nator's been fixed,\fthe MANAGER has\nbeen cheerful.{DONE}",
    ["86:7336"] = "The MAGNET TRAIN\nconsumes a lot of\velectricity.\fIt can't move if\nthe new generator\visn't operating.{DONE}",
    ["86:7399"] = "All right! We can\nfinally get the\fMAGNET TRAIN\nrunning again.{DONE}",
    ["86:73d8"] = "MANAGER: I, I, I'm\nready to blast\vsomeone!\fWho would dare\nruin my generator?\fI spent so much\ntime on it!\fIf I catch him,\nhe's going to get\fa taste of my ZAP\nCANNON!{DONE}",
    ["86:747c"] = "MANAGER: I won't\nforgive him!\fThe culprit can\ncry and apologize,\fbut I'll still\nhammer him!\fGahahahah!{DONE}",
    ["86:74e2"] = "MANAGER: Ah! Yeah!\fThat's the missing\nPART from my be-\vloved generator!\vYou found it?{DONE}",
    ["86:7538"] = "Wahah! Thanks!\fHere! Take this TM\nas a reward!{DONE}",
    ["86:7568"] = "MANAGER: TM07 is\nmy ZAP CANNON.\fIt's a powerful\ntechnique!\fIt's not what any-\none would consider\faccurate, but it\npacks a wallop!{DONE}",
    ["86:75e9"] = "MANAGER: My be-\nloved generator!\fKeep pumping the\nelectricity out!{DONE}",
    ["86:792d"] = "Fly high into the\nsky, my beloved\vbird POKéMON!{DONE}",
    ["86:795b"] = "I feel like just\nflying away now.{DONE}",
    ["86:797e"] = "I plan to train in\nCIANWOOD CITY to\fteach my POKéMON\nhow to FLY.{DONE}",
    ["86:79bd"] = "Let me try some-\nthing I learned\vtoday.{DONE}",
    ["86:79e6"] = "I didn't study\nenough, I guess.{DONE}",
    ["86:7a06"] = "I have to take so\nmany tests, I\fdon't have much\ntime for POKéMON.\fSo when I do get\nto play, I really\vconcentrate.{DONE}",
    ["86:7a75"] = "You seem to be\ngood at POKéMON.\fIf you are, how\nabout giving me\vsome advice?{DONE}",
    ["86:7ac0"] = "I see. So you can\nbattle that way.{DONE}",
    ["86:7ae4"] = "I know something\ngood!\fMOOMOO FARM's milk\nis famous for its\vflavor.{DONE}",
    ["86:7b28"] = "Hi! Aren't you a\ncute trainer!\fMay I see your\nPOKéMON?{DONE}",
    ["86:7b5c"] = "I'm glad I got to\nsee your POKéMON!{DONE}",
    ["86:7b7d"] = "When I see POKé-\nMON, it seems to\vsoothe my nerves.{DONE}",
    ["86:7baf"] = "I've been over-\nseas, so I know\fabout all sorts of\nPOKéMON!{DONE}",
    ["86:7be8"] = "Your skill is\nworld class!{DONE}",
    ["86:7c04"] = "All kinds of peo-\nple around the\fworld live happily\nwith POKéMON.{DONE}",
    ["86:7c44"] = "Don't you think my\nPOKéMON and I are\vbeautiful?{DONE}",
    ["86:7c71"] = "We drink MOOMOO\nMILK every day.{DONE}",
    ["86:7c92"] = "MOOMOO MILK is\ngood for beauty\fand health, but\ninconveniently,\fthey only sell a\nbottle at a time.{DONE}",
    ["86:7cf5"] = "ROUTE 38\fOLIVINE CITY -\nECRUTEAK CITY{DONE}",
    ["86:7d1c"] = "TRAINER TIPS\fIf a POKéMON is\ntrying to evolve,\vyou can stop it.\fPress the B But-\nton during evolu-\vtion.\fThat startles the\nPOKéMON and stops\vits evolution.{DONE}",
    ["86:7e7a"] = "Hey, kid! You're\nholding us up!\fOur policy is to\nwork behind the\fscenes where no\none can see us!{DONE}",
    ["86:7edb"] = "I lose my passion\nfor work if some-\vone's watching.\fCome on, kid,\nscoot!{DONE}",
    ["86:7f24"] = "Oohah! Oohah!\fThe stuff on the\nground's junk.\fTake it if you\nwant it!{DONE}",
    ["86:7f6a"] = "MACHOKE: Maaacho!{DONE}",
    ["87:40d0"] = "The water's warm\nhere. I'm loose\vand limber.\fSure, I'll take\nyou on!{DONE}",
    ["87:4113"] = "Yikes! I've got\nprune skin!{DONE}",
    ["87:412f"] = "Isn't it relaxing\njust floating like\vthis?{DONE}",
    ["87:415a"] = "I'm a bit tired.\nIf I win, lend me\vyour POKéMON.{DONE}",
    ["87:4188"] = "Pant, pant…{DONE}",
    ["87:4195"] = "It's so far to\nCIANWOOD.\fBut it's no easy\nreturn trip to\vOLIVINE either.\fWhat should I do?{DONE}",
    ["87:41ef"] = "See those islands\nthat are blocked\vby whirlpools?\fThere just has to\nbe a secret!{DONE}",
    ["87:4241"] = "What's the secret\nto your strength?{DONE}",
    ["87:4265"] = "It was a dark and\nstormy night…\fI saw this giant\nPOKéMON flying\vfrom the islands.\fIt was scattering\nfeathers from its\vsilver wings.{DONE}",
    ["87:42e7"] = "The waves are wild\nhere.\fThey tire you out\nwhile you swim.{DONE}",
    ["87:4323"] = "I'm beat!{DONE}",
    ["87:432d"] = "The currents keep\nme from reaching\vthat island.{DONE}",
    ["87:435e"] = "Are you seeking\nthe secrets of\vWHIRL ISLANDS?{DONE}",
    ["87:438d"] = "Ooh, you've got\ngreat endurance!{DONE}",
    ["87:43ae"] = "A secret about\nWHIRL ISLANDS…\fIt's pitch-black\ninside!{DONE}",
    ["87:43e5"] = "I'm on my way to\nWHIRL ISLANDS.\fI'm going explor-\ning with friends.{DONE}",
    ["87:4428"] = "Is that how you do\nit?{DONE}",
    ["87:4440"] = "There's supposed\nto be a big POKé-\vMON deep beneath\vWHIRL ISLANDS.\fI wonder what it\ncould be?{DONE}",
    ["87:449b"] = "You look so ele-\ngant, riding your\vPOKéMON.{DONE}",
    ["87:44c5"] = "I'm crushed…{DONE}",
    ["87:44d2"] = "Wasn't there a hit\nsong about a boy\vriding a LAPRAS?{DONE}",
    ["87:4507"] = "The weather is so\nbeautiful, I'm in\va daze!{DONE}",
    ["87:4533"] = "Ohhh!{DONE}",
    ["87:453a"] = "A sunburn is the\nworst for skin.\fBut I don't use a\nsunblock.\fI won't pollute\nthe water.{DONE}",
    ["87:4591"] = "If you need to\nrest, just tread\vwater.\fYou'll get your\nwind back, so you\fcan keep on going\nstrong.{DONE}",
    ["87:45f4"] = "Oh! You have more\nenergy than I do.{DONE}",
    ["87:4619"] = "I heard roars from\ndeep inside the\vISLANDS.{DONE}",
    ["87:4646"] = "At night, STARYU\ngather near the\vwater's surface.{DONE}",
    ["87:4678"] = "Oh, dear…{DONE}",
    ["87:4683"] = "The clusters of\nSTARYU light up\vat the same time.\fIt's so beautiful,\nit's scary.{DONE}",
    ["87:4869"] = "ERIKA: Hello…\nLovely weather,\fisn't it?\nIt's so pleasant…\f…I'm afraid I may\ndoze off…\fMy name is ERIKA.\nI am the LEADER of\vCELADON GYM.\f…Oh? All the way\nfrom JOHTO, you\vsay? How nice…\fOh. I'm sorry, I\ndidn't realize\fthat you wished to\nchallenge me.\fVery well, but I\nshall not lose.{DONE}",
    ["87:497f"] = "ERIKA: Oh!\nI concede defeat…\fYou are remarkably\nstrong…\fI shall give you\nRAINBOWBADGE…{DONE}",
    ["87:49d7"] = "{PLAYER} received\nRAINBOWBADGE.{DONE}",
    ["87:49f1"] = "ERIKA: That was a\ndelightful match.\fI felt inspired.\nPlease, I wish you\vto have this TM.\fIt is GIGA DRAIN.\fIt is a wonderful\nmove that drains\fhalf the damage it\ninflicts to heal\vyour POKéMON.\fPlease use it if\nit pleases you…{DONE}",
    ["87:4ad0"] = "ERIKA: Losing\nleaves a bitter\vaftertaste…\fBut knowing that\nthere are strong\ftrainers spurs me\nto do better…{DONE}",
    ["87:4b3d"] = "ERIKA: Oh, hello.\fWhat a surprise,\nKANTO CHAMPION!\fIt's so lovely\nto see you again.\fYour journey\nmust have been\vso exciting.\fEven champions\nenjoy a challenge.\fWant to have a\nrematch with me?{DONE}",
    ["87:4bfc"] = "ERIKA: Losing\nstill leaves a\vbitter aftertaste…\fBut knowing that\nthere are strong\ftrainers spurs me\nto do better…{DONE}",
    ["87:4c6f"] = "Do you think a\ngirls-only GYM\vis rare?{DONE}",
    ["87:4c97"] = "Oh, bleah!{DONE}",
    ["87:4ca3"] = "I just got care-\nless, that's all!{DONE}",
    ["87:4cc6"] = "Oh, a battle?\nThat's kind of\vscary, but OK!{DONE}",
    ["87:4cf2"] = "Oh, that's it?{DONE}",
    ["87:4d01"] = "Oh, look at all\nyour BADGES. No\fwonder I couldn't\nwin!{DONE}",
    ["87:4d38"] = "Were you looking\nat these flowers\vor at me?{DONE}",
    ["87:4d65"] = "How annoying!{DONE}",
    ["87:4d74"] = "How do I go about\nbecoming ladylike\vlike ERIKA?{DONE}",
    ["87:4da5"] = "We'll show you\nPOKéMON moves that\vERIKA taught us!{DONE}",
    ["87:4dd5"] = "Oh… We lost…{DONE}",
    ["87:4de3"] = "ERIKA will get you\nback for us!{DONE}",
    ["87:4e04"] = "We're going to\nprotect ERIKA!{DONE}",
    ["87:4e22"] = "We couldn't win…{DONE}",
    ["87:4e33"] = "ERIKA is much,\nmuch stronger!{DONE}",
    ["87:4f99"] = "KURT: Hey there,\n{PLAYER}!\fThe guard up top\ntook off when I\vshouted at him.\fBut then I took a\ntumble down the\vWELL.\fI slammed down\nhard on my back,\vso I can't move.\fRats! If I were\nfit, my POKéMON\fwould've punished\nthem…\fAh, it can't be\nhelped.\f{PLAYER}, show them\nhow gutsy you are\vin my place!{DONE}",
    ["87:50ae"] = "KURT: Way to go,\n{PLAYER}!\fTEAM ROCKET has\ntaken off.\fMy back's better\ntoo. Let's get out\vof here.{DONE}",
    ["87:5109"] = "Darn! I was stand-\ning guard up top\fwhen some old coot\nyelled at me.\fHe startled me so\nmuch that I fell\vdown here.\fI think I'll vent\nmy anger by taking\vit out on you!{DONE}",
    ["87:51b0"] = "Arrgh! This is NOT\nmy day!{DONE}",
    ["87:51cc"] = "Sure, we've been\nhacking the tails\foff SLOWPOKE and\nselling them.\fEverything we do\nis for profit.\fThat's right!\nWe're TEAM ROCKET,\fand we'll do any-\nthing for money!{DONE}",
    ["87:526f"] = "What do you want?\fIf you interrupt\nour work, don't\vexpect any mercy!{DONE}",
    ["87:52b4"] = "You did OK today,\nbut wait till next\vtime!{DONE}",
    ["87:52e0"] = "Yeah, TEAM ROCKET\nwas broken up\vthree years ago.\fThe boss went \ninto hiding.\fBut we continued\nour activities\vunderground!{DONE}",
    ["87:535b"] = "Hyuck-hyuck-hyuck!\nQuit taking SLOW-\vPOKETAILS?\fYou're nuts!\nIf we obeyed you,\fTEAM ROCKET's rep\nwould be ruined!{DONE}",
    ["87:53cc"] = "Hyuck…\nToo strong…{DONE}",
    ["87:53e0"] = "We need the money,\nbut selling SLOW-\vPOKETAILS?\fIt's tough being a\nROCKET GRUNT!{DONE}",
    ["87:5431"] = "Stop taking TAILS?\fYeah, just try to\ndefeat all of us!{DONE}",
    ["87:5469"] = "You rotten brat!{DONE}",
    ["87:547b"] = "SLOWPOKETAILS\ngrow back fast!\fWhat's wrong with\nselling them?{DONE}",
    ["87:54b9"] = "A SLOWPOKE with\nits TAIL cut off…\fHuh? It has MAIL.\nRead it?{DONE}",
    ["87:54f7"] = "{PLAYER} read the\nMAIL.\fBe good and look\nafter the house\fwith Grandpa and\nSLOWPOKE.\fLove, Dad{DONE}",
    ["87:554f"] = "A SLOWPOKE with\nits TAIL cut off…{DONE}",
    ["87:5851"] = "Welcome!\fWe exchange your\ngame coins for\vfabulous prizes!{DONE}",
    ["87:588c"] = "Which prize would\nyou like?{DONE}",
    ["87:58a9"] = "{STRBUF}.\nIs that right?{DONE}",
    ["87:58be"] = "Here you go!{DONE}",
    ["87:58cc"] = "Sorry! You need\nmore coins.{DONE}",
    ["87:58e9"] = "Sorry. You can't\ncarry any more.{DONE}",
    ["87:590a"] = "OK. Please save\nyour coins and\vcome again!{DONE}",
    ["87:5936"] = "Oh? You don't have\na COIN CASE.{DONE}",
    ["87:5956"] = "I always play this\nslot machine. It\fpays out more than\nothers, I think.{DONE}",
    ["87:599f"] = "I just love this\nnew slot machine.\fIt's more of a\nchallenge than the\vones in CELADON.{DONE}",
    ["87:59f5"] = "Life is a gamble.\nI'm going to flip\vcards till I drop!{DONE}",
    ["87:5a2c"] = "Card flip…\fI prefer it over\nthe slots because\fit's easier to\nfigure the odds.\fBut the payout is\nmuch lower.{DONE}",
    ["87:5a98"] = "I won't quit until\nI win!{DONE}",
    ["87:5ab2"] = "I taught BLIZZARD\nto my POKéMON.\fIt was hard to get\nenough coins for\fit, but it was\nworth it.{DONE}",
    ["87:5b0e"] = "I couldn't win at\nthe slots, and I\fblew it on card\nflipping…\fI got so furious,\nI tossed out my\fCOIN CASE in the\nUNDERGROUND.{DONE}",
    ["87:5b8b"] = "Wahahah! The coins\nkeep rolling in!{DONE}",
    ["87:5bb0"] = "Someone left their\ndrink.\fIt smells sweet.{DONE}",
    ["87:5efa"] = "Fufufufu…\fI'm sorry to dis-\nappoint you…\fI'm only joking!\fI'm the real deal!\fJANINE of FUCHSIA\nGYM, that's me!{DONE}",
    ["87:5f66"] = "JANINE: You're a\ntough one. You\vdefinitely won…\fHere's SOULBADGE.\nTake it.{DONE}",
    ["87:5fb0"] = "{PLAYER} received\nSOULBADGE.{DONE}",
    ["87:5fc7"] = "JANINE: You're so\ntough! I have a\vspecial gift!\fIt's TOXIC, a pow-\nerful poison that\fsteadily saps the\nvictim's HP.{DONE}",
    ["87:6039"] = "JANINE: I'm going\nto really apply\fmyself and improve\nmy skills.\fI want to become\nbetter than both\vFather and you!{DONE}",
    ["87:60ab"] = "Fufufufu…\fWow, you did it!\fYou're the KANTO\nCHAMPION now!\fI'm so proud of\nyou! But don't\vthink I'll go easy\von you.\fWant to have a\nrematch with me?{DONE}",
    ["87:613c"] = "JANINE: You're\nstill just as\vtough!\fYou definitely\nwon…{DONE}",
    ["87:6174"] = "Fufufu!\fI'm JANINE, the\nGYM LEADER!\fNo, I'm not!\nGotcha, sucker!{DONE}",
    ["87:61b4"] = "I had you fooled…{DONE}",
    ["87:61c7"] = "How will you dis-\ntinguish our real\vLEADER?{DONE}",
    ["87:61f4"] = "Fooled you!\nHahaha!{DONE}",
    ["87:6209"] = "Ooh… I lost…\nYou're not weak…{DONE}",
    ["87:6227"] = "Well? Wasn't my\ndisguise perfect?{DONE}",
    ["87:6249"] = "I'm JANINE!\fHow did you know I\nwas real?\fLet's battle!{DONE}",
    ["87:627f"] = "Darn it!\nI wanted to win!{DONE}",
    ["87:629a"] = "You must be\ngetting tired.{DONE}",
    ["87:62b6"] = "Wahahaha!\fYou betcha!\nI'm JANINE!{DONE}",
    ["87:62d8"] = "My disguise was\nright on! Dang!{DONE}",
    ["87:62f9"] = "Hey, you. Was my\ndisguise cute or\vwhat, huh?{DONE}",
    ["87:6327"] = "Yo, CHAMP in\nmaking!\fWhoops! Take a\ngood look around\fyou. The trainers\nall look like the\vLEADER, JANINE.\fWhich of them is\nthe real JANINE?{DONE}",
    ["87:63b3"] = "That was a great\nbattle, trainer\vfrom JOHTO!{DONE}",
    ["87:6628"] = "I'm making my\nfinal preparations\ffor the POKéMON\nLEAGUE.{DONE}",
    ["87:665e"] = "I blew it!{DONE}",
    ["87:666a"] = "It's going to be\ntough to win at\vthe LEAGUE.\fI need to do some\nmore training.\fI hear that the\nLEAGUE's ELITE\fFOUR are tougher\nthan GYM LEADERS.{DONE}",
    ["87:66f9"] = "By experiencing\ntough battles, you\vgain power.{DONE}",
    ["87:6729"] = "Gaah! Life is even\ntougher!{DONE}",
    ["87:6746"] = "To get to POKéMON\nLEAGUE, you have\fto get through\nVICTORY ROAD.\fBut VICTORY ROAD\nis tough.\fPractically nobody\ngoes there!{DONE}",
    ["87:67be"] = "Since you've come\nthis far, you must\vbe good.\fI'm going to give\nthis battle every-\vthing I've got!{DONE}",
    ["87:681f"] = "No! I don't\nbelieve this!{DONE}",
    ["87:6839"] = "I've defeated\neight GYM LEADERS,\fso I was feeling\nconfident.\fI'll have to try\nharder next time.{DONE}",
    ["87:6898"] = "I lost to a train-\ner named {RIVAL}.\fHe was really\nstrong, but…\fIt was as if he\nabsolutely had to\vwin at any cost.\fI felt sorry for\nhis POKéMON.{DONE}",
    ["87:6921"] = "POKéMON aren't\ntools of war.{DONE}",
    ["87:693b"] = "POKéMON are in-\nvaluable, lifelong\vpartners.{DONE}",
    ["87:6966"] = "Wow, look at all\nthose BADGES!\vI'm impressed.\fBut you're not\nsatisfied by just\fcollecting them,\nright?{DONE}",
    ["87:69cc"] = "Good battle!{DONE}",
    ["87:69da"] = "People and POKéMON\ngrow from their\vexperiences.\fDon't get lazy and\ncomplacent.{DONE}",
    ["87:6a26"] = "I'm feeling great\ntoday!\fI feel like I\ncould boot even\vthe LEAGUE CHAMP!{DONE}",
    ["87:6a6f"] = "No! Not in this\nbattle!{DONE}",
    ["87:6a88"] = "Just like in fish-\ning, it's all over\fin POKéMON if you\ngive up.{DONE}",
    ["87:6ac6"] = "ROUTE 26\fPOKéMON LEAGUE\nRECEPTION GATE{DONE}",
    ["87:6da7"] = "Hey!{DONE}",
    ["87:6dad"] = "Do you know what\nyou just did?\fYou've taken your\nfirst step into\vKANTO.\fCheck your POKé-\nGEAR MAP and see.{DONE}",
    ["87:6e15"] = "You look pretty\nstrong.\vLet me battle you!{DONE}",
    ["87:6e41"] = "Yow!{DONE}",
    ["87:6e47"] = "If you prevail on\nthis harsh trek,\fthe truth will be\nrevealed!\fHeh, sorry, I just\nwanted to say\vsomething cool.{DONE}",
    ["87:6eb8"] = "Hm? You're good,\naren't you?{DONE}",
    ["87:6ed4"] = "Just as I thought!{DONE}",
    ["87:6ee8"] = "A good trainer can\nrecognize other\vgood trainers.{DONE}",
    ["87:6f1b"] = "You shouldn't\nunderestimate the\fwild POKéMON in\nthese parts.{DONE}",
    ["87:6f55"] = "Oh! You're much\ntoo strong!{DONE}",
    ["87:6f71"] = "You're just a kid,\nbut you're not to\fbe underestimated\neither.{DONE}",
    ["87:6faf"] = "It's rare to see\nanyone come here.\fAre you training\non your own?{DONE}",
    ["87:6ff0"] = "Oh! You're really\nstrong!{DONE}",
    ["87:700a"] = "I'm checking out\npre- and post-\vevolution POKéMON.\fEvolution really\ndoes make POKéMON\vstronger.\fBut evolved forms\nalso learn moves\vlater on.{DONE}",
    ["87:7091"] = "Don't say a thing!\fLet me guess what\nyou're thinking.\fMmmmmmm…\fI got it! You're\non the POKéMON\vLEAGUE challenge!{DONE}",
    ["87:70fd"] = "You're too much!{DONE}",
    ["87:710e"] = "With your skills,\nyou'll do well at\vthe LEAGUE.\fThat's what my\npremonition says.{DONE}",
    ["87:715e"] = "Tweet! Tweet!\nTetweet!{DONE}",
    ["87:7176"] = "Tweet!{DONE}",
    ["87:717e"] = "BIRD KEEPERS like\nme mimic bird\fwhistles to com-\nmand POKéMON.{DONE}",
    ["87:71bb"] = "TOHJO FALLS\fTHE LINK BETWEEN\nKANTO AND JOHTO{DONE}",
    ["87:735a"] = "SURGE: Hey, you\nlittle tyke!\fI have to hand it\nto you. It may not\fbe very smart to\nchallenge me, but\vit takes guts!\fWhen it comes to\nelectric POKéMON,\vI'm number one!\fI've never lost on\nthe battlefield.\fI'll zap you just\nlike I did my\venemies in war!{DONE}",
    ["87:7450"] = "SURGE: Arrrgh!\nYou are strong!\fOK, kid. You get\nTHUNDERBADGE!{DONE}",
    ["87:748f"] = "{PLAYER} received\nTHUNDERBADGE.{DONE}",
    ["87:74a9"] = "SURGE: THUNDER-\nBADGE increases\vPOKéMON's speed. \fConsider it proof\nthat you defeated\fme. You wear it\nproudly, hear?{DONE}",
    ["87:751b"] = "SURGE: Hey, kid!\nStill slugging and\vchugging away?\fMy POKéMON and I\nare still at it!{DONE}",
    ["87:756e"] = "SURGE: So, \nyou're now\vKANTO CHAMPION!\fImpressive work,\nkid! But don't\vthink I'm done!\fHow about we\nhave a go\vagain?{DONE}",
    ["87:75e1"] = "SURGE: Arrrgh!\nYou're still just\vas strong!{DONE}",
    ["87:760d"] = "You're here to\ndefeat LT.SURGE?\fNot if I can help\nit!{DONE}",
    ["87:7643"] = "Sorry I failed\nyou, LT.SURGE,\vsir!{DONE}",
    ["87:7667"] = "When I was still\nin the army, LT.\fSURGE saved my\nlife.{DONE}",
    ["87:769f"] = "LT.SURGE recog-\nnized my potential\fwith electric\nPOKéMON.\fThink you can beat\nme?{DONE}",
    ["87:76ee"] = "Ooh, how shocking!{DONE}",
    ["87:7702"] = "If the GYM's traps\nwere working, you\fwould have been\ntoast…{DONE}",
    ["87:773e"] = "I'm going to take\nyou down! Prepare\vto be shocked!{DONE}",
    ["87:7771"] = "Gwaaah!\nI was overpowered…{DONE}",
    ["87:778d"] = "Don't get too com-\nfortable about\fbeating me…\nLT.SURGE is tough.{DONE}",
    ["87:77ce"] = "Yo! CHAMP in\nmaking!\fYou lucked out\nthis time.\fLT.SURGE is very\ncautious. He has\ftraps set all over\nthe GYM.\fBut--he-heh--the\ntraps aren't\vactive right now.\fYou'll have no\nproblem getting to\vLT.SURGE.{DONE}",
    ["87:7896"] = "Whew! That was an\nelectrifying bout!\fIt sure made me\nnervous.{DONE}",
    ["87:78d5"] = "Nope! Nothing here\nbut trash.{DONE}",
    ["87:7a44"] = "I am sorry.\fCLAIR, our GYM\nLEADER, entered\fthe DRAGON'S DEN\nbehind the GYM.\fI have no idea\nwhen our LEADER\vwill return.{DONE}",
    ["87:7abd"] = "CLAIR, our GYM\nLEADER, is waiting\vfor you.\fHowever, it would\nbe impossible for\fa run-of-the-mill\ntrainer to win.{DONE}",
    ["87:7b2f"] = "You defeated\nCLAIR?\fThat's amazing!\fI've never heard\nof her losing to\fanyone other than\nLANCE.{DONE}",
    ["87:7b8d"] = "No. Only chosen\ntrainers may train\vhere.\fPlease leave.{DONE}",
    ["87:7bc5"] = "If CLAIR allows\nit, her grand-\vfather--our MASTER\v--will also.\fYou may enter.{DONE}",
    ["87:7c14"] = "My radio's busted?\nLately, I only get\vthis weird signal.{DONE}",
    ["87:7c4d"] = "Arooo! Voices in\nmy head!\fHuh? I'm listening\nto my radio!{DONE}",
    ["87:7c87"] = "Are you going to\nmake your POKéMON\vremember some\vmoves?{DONE}",
    ["87:7cbd"] = "Dragon masters all\ncome from the city\vof BLACKTHORN.{DONE}",
    ["87:7cf3"] = "SANTOS: …\fIt's Saturday…\fI'm SANTOS of\nSaturday…{DONE}",
    ["87:7d23"] = "You can have this…{DONE}",
    ["87:7d37"] = "SANTOS: …\fSPELL TAG…\fGHOST-type moves\nget stronger…\fIt will frighten\nyou…{DONE}",
    ["87:7d82"] = "SANTOS: …\fSee you again on\nanother Saturday…\fI won't have any\nmore gifts…{DONE}",
    ["87:7dcc"] = "SANTOS: Today's\nnot Saturday…{DONE}",
    ["87:7dea"] = "Wow, you came\nthrough the ICE\vPATH?\fYou must be a real\nhotshot trainer!{DONE}",
    ["87:7e33"] = "BLACKTHORN CITY\fA Quiet Mountain\nRetreat{DONE}",
    ["87:7e5d"] = "BLACKTHORN CITY\nPOKéMON GYM\vLEADER: CLAIR\fThe Blessed User\nof Dragon POKéMON{DONE}",
    ["87:7ea5"] = "MOVE BROS'\nHOUSE{DONE}",
    ["87:7eb7"] = "DRAGON'S DEN\nAHEAD{DONE}",
    ["87:7ecb"] = "TRAINER TIPS\fA POKéMON holding\na MIRACLEBERRY\fwill cure itself\nof any status\vproblem.{DONE}",
    ["88:4105"] = "ECRUTEAK used to\nhave two towers:\fone each in the\neast and west.{DONE}",
    ["88:4147"] = "Ah, child.\nHave you learned\fto dance like the\nKIMONO GIRLS?\fIf you go to their\nDANCE THEATER, an\fodd old man will\ngive you something\vnice, I hear.{DONE}",
    ["88:41db"] = "I'm going to prac-\ntice at the DANCE\fTHEATER. Care to\njoin me?{DONE}",
    ["88:421a"] = "The tower that\nused to be here…\fMy grandma told me\nit used to be much\vtaller.\fI hear there are\nghosts in it now.{DONE}",
    ["88:428c"] = "Three big POKéMON\nran off in differ-\vent directions.\vWhat were they?{DONE}",
    ["88:42cf"] = "I heard a rumor\nabout OLIVINE\vLIGHTHOUSE.\fThe POKéMON that\nserves as the\fbeacon fell ill.\nSounds like they\vare in trouble.{DONE}",
    ["88:4348"] = "The POKéMON at\nOLIVINE LIGHTHOUSE\vhas been cured.\fBoats can safely\nsail out to sea at\vnight again.{DONE}",
    ["88:43a9"] = "I hear POKéMON are\nrampaging at the\fLAKE OF RAGE. I'd\nlike to see that.{DONE}",
    ["88:43ee"] = "In the distant\npast…\fThis tower burned\nin a fire. Three\fnameless POKéMON\nperished in it.\fA rainbow-colored\nPOKéMON descended\ffrom the sky and\nresurrected them…\fIt's a legend that\nhas been passed\fdown by ECRUTEAK\nGYM LEADERS.\fMe?\fI was a trainer\nway back when.\vHohoho!{DONE}",
    ["88:44f4"] = "ECRUTEAK CITY\nA Historical City\fWhere the Past\nMeets the Present{DONE}",
    ["88:4536"] = "TIN TOWER\fA legendary POKé-\nMON is said to\vroost here.{DONE}",
    ["88:456b"] = "ECRUTEAK CITY\nPOKéMON GYM\vLEADER: MORTY\fThe Mystic Seer of\nthe Future{DONE}",
    ["88:45af"] = "ECRUTEAK DANCE\nTHEATER{DONE}",
    ["88:45c7"] = "BURNED TOWER\fIt was destroyed\nby a mysterious\vfire.\fPlease stay away,\nas it is unsafe.{DONE}",
    ["88:48e8"] = "DARK CAVE…\fIf POKéMON could\nlight it up, I'd\vexplore it.{DONE}",
    ["88:491e"] = "I caught a bunch\nof POKéMON. Let me\vbattle with you!{DONE}",
    ["88:4951"] = "Awwwww…{DONE}",
    ["88:495a"] = "You can catch\nPOKéMON even if\fyou have six with\nyou.\fIf you catch one,\nit'll go to your\vBOX automatically.{DONE}",
    ["88:49c2"] = "… Hnuurg… Huh?\fI walked too far\ntoday looking for\vPOKéMON.\fMy feet hurt and\nI'm sleepy…\fIf I were a wild\nPOKéMON, I'd be\veasy to catch…\f…Zzzz…{DONE}",
    ["88:4a4a"] = "…Zzzz… Huh?\fWhat's that? You\nhave MAIL for me?{DONE}",
    ["88:4a79"] = "{PLAYER} handed\nover the POKéMON\vholding the MAIL.{DONE}",
    ["88:4aa3"] = "Let's see…\f…DARK CAVE leads\nto another road…\fThat's good to\nknow.\fThanks for bring-\ning this to me.\fMy friend's a good\nguy, and you're\vswell too!\fI'd like to do\nsomething good in\vreturn too!\fI know! I want you\nto have this!{DONE}",
    ["88:4b7f"] = "TM50 is NIGHTMARE.\fIt's a wicked move\nthat steadily cuts\fthe HP of a sleep-\ning enemy.\fOoooh…\nThat's scary…\fI don't want to\nhave bad dreams.{DONE}",
    ["88:4c0a"] = "This MAIL isn't\nfor me.{DONE}",
    ["88:4c22"] = "Why is this POKé-\nMON so special?\fIt doesn't have\nany MAIL.{DONE}",
    ["88:4c5b"] = "What? You don't\nwant anything?{DONE}",
    ["88:4c7a"] = "If I take that\nPOKéMON from you,\fwhat are you going\nto use in battle?{DONE}",
    ["88:4cbe"] = "I found a good\nPOKéMON in DARK\vCAVE.\fI'm going to raise\nit to take on\vFALKNER.\fHe's the leader of\nVIOLET CITY's GYM.{DONE}",
    ["88:4d2e"] = "ROUTE 31\fVIOLET CITY -\nCHERRYGROVE CITY{DONE}",
    ["88:4d57"] = "DARK CAVE{DONE}",
    ["88:4ed1"] = "ELDER: You are in-\ndeed skilled as a\vtrainer.\fAs promised, here\nis your HM.\fBut let me say\nthis: You should\ftreat your\nPOKéMON better.\fThe way you battle\nis far too harsh.\fPOKéMON are not\ntools of war…{DONE}",
    ["88:4f96"] = "…\n…Humph!\fHe claims to be\nthe ELDER but\vhe's weak.\fIt stands to\nreason.\fI'd never lose to\nfools who babble\fabout being nice\nto POKéMON.\fI only care about\nstrong POKéMON\vthat can win.\fI really couldn't\ncare less about\vweak POKéMON.{DONE}",
    ["88:5072"] = "{RIVAL} used an\nESCAPE ROPE!{DONE}",
    ["88:508a"] = "So good of you to\ncome here!\fSPROUT TOWER is a\nplace of training.\fPeople and POKéMON\ntest their bonds\fto build a bright\nfuture together.\fI am the final\ntest.\fAllow me to check\nthe ties between\fyour POKéMON and\nyou!{DONE}",
    ["88:515c"] = "Ah, excellent!{DONE}",
    ["88:516c"] = "You and your POKé-\nMON should have\fno problem using\nthis move.\fTake this FLASH\nHM.{DONE}",
    ["88:51bd"] = "FLASH illuminates\neven the darkest\vof all places.\fBut to use it out\nof battle, you\fneed the BADGE\nfrom VIOLET's GYM.{DONE}",
    ["88:5232"] = "I hope you learn\nand grow from your\vjourney.{DONE}",
    ["88:5260"] = "I train to find\nenlightenment in\vPOKéMON!{DONE}",
    ["88:5288"] = "My training is\nincomplete…{DONE}",
    ["88:52a4"] = "As POKéMON grow\nstronger, so does\vthe trainer.\fNo, wait. As the\ntrainer grows\fstronger, so do\nthe POKéMON.{DONE}",
    ["88:530a"] = "Let me see how\nmuch you trust\vyour POKéMON.{DONE}",
    ["88:5334"] = "Yes, your trust is\nreal!{DONE}",
    ["88:534e"] = "It is not far to\nthe ELDER.{DONE}",
    ["88:536b"] = "The ELDER's HM\nlights even pitch-\vblack darkness.{DONE}",
    ["88:539d"] = "It is my head that\nis bright!{DONE}",
    ["88:53bc"] = "Let there be light\non your journey.{DONE}",
    ["88:53e1"] = "It's a powerful\npainting of a\vBELLSPROUT.{DONE}",
    ["88:540b"] = "A POKéMON statue…\fIt looks very\ndistinguished.{DONE}",
    ["88:5593"] = "You have to warm\nup before going\vinto the water.\fThat's basic.{DONE}",
    ["88:55d2"] = "OK! Uncle! I give!{DONE}",
    ["88:55e6"] = "CIANWOOD CITY is\na good distance\vaway from here.{DONE}",
    ["88:5618"] = "Hey, you're young\nand fit!\fDon't ride your\nPOKéMON! Swim!{DONE}",
    ["88:564e"] = "Uh-oh. I lost…{DONE}",
    ["88:565e"] = "Swimming exercises\nyour entire body.\vIt's healthy.{DONE}",
    ["88:5691"] = "Are you going to\nCIANWOOD?\fHow about a quick\nbattle first?{DONE}",
    ["88:56cd"] = "I lost that one!{DONE}",
    ["88:56df"] = "I'd say I'm a bet-\nter swimmer than\vyou. Yeah!{DONE}",
    ["88:570d"] = "No inner tube for\nme.\fI'm hanging on to\na sea POKéMON!{DONE}",
    ["88:5741"] = "Ooh, I'm feeling\ndizzy!{DONE}",
    ["88:5759"] = "While I float like\nthis, the waves\vcarry me along.{DONE}",
    ["88:578d"] = "Although you can't\nsee it from here,\fCIANWOOD is across\nthe sea.{DONE}",
    ["88:57ce"] = "Hm! There's a big\nbuilding up ahead!\fWhat is it?{DONE}",
    ["88:57ff"] = "Hm! Look at all\nthose serious-\vlooking trainers\vstreaming in.\fWhat? What?{DONE}",
    ["88:584a"] = "I came to OLIVINE\nby ship to see the\fsights and soak up\nthe atmosphere.\fBeing a port, it\nfeels so different\vfrom a big city.{DONE}",
    ["88:58c8"] = "Have you gone to\nthe BATTLE TOWER?\fI think a lot of\ntough trainers\fhave gathered\nthere already.\fBut since you have\nso many BADGES,\fyou shouldn't do\nbadly at all.{DONE}",
    ["88:596a"] = "MONICA: Glad to\nmeet you. I'm\fMONICA of Monday.{DONE}",
    ["88:599a"] = "As a token of our\nfriendship, I have\va gift for you!{DONE}",
    ["88:59d0"] = "MONICA: It's an\nitem that raises\fthe power of FLY-\nING-type moves.\fYou should equip a\nbird POKéMON with\vthat item.{DONE}",
    ["88:5a40"] = "MONICA: My broth-\ners and sisters\fare all over the\nplace.\fSee if you could\nfind them all!{DONE}",
    ["88:5a9b"] = "MONICA: I don't\nthink today is\vMonday. How sad…{DONE}",
    ["88:5acb"] = "ROUTE 40\fCIANWOOD CITY -\nOLIVINE CITY{DONE}",
    ["88:5cab"] = "Gyaoo!{DONE}",
    ["88:5cb3"] = "Hold it.\f…Are you going to\ntake the POKéMON\vLEAGUE challenge?\f…Don't make me\nlaugh.\fYou're so much\nweaker than I am.\fEven so, I've\nrealized there\fis more to it\nthan power.\fI've begun to\nunderstand what\fthat dragon master\nsaid to me…\fLove, friendship..\nit's what the\velders in the\fDRAGON'S DEN\nsaid too.\fI need to care\nfor my team.\fThey've been with\nme through it all\fand I have treated\nthem like pawns.\fBut I promise!\nI will care for\vall of you.\fTogether, we\nwill become\vunstoppable.\fWhat? PUPITAR\nis evolving!\f............\n............\fCongratulations!\nYour PUPITAR\fevolved into\nTYRANITAR?\f.....What?\nTYRANITAR?\fBut.......\nlevel.....\fAh no, I see.\nI've heard of\frare instances\nof early evol-\vution.\fSome say that\nthrough love,\fthe dragon\nmaster was able\fto do such a\nthing too.\fPerhaps it was\nthe ROCKETs\vradio signal.\fIt matters not.\nLet's battle.\fMy friends will\nbeat you and then\vthe ELITE FOUR.\f{PLAYER}!\nI challenge you!{DONE}",
    ["88:6041"] = "…I couldn't win…\fI gave it every-\nthing I had…\fWhat you possess,\nand what I lack…{DONE}",
    ["88:6093"] = "…I haven't given up\non becoming the\vgreatest trainer…\fBut that's okay,\nI will one day\freturn and\nbecome stronger.\fWhen I do, I will\nchallenge you.\fAnd I'll beat you\ndown with all my\vpower.\fCome on guys!\nlet's go!{DONE}",
    ["88:6165"] = "What power!\fWhen it comes down\nto it, nothing can\vbeat friendhship.\fI don't need any-\nthing else.{DONE}",
    ["88:630e"] = "I'm the CHAIRMAN\nof the POKéMON FAN\vCLUB.\fI've raised over\n150 POKéMON.\fI'm very fussy\nwhen it comes to\vPOKéMON.\fDid you visit just\nto hear about my\vPOKéMON?{DONE}",
    ["88:639e"] = "Good!\nThen listen up!\fSo… my favorite\nRAPIDASH…\fIt… cute… lovely…\nsmart… unbearably…\vplus… amazing… oh…\vyou think so?…\vToo much… wild…\vbeautiful… kindly…\vlove it!\fHug it… when…\nsleeping… warm and\vcuddly… Oh, and…\vspectacular…\vravishing… simply\vdivine…\vOops! Look at the\vtime! I've kept\vyou too long!{DONE}",
    ["88:64ca"] = "Thanks for hearing\nme out. I want you\vto have this!{DONE}",
    ["88:64ff"] = "It's a RARE CANDY\nthat makes POKéMON\vstronger.\fI prefer making my\nPOKéMON stronger\fby battling, so\nyou can have it.{DONE}",
    ["88:656d"] = "Hello, {PLAYER}!\fDid you come see\nme about my POKé-\vMON again?\fNo? Oh… I had more\ntales to tell…{DONE}",
    ["88:65c5"] = "How disappointing…\fCome back if you\nwant to listen.{DONE}",
    ["88:65fa"] = "Our CHAIRMAN is\nvery vocal when it\vcomes to POKéMON…{DONE}",
    ["88:662d"] = "I love the way\nCLEFAIRY waggles\fits finger when\nit's trying to use\fMETRONOME.\nIt's so adorable!{DONE}",
    ["88:668c"] = "I love CLEFAIRY,\nbut I could never\fcatch one. So I'm\nmaking do with a\fPOKé DOLL that I\nfound.{DONE}",
    ["88:66e7"] = "Oh, I see now. The\ngirl who lost this\fPOKé DOLL is sad…\fOK. Could you take\nthis POKé DOLL\fback to that poor\nlittle girl?\fI'll befriend a\nreal CLEFAIRY on\fmy own one day.\nNo worries!{DONE}",
    ["88:6797"] = "{PLAYER} received\nPOKé DOLL.{DONE}",
    ["88:67ab"] = "You watch. I'm\ngoing to get a\freal CLEFAIRY as\nmy friend.{DONE}",
    ["88:67e5"] = "Your PACK is\njammed full.{DONE}",
    ["88:6800"] = "Look at my darling\nBAYLEEF!\fThe leaf on its\nhead is so cute!{DONE}",
    ["88:683e"] = "It's a CLEFAIRY!\nHuh?\fOh, right. It's a\nCLEFAIRY POKé\vDOLL.{DONE}",
    ["88:6876"] = "BAYLEEF: Li liif!{DONE}",
    ["88:6889"] = "Let's all listen\npolitely to other\vtrainers.{DONE}",
    ["88:68b6"] = "If someone brags,\nbrag right back!{DONE}",
    ["88:6b04"] = "Go, RATTATA!\fTACKLE!{DONE}",
    ["88:6b1a"] = "What? This is a\nbig battle!\vLeave me alone!{DONE}",
    ["88:6b47"] = "I just lost, so\nI'm trying to find\vmore POKéMON.\fWait! You look\nweak! Come on,\vlet's battle!{DONE}",
    ["88:6ba0"] = "Ack! I lost again!\nDoggone it!{DONE}",
    ["88:6bc0"] = "Do I have to have\nmore POKéMON in\forder to battle\nbetter?\fNo! I'm sticking\nwith this one no\vmatter what!{DONE}",
    ["88:6c26"] = "You're a POKéMON\ntrainer, right?\fThen you have to\nbattle!{DONE}",
    ["88:6c5d"] = "That's strange.\nI won before.{DONE}",
    ["88:6c7b"] = "Becoming a good\ntrainer is really\vtough.\fI'm going to bat-\ntle other people\vto get better.{DONE}",
    ["88:6cd6"] = "Instead of a bug\nPOKéMON, I found\va trainer!{DONE}",
    ["88:6d01"] = "Argh! You're too\nstrong!{DONE}",
    ["88:6d1a"] = "I ran out of POKé\nBALLS while I was\vcatching POKéMON.\fI should've bought\nsome more…{DONE}",
    ["88:6d68"] = "MR.POKéMON's\nhouse? It's a bit\vfarther ahead.{DONE}",
    ["88:6d92"] = "Everyone's having\nfun battling!\vYou should too!{DONE}",
    ["88:6dc2"] = "I'm not a trainer.\fBut if you look\none in the eyes,\vprepare to battle.{DONE}",
    ["88:6e09"] = "ROUTE 30\fVIOLET CITY -\nCHERRYGROVE CITY{DONE}",
    ["88:6e32"] = "MR.POKéMON'S HOUSE\nSTRAIGHT AHEAD!{DONE}",
    ["88:6e53"] = "MR.POKéMON'S HOUSE{DONE}",
    ["88:6e64"] = "TRAINER TIPS\fNo stealing other\npeople's POKéMON!\fPOKé BALLS are to\nbe thrown only at\vwild POKéMON!{DONE}",
    ["88:6ebe"] = "I lost again…\nGee, you're tough!\fOh yeah, I almost\nforgot that I had\vto give you this.\fUse it to get even\ntougher, OK?\fI'm going to get\ntougher too.{DONE}",
    ["88:714a"] = "{PLAYER}: Hi! Do\nyou like POKéMON?\f{PLAYER}: Uh, no, I\njust asked you.\f{PLAYER}: Huh?\nYou're strange!{DONE}",
    ["88:7198"] = "COPYCAT: Hmm?\nQuit mimicking?\fBut that's my\nfavorite hobby!{DONE}",
    ["88:71d4"] = "{PLAYER}: Hi!\nI heard that you\flost your favorite\nPOKé DOLL.\f{PLAYER}: If I find\nit, you'll give me\va rail PASS?\f{PLAYER}: I'll go\nfind it for you.\fYou think you lost\nit when you went\vto VERMILION CITY?{DONE}",
    ["88:7286"] = "COPYCAT: Pardon?\fI shouldn't decide\nwhat you should\vdo?\fBut I'm really\nworried… What if\vsomeone finds it?{DONE}",
    ["88:72ef"] = "COPYCAT: Yay!\nThat's my CLEFAIRY\vPOKé DOLL!\fSee the tear where\nthe right leg is\fsewn on? That's\nproof!{DONE}",
    ["88:7352"] = "OK. Here's the\nMAGNET TRAIN PASS\vlike I promised!{DONE}",
    ["88:7384"] = "COPYCAT: That's\nthe PASS for the\vMAGNET TRAIN.\fThe rail company\nman gave me that\fwhen they tore\ndown our old house\vfor the STATION.{DONE}",
    ["88:7408"] = "{PLAYER}: Hi!\nThanks a lot for\vthe rail PASS!\f{PLAYER}: Pardon?\f{PLAYER}: Is it\nthat fun to mimic\vmy every move?{DONE}",
    ["88:7465"] = "COPYCAT: You bet!\nIt's a scream!{DONE}",
    ["88:7486"] = "{PLAYER}: Hi. You\nmust like POKéMON.\f{PLAYER}: No, not\nme. I asked you.\f{PLAYER}: Pardon?\nYou're weird!{DONE}",
    ["88:74d6"] = "{PLAYER}: Hi. Did\nyou really lose\vyour POKé DOLL?\f{PLAYER}: You'll\nreally give me a\frail PASS if I\nfind it for you?\f{PLAYER}: Sure,\nI'll look for it!\fYou think you lost\nit when you were\vin VERMILION?{DONE}",
    ["88:7585"] = "{PLAYER}: Thank you\nfor the rail PASS!\f{PLAYER}: …Pardon?\f{PLAYER}: Is it\nreally that fun to\fcopy what I say\nand do?{DONE}",
    ["88:75e6"] = "DODRIO: Gii giii!{DONE}",
    ["88:75f9"] = "MIRROR, MIRROR ON\nTHE WALL, WHO'S\fTHE FAIREST ONE OF\nALL?{DONE}",
    ["88:7634"] = "This is a rare\nPOKéMON! Huh?\fIt's only a doll…{DONE}",
    ["88:77d2"] = "MILTANK: Mooo!{DONE}",
    ["88:77e2"] = "I just got back to\nOLIVINE.\fSo how about a\nPOKéMON battle?{DONE}",
    ["88:781b"] = "Awaaargh!{DONE}",
    ["88:7826"] = "My POKéMON were\ncaught and raised\voverseas.\fThey're my compan-\nions on those long\vvoyages.{DONE}",
    ["88:787e"] = "This is a good\ntime to brag about\vmy PIKACHU!{DONE}",
    ["88:78ad"] = "I had no time to\nshow off PIKACHU…{DONE}",
    ["88:78d1"] = "I'm not listening\nto your bragging!\fWe POKé FANS have\na policy of not\flistening to other\npeople brag!{DONE}",
    ["88:7934"] = "Such darling\nPOKéMON.\fLet's show our\nPOKéMON together\vat the same time.{DONE}",
    ["88:7976"] = "I don't mind\nlosing.{DONE}",
    ["88:798b"] = "Do you know about\nbaby POKéMON?\fI bet they're just\nadorable!{DONE}",
    ["88:79c5"] = "PIKACHU is it!\nDon't you agree?{DONE}",
    ["88:79e5"] = "Let me see what\nyour POKéMON are\vcapable of.{DONE}",
    ["88:7a10"] = "Ooh, your POKéMON\nhave potential.{DONE}",
    ["88:7a30"] = "You know how POKé-\nMON have different\vabilities?\fPeople are like\nthat too. Every-\vone has different\vpotential.{DONE}",
    ["88:7a9d"] = "Ufufufu… I hope it\ngets dark soon.{DONE}",
    ["88:7ac1"] = "You came at just\nthe right time.\fLet's battle.{DONE}",
    ["88:7af0"] = "Oh, how disap-\npointing…{DONE}",
    ["88:7b0a"] = "I met UMBREON at\nnight right here\von ROUTE 39.\fI'm not sure why,\nbut it seems to\flike it when I\ntrain here.\fIt seems to become\nfriendlier by\ftraining here than\nanywhere else.{DONE}",
    ["88:7bb9"] = "ROUTE 39\fOLIVINE CITY -\nECRUTEAK CITY{DONE}",
    ["88:7be0"] = "MOOMOO FARM\fEnjoy Our Fresh\nand Tasty Milk{DONE}",
    ["88:7c0c"] = "TRAINER TIPS\fUse HEADBUTT on\ntrees to shake\vPOKéMON out.\fDifferent kinds of\nPOKéMON drop out\vof trees.\fUse HEADBUTT on\nany tree you see!{DONE}",
    ["88:7e4f"] = "I came through the\ntunnel, but I\fstill have plenty\nof energy left.{DONE}",
    ["88:7e93"] = "Whoa! You've got\nmore zip than me!{DONE}",
    ["88:7eb6"] = "We HIKERS are at\nour best in the\vmountains.{DONE}",
    ["88:7ee3"] = "Hey, did you get a\nDUNSPARCE?\fI caught one too.\fTake a look at it\nin the light. It's\vgot a funny face!{DONE}",
    ["88:7f4a"] = "Pant, pant…\fThat cave was\nbigger than I'd\vexpected.\fI got too tired\nexploring for\fMARILL, so I came\noutside.{DONE}",
    ["88:7fb7"] = "ROUTE 33{DONE}",
    ["89:40e3"] = "We have recordings\nof the cries of\fall POKéMON that\nhave been found.\fWe must have about\n200 kinds.{DONE}",
    ["89:4144"] = "To trainers, POKé-\nMON are their\vbeloved partners.\fIt's terrible how\nTEAM ROCKET is\ftrying to control\nPOKéMON.{DONE}",
    ["89:41ad"] = "We run 24 hours a\nday to broadcast\fentertaining pro-\ngrams.\fI'll do my best to\nrun around the\vclock too!{DONE}",
    ["89:4216"] = "The TEAM ROCKET\nboss has locked\vhimself in.\fBut the DIRECTOR\ncan open it.\fHe's up on the\nfifth floor.\fPlease save him!{DONE}",
    ["89:428d"] = "Is the DIRECTOR\nsafe?{DONE}",
    ["89:42a4"] = "Thank you!\nYou're my hero!\fThis is a token of\nmy appreciation.{DONE}",
    ["89:42e3"] = "It's SUNNY DAY.\nIt powers up fire-\vtype moves for a\vwhile.{DONE}",
    ["89:431e"] = "You were simply\nmarvelous!{DONE}",
    ["89:433a"] = "I've been given\nstrict orders.\fI'm to crush any-\none who challenges\vTEAM ROCKET!{DONE}",
    ["89:438a"] = "What?!{DONE}",
    ["89:4392"] = "I failed in my\nduties…\fARCHER will\nbe so upset...{DONE}",
    ["89:43c5"] = "It feels great\nordering POKéMON\vto commit crimes.{DONE}",
    ["89:43f5"] = "You're kidding!{DONE}",
    ["89:4405"] = "I feel lousy over\nlosing!\fDarn it! I hate\nuseless POKéMON!{DONE}",
    ["89:443e"] = "Why did the shut-\nter open? Did you\fhave something to\ndo with this?{DONE}",
    ["89:4483"] = "I'm done for!{DONE}",
    ["89:4491"] = "What?! You made it\npast our men in\vthe UNDERGROUND?\fHow could you?{DONE}",
    ["89:44d5"] = "An unknown child\nwandering here?\fWho are you?{DONE}",
    ["89:4504"] = "Tch! I took you\ntoo lightly!{DONE}",
    ["89:4522"] = "Bwahahaha…\fI can transmit as\nstrong a signal as\vI need from here.{DONE}",
    ["89:4565"] = "It's the CARD KEY\nslot.{DONE}",
    ["89:457d"] = "{PLAYER} inserted\nthe CARD KEY.{DONE}",
    ["89:4597"] = "3F PERSONNEL{DONE}",
    ["89:45a5"] = "POKéMON MUSIC with\nHost DJ BEN{DONE}",
    ["89:4684"] = "This POLIWRATH is\nmy partner.\fI wonder if it'll\never evolve into a\vfrog POKéMON.{DONE}",
    ["89:46d2"] = "POLIWRATH: Croak!{DONE}",
    ["89:46e5"] = "I lost at the slot\nmachines again…\fWe girls also play\nthe slots now.\fYou should check\nthem out too.{DONE}",
    ["89:474a"] = "GRIMER have been\nappearing lately.\fSee that pond out\nin front of the\fhouse? GRIMER live\nthere now.\fWhere did they\ncome from? This is\va serious problem…{DONE}",
    ["89:47e3"] = "Nihihi! This GYM\nis great! Only\fgirls are allowed\nhere!{DONE}",
    ["89:481c"] = "Want to know a\nsecret?\fCELADON MANSION\nhas a hidden back\vdoor.{DONE}",
    ["89:485c"] = "They're holding an\neating contest at\vthe restaurant.\fJust watching them\ngo at it makes me\vfeel bloated…{DONE}",
    ["89:48c4"] = "CELADON DEPT.STORE\nhas the biggest\fand best selection\nof merchandise.\fIf you can't get\nit there, you\fcan't get it any-\nwhere.\fGee… I sound like\na sales clerk.{DONE}",
    ["89:4a0d"] = "Looking at the\nground while I was\fwalking made me\ndizzy.{DONE}",
    ["89:4a47"] = "CELADON CITY\fThe City of\nRainbow Dreams{DONE}",
    ["89:4a70"] = "CELADON CITY\nPOKéMON GYM\vLEADER: ERIKA\fThe Nature-Loving\nPrincess{DONE}",
    ["89:4ab0"] = "Find What You\nNeed at CELADON\vDEPT.STORE!{DONE}",
    ["89:4adb"] = "CELADON MANSION{DONE}",
    ["89:4aec"] = "The Playground for\nEverybody--CELADON\vGAME CORNER{DONE}",
    ["89:4b1f"] = "TRAINER TIPS\fGUARD SPEC.\nprotects POKéMON\fagainst SPECIAL\nattacks such as\vfire and water.\fGet your items at\nCELADON DEPT.\vSTORE!{DONE}",
    ["89:4d42"] = "…\fYou again?\fThere's no need to\npanic. I don't\fbother with wimps\nlike you.\fSpeaking of weak-\nlings, the city's\fGYM LEADER is\nsaid by some to be\fstronger than\nPRYCE, yet is\fsupposedly taking\ncare of a sick\fPOKéMON at the\nLIGHTHOUSE.\fHumph! Boo-hoo!\nJust let sick\vPOKéMON go!\fA POKéMON that\ncan't battle is\vworthless!\fWhy don't you go\ntrain at the\vLIGHTHOUSE?\fWho knows. It may\nmake you a bit\vless weak!\fMaybe then you\ncould at least\ftake on CHUCK\nor PRYCE!{DONE}",
    ["89:4efd"] = "Dark roads are\ndangerous at\vnight.\fBut in the pitch-\nblack of night,\fthe sea is even\nmore treacherous!\fWithout the beacon\nof the LIGHTHOUSE\fto guide it, no\nship can sail.{DONE}",
    ["89:4fa9"] = "That thing you\nhave--it's a POKé-\vGEAR, right? Wow,\vthat's cool.{DONE}",
    ["89:4fe6"] = "Wow, you have a\nPOKéDEX!\fThat is just so\nawesome.{DONE}",
    ["89:5016"] = "The league has\nJASMINE pegged\fas the sixth\nstrongest GYM\vLEADER!\fHah! That's\na load of crud.\fThere's no way\nPRYCE could hurt\fJASMINE's Steel\ntype POKéMON!\fBureaucracy if\nyou ask me.\fShe's something\nto be feared,\vThat's for sure!{DONE}",
    ["89:50f4"] = "OLIVINE CITY\fThe Port Closest\nto Foreign Lands{DONE}",
    ["89:5124"] = "OLIVINE PORT\nFAST SHIP PIER{DONE}",
    ["89:5141"] = "OLIVINE CITY\nPOKéMON GYM\vLEADER: JASMINE\fThe Steel-Clad\nDefense Girl{DONE}",
    ["89:5184"] = "OLIVINE LIGHTHOUSE\nAlso known as the\vGLITTER LIGHTHOUSE{DONE}",
    ["89:51bd"] = "BATTLE TOWER AHEAD\nOpening Now!{DONE}",
    ["89:53e3"] = "Oh, {PLAYER}…! Our\nneighbor, PROF.ELM\fwas looking for\nyou. Also, your\fPOKéGEAR is back\nfrom the shop.\fHere you go!{DONE}",
    ["89:544d"] = "Oh, the day of the\nweek isn't set.\fYou mustn't forget\nthat!{DONE}",
    ["89:5488"] = "Is it Daylight\nSaving Time now?{DONE}",
    ["89:54a9"] = "By the way, do you\nknow how to use\vthe PHONE?{DONE}",
    ["89:54d8"] = "Great! No need to\nexplain it then.{DONE}",
    ["89:54fc"] = "I'll read the\ninstructions.\fTurn the POKéGEAR\non and select the\vPHONE icon.{DONE}",
    ["89:5545"] = "Phone numbers are\nstored in memory.\fJust choose a name\nyou want to call.{DONE}",
    ["89:558f"] = "Oh, and remember,\nyou can get there\vfaster if you run!{DONE}",
    ["89:55c7"] = "PROF.ELM is wait-\ning for you.\fHurry up, baby!{DONE}",
    ["89:55f7"] = "So, what was PROF.\nELM's errand?\f…\fThat does sound\nchallenging.\fBut, you should be\nproud that people\vrely on you.{DONE}",
    ["89:5669"] = "{PLAYER}, do it!\fI'm behind you all\nthe way!{DONE}",
    ["89:568f"] = "Good morning,\n{PLAYER}!\fI'm visiting!{DONE}",
    ["89:56ae"] = "Hello, {PLAYER}!\nI'm visiting!{DONE}",
    ["89:56c6"] = "Good evening,\n{PLAYER}!\fI'm visiting!{DONE}",
    ["89:56e5"] = "{PLAYER}, have you\nheard?\fMy daughter is\nadamant about\fbecoming PROF.\nELM's assistant.\fShe really loves\nPOKéMON!{DONE}",
    ["89:574c"] = "Mom's specialty!\fCINNABAR VOLCANO\nBURGER!{DONE}",
    ["89:5776"] = "The sink is spot-\nless. Mom likes it\vclean.{DONE}",
    ["89:57a3"] = "Let's see what's\nin the fridge…\fFRESH WATER and\ntasty LEMONADE!{DONE}",
    ["89:57e2"] = "There's a movie on\nTV: Stars dot the\fsky as two boys\nride on a train…\fI'd better get\nrolling too!{DONE}",
    ["89:5958"] = "VERMILION PORT is\nKANTO's seaside\vgateway.\fLuxury liners from\naround the world\vdock here.{DONE}",
    ["89:59b2"] = "My POKéMON is\npreparing the land\vfor construction.\fBut I have no\nmoney to start the\vproject…{DONE}",
    ["89:5a0d"] = "MACHOP: Guooh\ngogogoh!{DONE}",
    ["89:5a25"] = "A MACHOP is growl-\ning while stomping\vthe ground flat.{DONE}",
    ["89:5a5d"] = "There are eight\nGYMS in KANTO.\fThat big building\nis VERMILION's\vPOKéMON GYM.{DONE}",
    ["89:5aa7"] = "SNORLAX is snoring\npeacefully…{DONE}",
    ["89:5ac7"] = "The POKéGEAR was\nplaced near the\vsleeping SNORLAX…\f…\fSNORLAX woke up!{DONE}",
    ["89:5b0b"] = "Skilled trainers\ngather in KANTO.\fGYM LEADERS are\nespecially strong.\fThey won't be easy\nto defeat.{DONE}",
    ["89:5b6e"] = "You've started to\ncollect KANTO GYM\vBADGES?\fDon't you agree\nthat the trainers\vhere are tough?{DONE}",
    ["89:5bcb"] = "I guess you'll be\nfinished with your\fconquest of KANTO\nGYMS soon.\fLet me know if\nyou get all eight\vBADGES.{DONE}",
    ["89:5c36"] = "Congratulations!\fYou got all the\nKANTO GYM BADGES.\fI've got a reward\nfor your efforts.{DONE}",
    ["89:5c8d"] = "Having a variety\nof POKéMON types\fshould give you an\nedge in battle.\fI'm sure the KANTO\nGYM BADGES will\vhelp you.{DONE}",
    ["89:5cfc"] = "VERMILION CITY\fThe Port of\nExquisite Sunsets{DONE}",
    ["89:5d2a"] = "VERMILION CITY\nPOKéMON GYM\vLEADER: LT.SURGE\fThe Lightning\nAmerican{DONE}",
    ["89:5d6b"] = "POKéMON FAN CLUB\fAll POKéMON Fans\nWelcome!{DONE}",
    ["89:5d91"] = "DIGLETT'S CAVE{DONE}",
    ["89:5da1"] = "VERMILION PORT\nENTRANCE{DONE}",
    ["89:5f7b"] = "…… …… ……\f…Oh, it's you.\fI came looking for\nsome legendary\fPOKéMON that they\nsay roosts here.\fBut there's\nnothing here!\fNothing after all\nthe trouble of\fcoming to this\ndump? No way!\fIt's all your\nfault!{DONE}",
    ["89:603d"] = "…Humph!\fI only lost be-\ncause my POKéMON\vare so weak.\fHow pathetic.{DONE}",
    ["89:607f"] = "…Aw, whatever.\fYou would never be\nable to catch a\flegendary POKéMON\nanyway.{DONE}",
    ["89:60c9"] = "…Humph!\fThis is why I hate\nbattling wimps.\fIt's just a waste\nof my time.{DONE}",
    ["89:6112"] = "Humph!\fWhat are you doing\nfalling into a\fhole? Some genius\nyou are!\fServes you right!{DONE}",
    ["89:6169"] = "EUSINE: My name's\nEUSINE.\fI'm on the trail\nof a POKéMON named\vSUICUNE.\fAnd you are…?\f{PLAYER}? Glad to\nmeet you!\fI heard rumors\nthat SUICUNE is in\fthis BURNED TOWER,\nso I came to look.\fBut where exactly\ncould it be?{DONE}",
    ["89:6236"] = "EUSINE: I heard\nthat SUICUNE is in\fthis BURNED TOWER,\nso I came to look.\fBut where exactly\ncould it be?{DONE}",
    ["89:629f"] = "MORTY: ECRUTEAK's\nGYM LEADER has to\fstudy what are\nsaid to be the\flegendary POKéMON\n--SUICUNE, ENTEI\vand RAIKOU.\fEUSINE is here, so\nI've decided to\finvestigate the\nTOWER with him.{DONE}",
    ["89:6478"] = "BLAINE: Waaah!\fMy GYM in CINNABAR\nburned down.\fBut I'm back in\nbusiness as a GYM\fLEADER here in\nthis cave.\fIt's fine though,\nI have faced\fhardship like\nthis before.\fLong ago I was\nlost in the\fmountains until\na fiery bird\fPOKéMON appeared\nto lead me down.\fAll these years\nlater and now\fRED has entrusted\nme to look over\fthat same\nlegendary bird,\fMOLTRES.\fHa! You'd better\nhave BURN HEAL,\fIt's even hotter\nthan your mom!{DONE}",
    ["89:6615"] = "BLAINE: Awesome.\nI've burned out…\fYou've earned\nVOLCANOBADGE!{DONE}",
    ["89:6652"] = "{PLAYER} received\nVOLCANOBADGE.{DONE}",
    ["89:666c"] = "BLAINE: I did lose\nthis time, but I'm\fgoing to win the\nnext time.\fWhen I rebuild my\nCINNABAR GYM,\fwe'll have to have\na rematch.{DONE}",
    ["89:66eb"] = "BLAINE: My fire\nPOKéMON will be\feven stronger.\nJust you watch!{DONE}",
    ["89:6728"] = "BLAINE: Whoa!\fI see you've\nbecome the\vKANTO CHAMPION!\fThat's blazing!\fYour skills are\ntop-notch.\fI'm always\nup for a battle.\fWant to have a\nrematch with me?{DONE}",
    ["89:67c3"] = "BLAINE: Your\nskills are truly\vfiery!\fYou've burned\nright through\vmy defenses.{DONE}",
    ["89:6811"] = "Yo!\f… Huh? It's over\nalready?\fSorry, sorry!\fCINNABAR GYM was\ngone, so I didn't\fknow where to find\nyou.\fBut, hey, you're\nplenty strong even\fwithout my advice.\nI knew you'd win!{DONE}",
    ["89:68be"] = "A POKéMON GYM can\nbe anywhere as\flong as the GYM\nLEADER is there.\fThere's no need\nfor a building.{DONE}",
    ["89:69cf"] = "BLUE: Yo! Finally\ngot here, huh?\fI wasn't in the\nmood at CINNABAR,\fbut now I'm ready\nto battle you.\f…\fYou're telling me\nyou conquered all\vthe GYMS in JOHTO?\fHeh! JOHTO's GYMS\nmust be pretty\vpathetic then.\fHey, don't worry\nabout it.\fI'll know if you\nare good or not by\fbattling you right\nnow.\fReady, JOHTO\nCHAMP?{DONE}",
    ["89:6b02"] = "BLUE: What?\fHow the heck did I\nlose to you?\f…\fTch, all right…\nHere, take this--\vit's EARTHBADGE.{DONE}",
    ["89:6b63"] = "{PLAYER} received\nEARTHBADGE.{DONE}",
    ["89:6bff"] = "BLUE: Listen, you.\fYou'd better not\nlose until I beat\vyou. Got it?{DONE}",
    ["89:6c42"] = "BLUE: Well, well.\nKANTO CHAMPION!\fLooks like you've\ncome a long way.\fI used to have\nthat title too,\vyou know. But I\vwon't go easy.\fLet's see if you\ncan keep it up.\fWant to have a\nrematch with me?{DONE}",
    ["89:6d04"] = "BLUE: What?\fHow the heck did I\nlose again?{DONE}",
    ["89:6d30"] = "Yo, CHAMP in\nmaking!\fHow's it going?\nLooks like you're\von a roll.\fThe GYM LEADER is\na guy who battled\fthe CHAMPION three\nyears ago.\fHe's no pushover.\fGive it everything\nyou've got!{DONE}",
    ["89:6de2"] = "Man, you are truly\ntough…\fThat was a heck of\nan inspirational\fbattle. It brought\ntears to my eyes.{DONE}",
    ["89:6f19"] = "How did you get\nthis far?\fI guess it can't\nbe helped. I'll\vdispose of you.{DONE}",
    ["89:6f63"] = "I got disposed of…{DONE}",
    ["89:6f77"] = "TEAM ROCKET will\nkeep going, wait-\ving for the return\vof GIOVANNI.\fWe'll do whatever\nit takes.{DONE}",
    ["89:6fd6"] = "You're not going\nany farther!\fI don't show mercy\nto my enemies, not\veven brats!{DONE}",
    ["89:7025"] = "Blast it!{DONE}",
    ["89:7030"] = "I lost…\fPlease forgive me,\nGIOVANNI!{DONE}",
    ["89:7056"] = "Hyuck-hyuck-hyuck!\nLook who it is!\fReady? I'm \nreally tough now!{DONE}",
    ["89:7097"] = "Hyuck-hyuck-hyuck!\nYou're so good!\fThis TEAM ROCKET\nthing is just\fa job, but I can\nsee it hurts\fothers. That's it, \nI'm leaving.\fThank you so much.\nSorry GIOVANNI!{DONE}",
    ["89:7139"] = "Hyuck-hyuck-hyuck!\nThat was a blast!\vI'll remember you!{DONE}",
    ["89:7171"] = "DIRECTOR: Who?\nWhat? You came to\vrescue me?\fThank you!\fThe RADIO TOWER!\fWhat's happening\nthere?\fTaken over by TEAM\nROCKET?\fHere. Take this\nCARD KEY.{DONE}",
    ["89:7206"] = "DIRECTOR: Use that\nto open the shut-\vters on 3F.{DONE}",
    ["89:7238"] = "I'm begging you to\nhelp.\fThere's no telling\nwhat they'll do if\fthey control the\ntransmitter.\fThey may even be\nable to control\fPOKéMON using a\nspecial signal!\fYou're the only\none I can call on.\fPlease save the\nRADIO TOWER…\fAnd all the POKé-\nMON nationwide!{DONE}",
    ["89:7431"] = "I listened to the\nradio while I was\vat the RUINS.\fI heard a strange\nbroadcast there.{DONE}",
    ["89:7487"] = "MARY: Why? Why do\nI have to suffer\vthrough this?\fMEOWTH, help me!{DONE}",
    ["89:74ca"] = "MARY: Oh! You're\nmy little savior!\fWill you take this\nas my thanks?{DONE}",
    ["89:750e"] = "MARY: It's just\nright for POKéMON\fthat know normal-\ntype moves.{DONE}",
    ["89:754b"] = "MARY: Please tune\ninto me on PROF.\fOAK'S POKéMON TALK\nshow.{DONE}",
    ["89:7585"] = "MEOWTH: Meowth…{DONE}",
    ["89:7596"] = "You plan to rescue\nthe DIRECTOR?\fThat won't be pos-\nsible because I'm\vgoing to beat you!{DONE}",
    ["89:75ee"] = "No! Unbelievable!{DONE}",
    ["89:7601"] = "I don't believe\nit! I was beaten!{DONE}",
    ["89:7623"] = "Stop! I'm known as\nthe TEAM ROCKET\vfortress!\fYou're not taking\nanother step!{DONE}",
    ["89:766f"] = "The fortress came\ndown!{DONE}",
    ["89:7688"] = "You've earned my\nrespect, so here's\vsome advice.\fIt's not too late.\nYou can still turn\vback.{DONE}",
    ["89:76e3"] = "Don't I think\nPOKéMON are cute?\fI'll think my\nPOKéMON are cute--\fafter they beat\nyours!{DONE}",
    ["89:7734"] = "Oh, no! They're so\nuseless!{DONE}",
    ["89:7750"] = "I love my\nbeautiful self!\fWho cares about\nPOKéMON?{DONE}",
    ["89:7781"] = "Most excellent.\fThis RADIO TOWER\nwill fulfill our\vgrand design.{DONE}",
    ["89:77c2"] = "Hmmm…\fAll grand plans\ncome with snags.{DONE}",
    ["89:77ea"] = "Do you honestly\nbelieve you can\vstop TEAM ROCKET?{DONE}",
    ["89:781d"] = "4F PRODUCTION{DONE}",
    ["89:782c"] = "4F STUDIO 2{DONE}",
    ["89:7925"] = "LANCE: It's been a\nlong time since I\vlast came here.\fThis is where we\nhonor the LEAGUE\fCHAMPIONS for all\neternity.\fTheir courageous\nPOKéMON are also\vinducted.\fHere today, we\nwitnessed the rise\fof a new LEAGUE\nCHAMPION--a\ftrainer who feels\ncompassion for,\fand trust toward,\nall POKéMON.\fA trainer who\nsucceeded through\fperseverance and\ndetermination.\fThe new LEAGUE\nCHAMPION who has\fall the makings\nof greatness!\f{PLAYER}, allow me\nto register you\fand your partners\nas CHAMPIONS!{DONE}",
    ["89:7af7"] = "LANCE: I remember,\nit wasn't long ago\vI stood here,\fwelcoming you as\nthe CHAMPION of\vJOHTO.\fAnd now, here we\nare again,\fin this sacred\nplace where we\vhonor the very \vbest trainers\vand their POKéMON.\fToday, you've\nproven yourself\vnot just in JOHTO,\fbut in KANTO as\nwell,\fbesting even my\nstrongest team.\fYou've shown\nremarkable\vcompassion and\vtrust in your\vPOKéMON,\fa bond that\nhas carried you to\vvictory time and\vagain.\fYour journey,\nmarked by\vperseverance and\vunwavering\vdetermination,\fspeaks to your\ntrue spirit as a\vtrainer.\fYou have all the\nmakings of a true\vgreat,\fperhaps even\nthe greatest.\f{PLAYER},\nit is my honor\vto register you,\fand your trusted\npartners,\fas champions\nonce again.{DONE}",
    ["89:7e71"] = "MOOMOO is sick…\fShe needs lots of\nBERRIES.{DONE}",
    ["89:7e9d"] = "We're feeding\nMOOMOO!{DONE}",
    ["89:7eb3"] = "MILTANK: …Moo…{DONE}",
    ["89:7ec3"] = "Its cry is weak…{DONE}",
    ["89:7ed5"] = "MILTANK: Mooo!{DONE}",
    ["89:7ee5"] = "Give a BERRY to\nMILTANK?{DONE}",
    ["89:7eff"] = "{PLAYER} gave a\nBERRY to MILTANK.{DONE}",
    ["89:7f1b"] = "MILTANK became a\nlittle healthier!{DONE}",
    ["89:7f3f"] = "MILTANK became\nquite healthy!{DONE}",
    ["89:7f5e"] = "MILTANK became\ntotally healthy!{DONE}",
    ["89:7f7f"] = "{PLAYER} has no\nBERRIES…{DONE}",
    ["89:7f92"] = "{PLAYER} wouldn't\ngive a BERRY.\fMILTANK looks sad.{DONE}",
    ["8a:40d5"] = "I'm going to KANTO\nto test my skills.{DONE}",
    ["8a:40fb"] = "I wanted to win!{DONE}",
    ["8a:410d"] = "Trainers from\nJOHTO can battle\fwith KANTO GYM\nLEADERS.{DONE}",
    ["8a:4145"] = "I'm training to\nbecome the CHAMP!{DONE}",
    ["8a:4167"] = "What's so differ-\nent between us?{DONE}",
    ["8a:4189"] = "I'm going to beat\nyou someday!{DONE}",
    ["8a:41a8"] = "Do you know LILY?\nShe's a hot DJ in\vKANTO.{DONE}",
    ["8a:41d3"] = "Gyaaaah!{DONE}",
    ["8a:41dd"] = "LILY's nice, but\nMARY's the best!\fI want to check\nout JOHTO's radio\vprograms!{DONE}",
    ["8a:4229"] = "Are you alone?\nThen let's battle!{DONE}",
    ["8a:424b"] = "That's too much to\nhandle!{DONE}",
    ["8a:4266"] = "I wonder if there\nare any mountains\fworth climbing in\nKANTO?{DONE}",
    ["8a:42a4"] = "Yeah, I'm a sail-\nor, all right.\fI wasn't goofing\noff!\fThis cabin was\nvacant, so I just\vtook a quick nap!\fAh, forget it!\nLet's battle!{DONE}",
    ["8a:4329"] = "Sorry! It's all my\nfault!{DONE}",
    ["8a:4343"] = "Being a sailor, I\nhave to do phys-\vical labor. It's\vexhausting!{DONE}",
    ["8a:4383"] = "Oh, no. I've lost\nsomething that's\vvery important.{DONE}",
    ["8a:43b5"] = "I… I can't find\nit…{DONE}",
    ["8a:43c9"] = "I give up.\nYou don't have to\flook. Just forget\nabout it!{DONE}",
    ["8a:4402"] = "Yeehaw!\nLucky!{DONE}",
    ["8a:4412"] = "How unlucky!\nI lost!{DONE}",
    ["8a:4428"] = "I found a pretty\ncoin here.\fSomeone must have\nlost it…{DONE}",
    ["8a:4672"] = "At the POKéMON\nLEAGUE, you'll get\ftested by the\nELITE FOUR.\fYou have to beat\nthem all. If you\flose, you have to\nstart all over!{DONE}",
    ["8a:46ef"] = "Hold it.\fYou're going to\ntake the POKéMON\fLEAGUE challenge\nnow?\fThat's not going\nto happen.\fMy super-well-\ntrained POKéMON\fare going to pound\nyou.\f{PLAYER}!\nI challenge you!{DONE}",
    ["8a:478f"] = "…\fOK--I lost…{DONE}",
    ["8a:479e"] = "…Darn… I still\ncan't win…\fI… I have to think\nmore about my\vPOKéMON…\fHumph! Try not to\nlose!{DONE}",
    ["8a:47f7"] = "…\fWhew…\nWith my partners,\fI'm going to be\nthe CHAMPION!{DONE}",
    ["8a:482f"] = "Ah! You're chal-\nlenging the ELITE\fFOUR? Are you sure\nyou're ready?\fIf you need to\ntrain some more,\fmy ABRA can help\nyou.\fIt can TELEPORT\nyou home.\fWould you like to\ngo home now?{DONE}",
    ["8a:48e1"] = "OK, OK. Picture\nyour house in your\vmind…{DONE}",
    ["8a:490b"] = "OK, OK. The best\nof luck to you!{DONE}",
    ["8a:492d"] = "ABRA: Aabra…{DONE}",
    ["8a:4a53"] = "ANN: ANNE and I\nare in this to-\vgether!{DONE}",
    ["8a:4a7c"] = "ANN & ANNE: Nnn… A\nlittle too strong.{DONE}",
    ["8a:4aa3"] = "ANN: I can tell\nwhat my sister and\fmy POKéMON are\nthinking.{DONE}",
    ["8a:4add"] = "ANNE: ANN and I\nare in this to-\vgether!{DONE}",
    ["8a:4b06"] = "ANN & ANNE: Nnn… A\nlittle too strong.{DONE}",
    ["8a:4b2d"] = "ANNE: We share the\nsame feelings as\vour POKéMON.{DONE}",
    ["8a:4b5c"] = "POKéMON can't do a\nthing if they are\vasleep.\fI'll show you how\nscary that is!{DONE}",
    ["8a:4ba6"] = "I lost. That's\npretty sad…{DONE}",
    ["8a:4bc1"] = "Putting POKéMON to\nsleep or paralyz-\ving them are good\vbattle techniques.{DONE}",
    ["8a:4c09"] = "SUNNY: Hi!\fI'm SUNNY of Sun-\nday, meaning it's\vSunday today!{DONE}",
    ["8a:4c45"] = "I was told to give\nyou this if I saw\vyou!{DONE}",
    ["8a:4c70"] = "I was told to give\nyou this if I saw\vyou!{DONE}",
    ["8a:4c9b"] = "SUNNY: That thing…\fUm…\f… What was it now…\f…\fOh! I remember\nnow!\fA POKéMON that\nknows electric\fmoves should hold\nit.\fMy sis MONICA said\nit powers up\velectric moves!{DONE}",
    ["8a:4d3d"] = "SUNNY: My sisters\nand brothers are\vMONICA, TUSCANY,\vWESLEY, ARTHUR,\vFRIEDA and SANTOS.\fThey're all older\nthan me!{DONE}",
    ["8a:4daf"] = "SUNNY: Isn't today\nSunday?\vUm… I forgot!{DONE}",
    ["8a:4dd8"] = "ROUTE 37{DONE}",
    ["8a:4fc4"] = "Let me demonstrate\nthe power of the\vPOKéMON I caught!{DONE}",
    ["8a:4ff8"] = "What? That's not\nright.{DONE}",
    ["8a:5010"] = "I want to become\nthe trainer CHAMP\fusing the POKéMON\nI caught.\fThat's the best\npart of fishing!{DONE}",
    ["8a:506d"] = "Ah, it's good to\nbe outside!\vI feel so free!{DONE}",
    ["8a:509a"] = "Gahahah!{DONE}",
    ["8a:50a4"] = "Losing feels in-\nsignificant if you\flook up at the big\nsky!{DONE}",
    ["8a:50e1"] = "HEY!\fThis is my secret\nplace! Get lost,\vyou outsider!{DONE}",
    ["8a:5118"] = "I should have used\nmy MOON STONE…{DONE}",
    ["8a:513b"] = "You're working on\na POKéDEX?\fWow, you must know\nsome pretty rare\vPOKéMON!\fMay I please see\nit. Please?{DONE}",
    ["8a:519c"] = "ROUTE 42\fECRUTEAK CITY -\nMAHOGANY TOWN{DONE}",
    ["8a:51c4"] = "MT.MORTAR\fWATERFALL CAVE\nINSIDE{DONE}",
    ["8a:51e5"] = "MT.MORTAR\fWATERFALL CAVE\nINSIDE{DONE}",
    ["8a:5206"] = "ROUTE 42\fECRUTEAK CITY -\nMAHOGANY TOWN{DONE}",
    ["8a:53a4"] = "Hello!\nYou are trainer?\fBattle GYM LEADER,\nwin you did?{DONE}",
    ["8a:53dd"] = "Ooh, la la!\nVery indeed nice!{DONE}",
    ["8a:53fc"] = "Is that so? Then\nstudy shall you!\vFollow me!{DONE}",
    ["8a:542a"] = "Here, teacher I\nam. Good it is\vyou study here!{DONE}",
    ["8a:545a"] = "Ghosts are rumored\nto appear in\vSPROUT TOWER.\fThey say that\nGHOST-type moves\fcan bypass the\ndefenses of\ftough POKéMON like\nONIX and GEODUDE.{DONE}",
    ["8a:54e5"] = "Hey, you're a\nPOKéMON trainer?\fIf you head to\nthe ACADEMY,\fyou might learn\nsomething new!{DONE}",
    ["8a:553c"] = "FALKNER, from the\nVIOLET POKéMON\fGYM, is a fine\ntrainer!\fHe inherited his\nfather's gym and\fhas done a great\njob with it.{DONE}",
    ["8a:55b2"] = "I saw a wiggly\ntree up ahead!\fIf you touch it,\nit squirms and\vdances! Cool!{DONE}",
    ["8a:55ff"] = "VIOLET CITY\fThe City of\nNostalgic Scents{DONE}",
    ["8a:5629"] = "VIOLET CITY\nPOKéMON GYM\vLEADER: FALKNER\fThe Elegant Master\nof Flying POKéMON{DONE}",
    ["8a:5671"] = "SPROUT TOWER\fExperience the\nWay of POKéMON{DONE}",
    ["8a:569a"] = "EARL'S POKéMON\nACADEMY{DONE}",
    ["8a:57cf"] = "DON: I'm going to\nwin! Don't bother\vme.{DONE}",
    ["8a:57f6"] = "ED: My PARASECT\nputs POKéMON to\vsleep with SPORE.{DONE}",
    ["8a:5826"] = "NICK: I'm raising\nfast POKéMON for\vbattles.{DONE}",
    ["8a:584f"] = "WILLIAM: I'm not\nconcerned about\vwinning.\fI'm just looking\nfor rare POKéMON.{DONE}",
    ["8a:5898"] = "BENNY: Ssh! You'll\nscare off SCYTHER.\fI'll talk to you\nlater.{DONE}",
    ["8a:58d5"] = "BARRY: You should\nweaken bug POKéMON\ffirst, then throw\na BALL.{DONE}",
    ["8a:5912"] = "CINDY: I love bug\nPOKéMON.\fI guess you must\nlike them too.{DONE}",
    ["8a:594b"] = "JOSH: I've been\ncollecting bug\fPOKéMON since I\nwas just a baby.\fThere's no way I'm\ngoing to lose!{DONE}",
    ["8a:59a8"] = "SAMUEL: If you've\ngot the time to\fchat, go find some\nbug POKéMON.{DONE}",
    ["8a:59e7"] = "KIPP: I've studied\nabout bug POKéMON\va lot.\fI'm going to win\nfor sure.{DONE}",
    ["8a:5a2a"] = "RELAXATION SQUARE\nNATIONAL PARK{DONE}",
    ["8a:5a4b"] = "What is this\nnotice?\fPlease battle only\nin the grass.\fNATIONAL PARK\nWARDEN'S OFFICE{DONE}",
    ["8a:5aa0"] = "TRAINER TIPS\fPrint out MAIL by\nopening it then\vpressing START.{DONE}",
    ["8a:5c9c"] = "JASMINE: … This\nPOKéMON always\fkept the sea lit\nat night.\f…But it suddenly\ngot sick… It's\vgasping for air…\f…I understand\nthat there is a\fwonderful PHARMACY\nin CIANWOOD…\fBut that's across\nthe sea…\fAnd I can't leave\nAMPHY unattended…{DONE}",
    ["8a:5d7f"] = "…May I ask you to\nget some medicine\vfor me? Please?{DONE}",
    ["8a:5db4"] = "JASMINE: …Will\nthat medicine cure\vAMPHY?{DONE}",
    ["8a:5dde"] = "{PLAYER} handed the\nSECRETPOTION to\vJASMINE.{DONE}",
    ["8a:5e05"] = "JASMINE: …Um,\nplease don't be\voffended…\f…AMPHY will not\ntake anything from\vanyone but me…{DONE}",
    ["8a:5e5f"] = "JASMINE: …\fAMPHY, how are you\nfeeling?{DONE}",
    ["8a:5e87"] = "JASMINE: …Oh, I'm\nso relieved…\fThis is just so\nwonderful…\fThank you so very,\nvery much.\f…I will return to\nthe GYM…\fI'll also warn \nyou, steel types\vare powerful.{DONE}",
    ["8a:5f28"] = "JASMINE: …I see…{DONE}",
    ["8a:5f3a"] = "…AMPHY, hang on!{DONE}",
    ["8a:5f4c"] = "AMPHY: …\n…Pa… paloo…{DONE}",
    ["8a:5f62"] = "Its breathing is\nterribly labored…{DONE}",
    ["8a:5f86"] = "AMPHY: Palu!\nPalulu!{DONE}",
    ["8a:612d"] = "Hi. Welcome to our\nTRAINING HALL.\fYou may battle a\ntrainer once per\vday.{DONE}",
    ["8a:6177"] = "{STRBUF} is your\nopponent today.{DONE}",
    ["8a:6194"] = "Would you like to\nbattle?{DONE}",
    ["8a:61af"] = "Please go right\nthrough.\fYou may begin\nright away.{DONE}",
    ["8a:61e3"] = "Sorry. Only those\ntrainers who will\fbe battling are\nallowed to go in.{DONE}",
    ["8a:622a"] = "I'm sorry.\nThis would be your\fsecond time today.\nYou're permitted\fto enter just once\na day.{DONE}",
    ["8a:6285"] = "I lost…\nDarn…{DONE}",
    ["8a:6294"] = "I lost…\nNot so zesty.{DONE}",
    ["8a:62ab"] = "This is good data!\nI can use this.{DONE}",
    ["8a:62cf"] = "Aw, shucks…\fAnd I didn't even\nget to use my\v'Essence of\vBreaker Style'…{DONE}",
    ["8a:6317"] = "I traveled out\nhere just so I\vcould battle you.{DONE}",
    ["8a:6348"] = "Hey, what's up?{DONE}",
    ["8a:6358"] = "I'm trying to\ngain battle\vexperience\ffor a game I'm\nmaking based on\vPOKéMON.{DONE}",
    ["8a:63a1"] = "You look pretty\nstrong, eh?{DONE}",
    ["8a:6416"] = "Who are you?\fWell, it's plain\nto see that you're\va trainer…\fMy name's BLUE.\fI was once the\nCHAMPION, although\fit was for only a\nshort time…\fThat meddling RED\ndid me in…\fAnyway, what do\nyou want? You want\fto challenge me or\nsomething?\f…I hate to say\nit, but I'm not in\fthe mood for a\nbattle now.\fTake a good look\naround you…\fA volcano erupts,\nand just like\fthat, a whole town\ndisappears.\fWe can go on win-\nning and losing in\fPOKéMON. But if\nnature so much as\ftwitches, we can\nlose in a second.\f…\fThat's the way it\nis…\fBut, anyway, I'm\nstill a trainer.\fIf I see a strong\nopponent, it makes\vme want to battle.\fIf you want to\nbattle me, come to\vthe VIRIDIAN GYM.\fI'm looking\nafter one of RED's\flegendary birds,\nso you better\fcome ready for\na real fight.\fCome visit me\nin VIRIDIAN.\fI'll take you on\nthen.{DONE}",
    ["8a:672b"] = "There's a notice\nhere…\fCINNABAR GYM has\nrelocated to SEA-\vFOAM ISLANDS.\fBLAINE{DONE}",
    ["8a:677a"] = "CINNABAR ISLAND\fThe Fiery Town of\nBurning Desire{DONE}",
    ["8a:6908"] = "Awright! I'll show\nyou the power of\vmountain POKéMON!{DONE}",
    ["8a:693b"] = "Mercy! You showed\nme your power!{DONE}",
    ["8a:695d"] = "It's over. I don't\nmind. We HIKERS\vare like that.{DONE}",
    ["8a:698e"] = "I'm raising POKé-\nMON too!\fWill you battle\nwith me?{DONE}",
    ["8a:69bf"] = "Wha…?{DONE}",
    ["8a:69c6"] = "I did my best but\ncame up short.\fNo excuses--I\nadmit I lost.{DONE}",
    ["8a:6a04"] = "I raise POKéMON\ntoo!\fWill you battle\nwith me?{DONE}",
    ["8a:6a30"] = "Oh, rats!{DONE}",
    ["8a:6a3b"] = "I've been to many\nGYMS, but the GYM\fin GOLDENROD is my\nfavorite.\fIt's filled with\npretty flowers!{DONE}",
    ["8a:6a9c"] = "Aww… I keep losing\nall the time!\fI'll just have to\ntry harder!\fAnyway, thanks for\nbattling me again\fand again. Here's\nthat present from\vthe other time.{DONE}",
    ["8a:6b33"] = "ROUTE 46\nMOUNTAIN RD. AHEAD{DONE}",
    ["8a:6c2a"] = "Bow down before my\nregal POKéMON!{DONE}",
    ["8a:6c4a"] = "How… How dare you\nmock royalty!{DONE}",
    ["8a:6c6b"] = "Doesn't everyone\nwish to someday be\va king?{DONE}",
    ["8a:6c97"] = "Nihihi! Would you\nlike to battle my\vPIKACHU gang?{DONE}",
    ["8a:6cca"] = "PI-PIKACHU!{DONE}",
    ["8a:6cd7"] = "You look like you\nhave many POKéMON,\fbut PIKACHU is\nstill the best.{DONE}",
    ["8a:6d19"] = "Agility is the key\nattribute of bird\vPOKéMON.{DONE}",
    ["8a:6d45"] = "You beat me with\nyour speed…{DONE}",
    ["8a:6d63"] = "Your POKéMON are\nremarkably well-\vtrained.{DONE}",
    ["8a:6d8c"] = "Check out my POKé-\nMON. Just look at\ftheir coloring and\ntheir plumage.{DONE}",
    ["8a:6dd1"] = "Shoot!\nNot good enough!{DONE}",
    ["8a:6dea"] = "If you groom them,\nPOKéMON get happy.{DONE}",
    ["8a:6e0e"] = "I should go to\nROCK TUNNEL to get\vmyself an ONIX.{DONE}",
    ["8a:6e41"] = "I lost…{DONE}",
    ["8a:6e4a"] = "Geological fea-\ntures don't appear\vto change.\fBut they actually\nchange, little by\vlittle.{DONE}",
    ["8a:6ea4"] = "TRAINER TIPS\fLook! Right there,\nat the left side\vof the post.{DONE}",
    ["8a:6ee3"] = "ROUTE 13\fNORTH TO SILENCE\nBRIDGE{DONE}",
    ["8a:6f05"] = "NORTH TO LAVENDER\nTOWN\fWEST TO FUCHSIA\nCITY{DONE}",
    ["8a:6ff6"] = "Is that right?\fI'm the GAME\nDESIGNER!\fFilling up your\nPOKéDEX is tough,\vbut don't give up!{DONE}",
    ["8a:704d"] = "Wow! Excellent!\nYou completed your\vPOKéDEX!\fCongratulations!{DONE}",
    ["8a:7088"] = "…{DONE}",
    ["8a:708b"] = "The GRAPHIC ARTIST\nwill print out a\vDIPLOMA for you.\fYou should go show\nit off.{DONE}",
    ["8a:70dc"] = "I'm the GRAPHIC\nARTIST.\fI drew you!{DONE}",
    ["8a:7100"] = "I'm the GRAPHIC\nARTIST.\fOh, you completed\nyour POKéDEX?\fWant me to print\nout your DIPLOMA?{DONE}",
    ["8a:7158"] = "Give me a shout if\nyou want your\vDIPLOMA printed.{DONE}",
    ["8a:71bd"] = "Who, me? I'm the\nPROGRAMMER.\fPlay the slot\nmachines!{DONE}",
    ["8a:71f2"] = "Aren't the TWINS\nadorable?\fJASMINE's pretty\ntoo.\fOh, I love them!{DONE}",
    ["8a:7233"] = "GAME FREAK\nDEVELOPMENT ROOM{DONE}",
    ["8a:7250"] = "It's a detailed\ndrawing of a\vpretty girl.{DONE}",
    ["8a:727a"] = "It's the game\nprogram. Messing\fwith it could put\na bug in the game!{DONE}",
    ["8a:72be"] = "It's crammed with\nreference materi-\vals. There's even\va POKé DOLL.{DONE}",
    ["8a:737f"] = "Did you meet the\nPOKéMANIAC?\fHe's always brag-\nging about his\vrare POKéMON.{DONE}",
    ["8a:73c5"] = "The POKéMON GYM\ntrainers here are\vmacho bullies.\fIf I stick around,\nthey might come\vafter me.\fHere's some ad-\nvice: the GYM\fLEADER uses the\nFIGHTING-type.\fSo you should\nconfound him with\vpsychic POKéMON.\fWipe out his POKé-\nMON before they\fcan use their\nphysical strength.\fAnd those boulders\nin the middle of\vthe GYM?\fIf you don't move\nthem correctly,\fyou won't reach\nthe GYM LEADER.\fIf you get stuck,\ngo outside.{DONE}",
    ["8a:7557"] = "{PLAYER}! You won!\nI could tell by\vlooking at you!{DONE}",
    ["8a:7669"] = "I love showing off\nthe POKéMON that\fI've raised.\nDon't you?\fI'm going to get\ninto a bunch of\fbattles, and show\noff my POKéMON!{DONE}",
    ["8a:77af"] = "My MILTANK ain't\ngivin' me milk\vn'more.\fThis here FARM's\ngot famous milk.\fMost everyone\nwants a drink.\fIt'll give me lots\no' milk if'n I\ffeed it lots o'\nBERRIES, I reckon.{DONE}",
    ["8a:7858"] = "How'd you like my\nMOOMOO MILK?\fIt's my pride and\njoy, there.\fGive it to POKéMON\nto restore HP!\fI'll give it to ya\nfer just ¥500.{DONE}",
    ["8a:78d4"] = "Here ya go!\nDrink up'n enjoy!{DONE}",
    ["8a:78f3"] = "Sorry, there.\nNo cash, no sale!{DONE}",
    ["8a:7914"] = "I reckon yer\nPACK's full.{DONE}",
    ["8a:792e"] = "You don't want it?\nCome again, hear?{DONE}",
    ["8a:7953"] = "I best go do my\nmilkin'.{DONE}",
    ["8a:796d"] = "Our milk even goes\nout to KANTO.\fSo if our own\nMILTANK won't give\fus any milk, we're\nin trouble.{DONE}",
    ["8a:79cd"] = "You fixed our\nMILTANK, hon. Now\fit gives MOOMOO\nMILK again.\fHere's somethin'\nfer your trouble.{DONE}",
    ["8a:7a44"] = "That there's\nSNORE.\fIt's a rare move\nthat only works\fwhile the POKéMON\nis asleep.\fYou best think how\nyou ought to use\vit, hon.{DONE}",
    ["8a:7bea"] = "Wow, your POKéGEAR\nis impressive!\fDid your mom get\nit for you?{DONE}",
    ["8a:7c27"] = "Wait, {PLAYER}!{DONE}",
    ["8a:7c31"] = "What do you think\nyou're doing?{DONE}",
    ["8a:7c51"] = "It's dangerous to\ngo out without a\vPOKéMON!\fWild POKéMON\njump out of the\fgrass on the way\nto the next town.{DONE}",
    ["8a:7cb7"] = "Oh! Your POKéMON\nis adorable!\vI wish I had one!{DONE}",
    ["8a:7ce5"] = "Hi, {PLAYER}!\nLeaving again?\fYou should tell\nyour mom if you\vare leaving.{DONE}",
    ["8a:7d29"] = "Call your mom on\nyour POKéGEAR to\flet her know how\nyou're doing.{DONE}",
    ["8a:7d67"] = "Yo, {PLAYER}!\fI hear PROF.ELM\ndiscovered some\vnew POKéMON.{DONE}",
    ["8a:7d99"] = "……\fSo this is the\nfamous ELM POKéMON\vLAB…{DONE}",
    ["8a:7dc0"] = "…What are you\nstaring at?{DONE}",
    ["8a:7ddb"] = "NEW BARK TOWN\fThe Town Where the\nWinds of a New\vBeginning Blow{DONE}",
    ["8a:7e1b"] = "{PLAYER}'s HOUSE{DONE}",
    ["8a:7e25"] = "ELM POKéMON LAB{DONE}",
    ["8a:7e33"] = "ELM'S HOUSE{DONE}",
    ["8a:7ed6"] = "Oh, dear.\nYou've found me.\fPlease don't tell\nanyone about me.\fI'll give you this\nfor keeping my\vsecret. Please?{DONE}",
    ["8a:7f44"] = "It's tough being a\ntop celebrity.\fEverywhere I go,\npeople chase me.\fI just want to be\nleft alone…{DONE}",
    ["8a:7fa6"] = "FEAROW: Feero!{DONE}",
    ["8b:4056"] = "Myuu...{DONE}",
    ["8b:405f"] = "Hey, kid! Me am a\nTEAM ROCKET member\vkind of guy!\fCome from another\ncountry, a trainer\vnumber one, me!\fThink I did, if\nstop the energy,\fbe big panic for\nhere people!\fSecret it is my\nmission, so tell\vyou I not!\fBut! If win you do\nversus me, a man I\fbe and mine secret\nto you I tell.\fHey, kid! Battle\nbegin we do!{DONE}",
    ["8b:4198"] = "Ayieeeh! No, no,\nno, believe it I\vcan't!\fStrong very much\nbe you! Match I am\vnot to you!{DONE}",
    ["8b:41f1"] = "OK. Tell you mine\nsecret will I.\fMACHINE PART steal\nby me, hide it I\fdid in GYM of the\nCERULEAN.\fInside water put\nit I did. Look for\fin water center of\nGYM at.\fBut you forget me\nnot!\fBeat you for sure\nwill TEAM ROCKET.\fCome from JOHTO\nwill they, mine\ffriends, yes. Will\nrevenge they are.{DONE}",
    ["8b:4312"] = "…\fYou say what? TEAM\nROCKET bye-bye a\fgo-go? Broken it\nis says you?\fOh, no! Should I\ndo what now on\vfrom, me?{DONE}",
    ["8b:4572"] = "I wanted WOBBUFFET,\nbut I was short by\v100 coins…{DONE}",
    ["8b:45a5"] = "Whew…\fI've got to stay\ncalm and cool…\fI can't lose my\ncool, or I'll lose\vall my money…{DONE}",
    ["8b:45fa"] = "Welcome!\fWe exchange your\ncoins for fabulous\vprizes!{DONE}",
    ["8b:4630"] = "Which prize would\nyou like?{DONE}",
    ["8b:464d"] = "OK, so you wanted\na {STRBUF}?{DONE}",
    ["8b:4669"] = "Here you go!{DONE}",
    ["8b:4677"] = "You don't have\nenough coins.{DONE}",
    ["8b:4694"] = "You have no room\nfor it.{DONE}",
    ["8b:46ae"] = "Oh. Please come\nback with coins!{DONE}",
    ["8b:46d0"] = "Oh? You don't have\na COIN CASE.{DONE}",
    ["8b:4766"] = "Have you visited\nPEWTER GYM?\fThe LEADER uses\nROCK-type POKéMON.{DONE}",
    ["8b:47a4"] = "At night, CLEFAIRY\ncome out to play\vat MT.MOON.\fBut not every\nnight.{DONE}",
    ["8b:47ea"] = "Ah, you came all\nthe way out here\vfrom JOHTO?\fThat brings back\nmemories. When I\fwas young, I went\nto JOHTO to train.\fYou remind me so\nmuch of what I was\flike as a young\nman.\fHere. I want you\nto have this item\vI found in JOHTO.{DONE}",
    ["8b:48ce"] = "Going to new, un-\nknown places and\vseeing new people…\fThose are the joys\nof travel.{DONE}",
    ["8b:4923"] = "PEWTER CITY\nA Stone Gray City{DONE}",
    ["8b:4942"] = "PEWTER CITY\nPOKéMON GYM\vLEADER: BROCK\fThe Rock Solid\nPOKéMON Trainer{DONE}",
    ["8b:4982"] = "There's a notice\nhere…\fPEWTER MUSEUM OF\nSCIENCE is closed\vfor renovations…{DONE}",
    ["8b:49cd"] = "There's a notice\nhere…\fMT.MOON GIFT SHOP\nNOW OPEN!{DONE}",
    ["8b:4a00"] = "WELCOME TO\nPEWTER CITY!{DONE}",
    ["8b:4b4b"] = "Have you seen that\nwiggly tree that's\fgrowing on ROUTE\n36?\fMy little sister\ngot all excited\fand went to see\nit…\fI'm worried… Isn't\nit dangerous?{DONE}",
    ["8b:4bda"] = "Do you want to\nborrow the water\fbottle too?\nI don't want you\fdoing anything\ndangerous with it.{DONE}",
    ["8b:4c39"] = "Oh, you're better\nthan WHITNEY…\fYou'll be OK,\nthen. Here's the\vSQUIRTBOTTLE!{DONE}",
    ["8b:4c84"] = "Oh, you\nfound FLORIA…\fHere's a GOLD\nBERRY as thanks!{DONE}",
    ["8b:4cda"] = "Lalala lalalala.\nHave plenty of\vwater, my lovely!{DONE}",
    ["8b:4d0d"] = "When I told my sis\nabout the jiggly\ftree, she told me\nit's dangerous.\fIf I beat WHITNEY,\nI wonder if she'll\flend me her water\nbottle…{DONE}",
    ["8b:4d92"] = "Wow, you beat\nWHITNEY? Cool!{DONE}",
    ["8b:4db0"] = "So it really was a\nPOKéMON!{DONE}",
    ["8b:4edf"] = "Wow, the BATTLE\nTOWER is huge!\fThere must be many\nkinds of POKéMON\vin there!{DONE}",
    ["8b:4f8a"] = "You can use only\nthree POKéMON.\fIt's so hard to\ndecide which three\fshould go into\nbattle…{DONE}",
    ["8b:503b"] = "Hehehe, I snuck\nout from work.\fI can't bail out\nuntil I've won!\fI have to win it\nall. That I must!{DONE}",
    ["8b:50ab"] = "BATTLE TOWER\fTake the Ultimate\nTrainer Challenge!{DONE}",
    ["8b:51c5"] = "Gramps was looking\nfor you.{DONE}",
    ["8b:52b9"] = "I'm the DAY-CARE\nMAN.\fDo you know about\nEGGS?\fI was raising\nPOKéMON with my\vwife, you see.\fWe were shocked to\nfind an EGG!\fHow incredible is\nthat?\fYou know, your\nPOKéDEX shows EGG\vgroups, and how\flong they take to\nhatch!\fWell, wouldn't you\nlike this EGG?\fThen fine, this is\nyours to keep!{DONE}",
    ["8b:53e0"] = "{PLAYER} received\nODD EGG!{DONE}",
    ["8b:53f5"] = "I found that when\nI was caring for\fsomeone's POKéMON\nbefore.\fBut the trainer\ndidn't want the\fEGG, so I'd kept\nit around.{DONE}",
    ["8b:5469"] = "You've no room for\nthis.{DONE}",
    ["8b:558c"] = "I have to\nleave...\fYou two can\nhandle this,\vright?{DONE}",
    ["8b:562b"] = "Arrgh… You found\nthe secret stair-\vway…{DONE}",
    ["8b:5654"] = "Heheh! The experi-\nment worked like a\vcharm.\fMAGIKARP are just\nworthless, but\fGYARADOS are big\nmoneymakers.{DONE}",
    ["8b:56c1"] = "Urrgh…\fThat guy's\nPOKéMON are tough…{DONE}",
    ["8b:56e3"] = "???: NIDOQUEEN,\nHYPER BEAM.{DONE}",
    ["8b:5700"] = "What took you,\n{PLAYER}?\fJust as we\nthought,\fthat strange radio\nsignal is coming\vfrom here.{DONE}",
    ["8b:5756"] = "The stairs are\nright here.{DONE}",
    ["8b:5772"] = "LANCE: {PLAYER}, we\nshould split up to\fcheck this place.\nI'll go first.{DONE}",
    ["8b:58b7"] = "…… …… ……\fIt's been a while,\n{PLAYER}.\f…Since I lost to\nyou, I thought\fabout what I was\nlacking with my\vPOKéMON…\fAnd we came up\nwith an answer.\f{PLAYER}, now we'll\nshow you!{DONE}",
    ["8b:594f"] = "…… …… ……\fI thought I raised\nmy POKéMON to be\fthe best they\ncould be…\f…But it still \nwasn't enough…{DONE}",
    ["8b:59ac"] = "…… …… ……\f…You won, fair\nand square.\fI admit it. But\nthis isn't the\vend.\fI'm going to be\nthe greatest POKé-\vMON trainer ever.\fBecause these guys\nare behind me.\f…Listen, {PLAYER}.\fOne of these days\nI'm going to prove\fhow good I am by\nbeating you.{DONE}",
    ["8b:5a92"] = "…… …… ……\fI've repaid my\ndebt to you.\fWith my POKéMON,\nI'm going to beat\fthe CHAMPION and\nbecome the world's\vgreatest trainer.{DONE}",
    ["8b:5b9f"] = "All the SLOWPOKE\nhave disappeared\vfrom the town.\fThe forest's pro-\ntector may be\vangry with us…\fIt may be a bad\nomen. We should\vstay in.{DONE}",
    ["8b:5c28"] = "The SLOWPOKE have\nreturned…\fBut my APPRENTICE\nhasn't come back\vfrom ILEX FOREST.\fWhere in the world\nis that lazy guy?{DONE}",
    ["8b:5c9e"] = "You chased off\nTEAM ROCKET and\fwent to ILEX\nFOREST alone?\fThat takes guts!\nI like that. Come\vtrain with us.{DONE}",
    ["8b:5d0b"] = "Where have all the\nSLOWPOKE gone?\fAre they out play-\ning somewhere?{DONE}",
    ["8b:5d50"] = "I'm sorry--I for-\ngot to thank you.\fThis is CHARCOAL\nthat I made.\fFIRE-type POKéMON\nwould be happy to\vhold that.{DONE}",
    ["8b:5dbe"] = "The SLOWPOKE came\nback, and you even\vfound FARFETCH'D.\fYou're the cool-\nest, man!{DONE}",
    ["8b:5e10"] = "FARFETCH'D: Kwaa!{DONE}",
    ["8b:5f98"] = "Men of the sea are\nalways spoiling\vfor a good fight!{DONE}",
    ["8b:5fce"] = "Urf!\nI lose!{DONE}",
    ["8b:6016"] = "Hm? This is no\nplace for playing.{DONE}",
    ["8b:6039"] = "Ah! I can see that\nyou're serious.{DONE}",
    ["8b:605c"] = "Up top is a POKé-\nMON that keeps the\vLIGHTHOUSE lit.\fBut I hear that\nit's sick now and\fcan't be cured by\nordinary medicine.{DONE}",
    ["8b:60d4"] = "Man! You're as\ntough as ever!\fAnyway, here's\nthat medicine from\vbefore.{DONE}",
    ["8b:61b3"] = "My bug POKéMON are\ntough. Prepare to\vlose!{DONE}",
    ["8b:61dc"] = "I was whipped…{DONE}",
    ["8b:61ec"] = "I'm going to look\nfor stronger bug\vPOKéMON.{DONE}",
    ["8b:6215"] = "If you walk in\ntall grass wearing\fshorts, do you get\nnicks and cuts?{DONE}",
    ["8b:625b"] = "Ouch, ouch, ouch!{DONE}",
    ["8b:626e"] = "They'll really\nsting when you\vtake a bath.{DONE}",
    ["8b:6299"] = "Why don't girls\nlike bug POKéMON?{DONE}",
    ["8b:62b8"] = "No good!{DONE}",
    ["8b:62c2"] = "Bug POKéMON squish\nlike plush toys\fwhen you squeeze\ntheir bellies.\fI love how they\nfeel!{DONE}",
    ["8b:6319"] = "ROUTE 2\fVIRIDIAN CITY -\nPEWTER CITY{DONE}",
    ["8b:633e"] = "DIGLETT'S CAVE{DONE}",
    ["8b:648c"] = "There is a strange\npresence here…{DONE}",
